window.TLI_DATA = {"project": "tli.cloud: English in Cambodia", "projectKey": "tli-english-cambodia", "version": "1.6.0", "defaultMode": "teacher", "built": "2026-11-06 09:02", "builtISO": "2026-11-06T09:02:28+01:00", "parts": [{"id": "L.0", "title": "Grade 1 English – overview", "order": 0, "goals": ["Place the course in the MoEYS Curriculum Framework (2016) for primary Foreign Languages.", "Show the session structure E1–E9, the Feed up step and the RTTI rubric used in every session.", "Explain how each session works with a teacher and in the self-paced app."], "metadata": {"status": "draft", "audience": "teachers, school leaders, app developers", "grade": "1 (age 6–7)", "subject": "Foreign Languages (English)", "moeys_reference": "Curriculum Framework of General Education and Technical Education (2016) – framework level verified; no official Grade 1 English syllabus found", "cefr_cross_reference": "Pre-A1 (adapted descriptors)", "updated": "2026-11-05 (v1.4)"}, "file": "l0-course-overview.md", "notes": ["<p>Assumptions for Herbert to confirm: pupils are Khmer speakers with no English and are only starting to read Khmer. Decided (v1.4.1): English is taught as a core subject in the Grade 1 Foreign Languages slot of the 2016 framework (2 study hours a week), also when the course is run by an NGO. In practice many public schools start English only in Grade 4 (MoEYS announced English for Grades 4–6, 2 × 40 min a week).</p>\n", "<p>Source: MoEYS, Curriculum Framework of General Education and Technical Education, January 2016 (English version, sections 3.1, 4.2, 5.6, 6.2 Table 2, 7.1, 8.1), copy at nepcambodia.org. English for Grades 4–6, twice a week for 40 minutes: Phnom Penh Post, \"English instruction to expand to new grades\". Not verified: an official MoEYS Grade 1 English syllabus or textbook outcomes and codes (the MoEYS digital library lists an \"English Grade 1\" title but no details could be read). The topics, grammar, words, letters and characters come from our own Grade 1 course plan, not from an official MoEYS syllabus.</p>\n", "<p>Khmer spellings to be checked by a native speaker. Bora also occurs once in the MoEYS English Grade 6 textbook; the course plan keeps it (see open-items.md).</p>\n", "<p>Pictures and audio are not made yet: the course plan has descriptions (prompts) only. The letter cards in the viewer are simple placeholders.</p>\n", "<p>The course plan counts 38 weeks with three sessions a week. The MoEYS framework has a 35-week year and 2 study hours of Foreign Languages a week (70 hours). This viewer follows MoEYS: one session = one 40-minute study hour. How 114 planned sessions fit into 70 study hours is an open item.</p>\n"], "blocks": [{"ref": "L.0 §0 ¶0", "anchor": "p-L.0-0-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "7c2e7adce5", "text": "Grade 1 English – overview", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §1 ¶0", "anchor": "p-L.0-1-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "686c4978fc", "text": "The Cambodian frame (MoEYS)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §1 ¶1", "anchor": "p-L.0-1-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f590a1869f", "text": "The course follows the Curriculum Framework of General Education and Technical Education (MoEYS, 2016) first. CEFR is used only as a cross-reference. Where the framework is silent, the course plan adds detail; CEFR and Cambridge Pre-A1 Starters only fill content.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §1 ¶2", "anchor": "p-L.0-1-2", "kind": "table", "h": "b26fc3ecc7", "text": "MoEYS reference What the framework says What this course does Place in the curriculum Foreign Languages (English or French) is a primary subject; the framework recommends international languages from Grade 1 to 6 as core subjects. English as a core subject (Foreign Languages, living language 1), Grade 1 Core competency 4.2 \"Learners can adequately use foreign languages for communication, research and continued study.\" Every session outcome serves this competency. Foreign Languages goals (section 5.6, quoted) \"Possess competencies in communication in all four skills (listening, speaking, reading and writing).\" \"Become life-long learners with creativity and confidence.\" Sessions start with Listening and Speaking and add one letter per session from Session S001. Subject components Listening, Reading, Speaking, Writing Grade 1 starts with Listening and Speaking, plus one letter per session (recognise, then air-write and copy). Study time, Grades 1–6 2 study hours of Foreign Languages per week; 1 study hour = 40 minutes (6 days, 5 study hours a day) One session = one study hour of 40 minutes; two sessions a week (see the note on weeks below). Expected primary outcome (quoted) \"Construct basic knowledge of Science, Information and Communications Technology (ICT) and Foreign Languages.\" Sessions S001–S006 build the first greetings, I / you / he / she, and the letters A a to F f. Teaching principle 7.1 Teaching facilitates learning \"through learner centered approaches\". Pupils move, speak in pairs and groups, and play; the teacher talks less. Assessment principle 8.1 Assess learners' knowledge, skills, attitude and application skills; assessment gives feedback to improve learning. Feed up, the RTTI rubric and a spoken exit check (E7) in every session; observation, not written tests.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §2 ¶0", "anchor": "p-L.0-2-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "f7340444ea", "text": "Who this course is for", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §2 ¶1", "anchor": "p-L.0-2-1", "kind": "list", "h": "5209f9e3c7", "text": "Pupils: Grade 1, about 6–7 years old, Khmer as first language, no English yet. Setting: primary schools that teach English from Grade 1 – English is taught as a core subject in the Foreign Languages slot of the 2016 framework (2 study hours a week), in public, private or NGO-run classes. Classes of 30–50 pupils are expected. Reading and writing: the focus is Listening and Speaking. Each session adds one letter: pupils recognise it, hear its name and sound, air-write it and copy it. They are not asked to read or write sentences yet.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §3 ¶0", "anchor": "p-L.0-3-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b6f59f08fd", "text": "Characters", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §3 ¶1", "anchor": "p-L.0-3-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "283b36abd2", "text": "The same family and teacher appear in every session.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §3 ¶2", "anchor": "p-L.0-3-2", "kind": "table", "h": "c63685d441", "text": "Name Who Khmer Where Bora boy, twin បូរ៉ា home and school Sreyneang girl, twin ស្រីណាង home and school Yeay Chan grandmother ( yeay = grandmother) យាយចាន់ home Kru Sopheak teacher ( kru = teacher) គ្រូសុភ័ក្ត្រ school", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §4 ¶0", "anchor": "p-L.0-4-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "7631395b22", "text": "A session: E1 to E9", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §4 ¶1", "anchor": "p-L.0-4-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b7e2a269ea", "text": "Every session has the same nine steps.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §4 ¶2", "anchor": "p-L.0-4-2", "kind": "table", "h": "54cf9f8cc0", "text": "Step Name What happens E1 Theme introduction The situation, the words (8–12 at most), the grammar, the letter and the four goals: Reproduction, Training, Transfer, Insight. This is the feed up . E2 Entry readiness A short check: is the pupil ready? Routing if not. E3 Core teaching conversation The teacher plays a character; the pupils answer. One block per RTTI category. E4 Going further Why this works, what to watch out for, a cultural note, the letter. E5 Teacher notes For the teacher only: strong and weak signs per category, common errors. E6 Practice Role-play, pair work, letter practice. E7 Exit check Eight spoken checks (two per category) and one letter check. E8 Formative evaluation What to change next time if a category was weak (at most two changes). E9 Feed forward One short message per pupil for the weakest category.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §4 ¶3", "anchor": "p-L.0-4-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "3b0e852a09", "text": "In the viewer each session also has a 40-minute teacher plan, a self-paced app plan, a quiz and a CEFR cross-reference. A small Function / Form / Vocabulary table sums up each session.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §5 ¶0", "anchor": "p-L.0-5-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "97f4de08ec", "text": "Feed up, feed back, feed forward", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §5 ¶1", "anchor": "p-L.0-5-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "48bb8fde8c", "text": "Every session uses the three feedback questions of Hattie and Timperley (2007):", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §5 ¶2", "anchor": "p-L.0-5-2", "kind": "list", "h": "cb805260cf", "text": "Feed up – Where am I going? (E1) The teacher says the learning goal and shows five success criteria in pupil words, in English and Khmer, each with a picture or gesture cue. Feed back – How am I going? (E7, E8) The teacher tells pupils what they can already do, using the rubric's \"feed back\" sentences. Feed forward – Where to next? (E9) The teacher gives one small next step.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §6 ¶0", "anchor": "p-L.0-6-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "12630d1ae8", "text": "The RTTI rubric", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §6 ¶1", "anchor": "p-L.0-6-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "8dd5944b0a", "text": "RTTI (Drost and Verra) has four categories. They are not a ladder: a pupil can be strong in Transfer and weak in Reproduction.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §6 ¶2", "anchor": "p-L.0-6-2", "kind": "table", "h": "972f49312c", "text": "Category Meaning In Grade 1 English this looks like R – Reproduction Know and say what was taught Says the words and the pattern T1 – Training Use it in the practised situation Does the practised exchange T2 – Transfer Use it in a new situation Uses it with a new person or picture I – Insight Understand why Shows with a gesture or in Khmer why it fits", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §6 ¶3", "anchor": "p-L.0-6-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "fda47df4c2", "text": "Each session's rubric has one row per success criterion: column 1 is the criterion, columns 2–5 are the levels R, T1, T2 and I. A criterion is checked at one level, so its row has one filled cell; the other level cells show \"—\". The filled cell says what to look for, what to do if it is not there yet, the feed-back sentence to say and the E9 feed-forward step. The letter criterion is checked at R.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §6 ¶4", "anchor": "p-L.0-6-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2851357acb", "text": "A pupil passes a session with at least 3 of the 4 Reproduction and Training checks plus the letter. Transfer and Insight are watched; they do not block a pass. The filled cell ends with a colour: green = needed to pass, yellow = watched, with help, red = watched, stretch goal.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §7 ¶0", "anchor": "p-L.0-7-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "eacfc03f32", "text": "Teacher mode and app mode", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §7 ¶1", "anchor": "p-L.0-7-1", "kind": "list", "h": "724755b00c", "text": "Teacher mode: the teacher plays Yeay Chan or Kru Sopheak; gestures and pictures. No electronics needed. Works for 30–50 pupils with only a board and chalk. App mode (self-paced): audio first, pictures instead of written instructions, instant spoken feedback. Instructions in Khmer audio; target words in English audio. No typing; tap, drag and \"say it\" (record and play back). Quiz in both modes: every quiz question is tagged with a success criterion and an RTTI category, so the result says what a pupil can do and what to try next.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §8 ¶0", "anchor": "p-L.0-8-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "f2d3c7da4f", "text": "Sessions S001–S006 (weeks 1–2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §8 ¶1", "anchor": "p-L.0-8-1", "kind": "table", "h": "186f24145d", "text": "Session Week Setting Topic and grammar Letter S001 1 Home, early morning Good morning, Yeay – I am A a S002 1 Home I am / you are B b S003 1 Home, later morning hello or good morning C c S004 2 School door Good morning, teacher D d S005 2 Classroom he is / she is E e S006 2 Classroom please / thank you F f", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §8 ¶2", "anchor": "p-L.0-8-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "bf03b115c6", "text": "One letter per session, in alphabet order. A letter does not bring extra words: there is no apple for A a. Pupils find the letter in a word they already know ( a in name , B in Bora , d in good , e in he ).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §9 ¶0", "anchor": "p-L.0-9-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "c94fa87502", "text": "The rest of the year (planned, not written yet)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §9 ¶1", "anchor": "p-L.0-9-1", "kind": "table", "h": "02e4196f30", "text": "Weeks Topic block 1–3 Greetings (weeks 1–2 are S001–S006) 5–8 Family 10–13 Numbers 1–10 15–18 Colours 20–23 Classroom 25–28 Body 30–33 Animals 35–37 Days", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §9 ¶2", "anchor": "p-L.0-9-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d04574e7e1", "text": "Grammar across the year: to be , subject pronouns, my / your / his / her , this / that , plural -s , a first there is / there are . Letters continue one per session, A to Z.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §9 ¶3", "anchor": "p-L.0-9-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e0a90d973b", "text": "The course plan also has review weeks (4, 9, 14, 19, 24, 29, 34, 38). They are not part of the published progression: every session ends with its own exit check (E7) and feed forward (E9).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §10 ¶0", "anchor": "p-L.0-10-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b8efd777f4", "text": "CEFR cross-reference", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "L.0 §10 ¶1", "anchor": "p-L.0-10-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e674c41256", "text": "Secondary reference only. The sessions aim at CEFR Pre-A1 (Cambridge Pre-A1 Starters, lower). Can-do statements are adapted from the CEFR Companion Volume (2020) Pre-A1 descriptors; they are not an official CEFR test. Letter work matches the Pre-A1 idea of recognising letters (later: spelling one's own name).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}], "html": "<div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7c2e7adce5\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"L.0 §0 ¶0\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-L.0-0-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §0 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §0 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶0</button><h1 data-body=\"1\">Grade 1 English – overview</h1></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"686c4978fc\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"L.0 §1 ¶0\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-L.0-1-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §1 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §1 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">The Cambodian frame (MoEYS)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f590a1869f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"L.0 §1 ¶1\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-L.0-1-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §1 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §1 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">The course follows the <strong>Curriculum Framework of General Education and Technical Education</strong> (MoEYS, 2016) first. CEFR is used only as a cross-reference. Where the framework is silent, the course plan adds detail; CEFR and Cambridge Pre-A1 Starters only fill content.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b26fc3ecc7\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"L.0 §1 ¶2\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-L.0-1-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §1 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §1 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>MoEYS reference</th>\n<th>What the framework says</th>\n<th>What this course does</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Place in the curriculum</td>\n<td>Foreign Languages (English or French) is a primary subject; the framework recommends international languages from Grade 1 to 6 as core subjects.</td>\n<td>English as a core subject (Foreign Languages, living language 1), Grade 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Core competency 4.2</td>\n<td>\"Learners can adequately use foreign languages for communication, research and continued study.\"</td>\n<td>Every session outcome serves this competency.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Foreign Languages goals (section 5.6, quoted)</td>\n<td>\"Possess competencies in communication in all four skills (listening, speaking, reading and writing).\" \"Become life-long learners with creativity and confidence.\"</td>\n<td>Sessions start with Listening and Speaking and add one letter per session from Session S001.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Subject components</td>\n<td>Listening, Reading, Speaking, Writing</td>\n<td>Grade 1 starts with Listening and Speaking, plus one letter per session (recognise, then air-write and copy).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Study time, Grades 1–6</td>\n<td>2 study hours of Foreign Languages per week; 1 study hour = 40 minutes (6 days, 5 study hours a day)</td>\n<td>One session = one study hour of 40 minutes; two sessions a week (see the note on weeks below).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Expected primary outcome (quoted)</td>\n<td>\"Construct basic knowledge of Science, Information and Communications Technology (ICT) and Foreign Languages.\"</td>\n<td>Sessions S001–S006 build the first greetings, I / you / he / she, and the letters A a to F f.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Teaching principle 7.1</td>\n<td>Teaching facilitates learning \"through learner centered approaches\".</td>\n<td>Pupils move, speak in pairs and groups, and play; the teacher talks less.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Assessment principle 8.1</td>\n<td>Assess learners' knowledge, skills, attitude and application skills; assessment gives feedback to improve learning.</td>\n<td>Feed up, the RTTI rubric and a spoken exit check (E7) in every session; observation, not written tests.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f7340444ea\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"L.0 §2 ¶0\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-L.0-2-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §2 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §2 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Who this course is for</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5209f9e3c7\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"L.0 §2 ¶1\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-L.0-2-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §2 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §2 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶1</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Pupils:</strong> Grade 1, about 6–7 years old, Khmer as first language, no English yet.</li>\n<li><strong>Setting:</strong> primary schools that teach English from Grade 1 – English is taught as a core subject in the Foreign Languages slot of the 2016 framework (2 study hours a week), in public, private or NGO-run classes. Classes of 30–50 pupils are expected.</li>\n<li><strong>Reading and writing:</strong> the focus is Listening and Speaking. Each session adds one letter: pupils recognise it, hear its name and sound, air-write it and copy it. They are not asked to read or write sentences yet.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b6f59f08fd\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"L.0 §3 ¶0\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-L.0-3-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §3 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §3 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Characters</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"283b36abd2\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"L.0 §3 ¶1\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-L.0-3-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §3 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §3 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">The same family and teacher appear in every session.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c63685d441\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"L.0 §3 ¶2\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-L.0-3-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §3 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §3 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Who</th>\n<th>Khmer</th>\n<th>Where</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Bora</td>\n<td>boy, twin</td>\n<td>បូរ៉ា</td>\n<td>home and school</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sreyneang</td>\n<td>girl, twin</td>\n<td>ស្រីណាង</td>\n<td>home and school</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Yeay Chan</td>\n<td>grandmother (<em>yeay</em> = grandmother)</td>\n<td>យាយចាន់</td>\n<td>home</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kru Sopheak</td>\n<td>teacher (<em>kru</em> = teacher)</td>\n<td>គ្រូសុភ័ក្ត្រ</td>\n<td>school</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7631395b22\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"L.0 §4 ¶0\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-L.0-4-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §4 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §4 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">A session: E1 to E9</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b7e2a269ea\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"L.0 §4 ¶1\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-L.0-4-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §4 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §4 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Every session has the same nine steps.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"54cf9f8cc0\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"L.0 §4 ¶2\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-L.0-4-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §4 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §4 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Step</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>What happens</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>E1</td>\n<td>Theme introduction</td>\n<td>The situation, the words (8–12 at most), the grammar, the letter and the four goals: Reproduction, Training, Transfer, Insight. This is the <strong>feed up</strong>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2</td>\n<td>Entry readiness</td>\n<td>A short check: is the pupil ready? Routing if not.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E3</td>\n<td>Core teaching conversation</td>\n<td>The teacher plays a character; the pupils answer. One block per RTTI category.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E4</td>\n<td>Going further</td>\n<td>Why this works, what to watch out for, a cultural note, the letter.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E5</td>\n<td>Teacher notes</td>\n<td>For the teacher only: strong and weak signs per category, common errors.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E6</td>\n<td>Practice</td>\n<td>Role-play, pair work, letter practice.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E7</td>\n<td>Exit check</td>\n<td>Eight spoken checks (two per category) and one letter check.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E8</td>\n<td>Formative evaluation</td>\n<td>What to change next time if a category was weak (at most two changes).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E9</td>\n<td>Feed forward</td>\n<td>One short message per pupil for the weakest category.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3b0e852a09\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"L.0 §4 ¶3\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-L.0-4-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §4 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §4 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">In the viewer each session also has a 40-minute teacher plan, a self-paced app plan, a quiz and a CEFR cross-reference. A small <strong>Function / Form / Vocabulary</strong> table sums up each session.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"97f4de08ec\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"L.0 §5 ¶0\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-L.0-5-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §5 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §5 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Feed up, feed back, feed forward</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"48bb8fde8c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"L.0 §5 ¶1\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-L.0-5-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §5 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §5 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Every session uses the three feedback questions of Hattie and Timperley (2007):</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"cb805260cf\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"L.0 §5 ¶2\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-L.0-5-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §5 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §5 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶2</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Feed up – Where am I going?</strong> (E1) The teacher says the learning goal and shows five success criteria in pupil words, in English and Khmer, each with a picture or gesture cue.</li>\n<li><strong>Feed back – How am I going?</strong> (E7, E8) The teacher tells pupils what they can already do, using the rubric's \"feed back\" sentences.</li>\n<li><strong>Feed forward – Where to next?</strong> (E9) The teacher gives one small next step.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"12630d1ae8\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"L.0 §6 ¶0\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-L.0-6-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §6 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §6 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">The RTTI rubric</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8dd5944b0a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"L.0 §6 ¶1\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-L.0-6-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §6 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §6 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">RTTI (Drost and Verra) has four categories. They are not a ladder: a pupil can be strong in Transfer and weak in Reproduction.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"972f49312c\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"L.0 §6 ¶2\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-L.0-6-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §6 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §6 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Category</th>\n<th>Meaning</th>\n<th>In Grade 1 English this looks like</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>R – Reproduction</td>\n<td>Know and say what was taught</td>\n<td>Says the words and the pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T1 – Training</td>\n<td>Use it in the practised situation</td>\n<td>Does the practised exchange</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T2 – Transfer</td>\n<td>Use it in a new situation</td>\n<td>Uses it with a new person or picture</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I – Insight</td>\n<td>Understand why</td>\n<td>Shows with a gesture or in Khmer why it fits</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"fda47df4c2\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"L.0 §6 ¶3\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-L.0-6-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §6 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §6 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">Each session's rubric has one row per success criterion: column 1 is the criterion, columns 2–5 are the levels R, T1, T2 and I. A criterion is checked at one level, so its row has one filled cell; the other level cells show \"—\". The filled cell says what to look for, what to do if it is not there yet, the feed-back sentence to say and the E9 feed-forward step. The letter criterion is checked at R.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2851357acb\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"L.0 §6 ¶4\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-L.0-6-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §6 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §6 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\">A pupil passes a session with at least 3 of the 4 Reproduction and Training checks plus the letter. Transfer and Insight are watched; they do not block a pass. The filled cell ends with a colour: <strong>green</strong> = needed to pass, <strong>yellow</strong> = watched, with help, <strong>red</strong> = watched, stretch goal.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"eacfc03f32\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"L.0 §7 ¶0\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-L.0-7-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §7 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §7 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Teacher mode and app mode</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"724755b00c\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"L.0 §7 ¶1\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-L.0-7-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §7 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §7 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶1</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Teacher mode:</strong> the teacher plays Yeay Chan or Kru Sopheak; gestures and pictures. No electronics needed. Works for 30–50 pupils with only a board and chalk.</li>\n<li><strong>App mode (self-paced):</strong> audio first, pictures instead of written instructions, instant spoken feedback. Instructions in Khmer audio; target words in English audio. No typing; tap, drag and \"say it\" (record and play back).</li>\n<li><strong>Quiz in both modes:</strong> every quiz question is tagged with a success criterion and an RTTI category, so the result says what a pupil can do and what to try next.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f2d3c7da4f\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"L.0 §8 ¶0\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-L.0-8-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §8 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §8 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Sessions S001–S006 (weeks 1–2)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"186f24145d\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"L.0 §8 ¶1\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-L.0-8-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §8 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §8 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Session</th>\n<th>Week</th>\n<th>Setting</th>\n<th>Topic and grammar</th>\n<th>Letter</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>S001</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Home, early morning</td>\n<td>Good morning, Yeay – <em>I am</em></td>\n<td>A a</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S002</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Home</td>\n<td><em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em></td>\n<td>B b</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S003</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Home, later morning</td>\n<td><em>hello</em> or <em>good morning</em></td>\n<td>C c</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S004</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>School door</td>\n<td>Good morning, teacher</td>\n<td>D d</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S005</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Classroom</td>\n<td><em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em></td>\n<td>E e</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S006</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Classroom</td>\n<td><em>please</em> / <em>thank you</em></td>\n<td>F f</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"bf03b115c6\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"L.0 §8 ¶2\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-L.0-8-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §8 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §8 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">One letter per session, in alphabet order. A letter does not bring extra words: there is no <em>apple</em> for A a. Pupils find the letter in a word they already know (<em>a</em> in <em>name</em>, <em>B</em> in <em>Bora</em>, <em>d</em> in <em>good</em>, <em>e</em> in <em>he</em>).</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c94fa87502\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"L.0 §9 ¶0\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-L.0-9-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §9 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §9 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">The rest of the year (planned, not written yet)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"02e4196f30\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"L.0 §9 ¶1\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-L.0-9-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §9 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §9 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Weeks</th>\n<th>Topic block</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1–3</td>\n<td>Greetings (weeks 1–2 are S001–S006)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5–8</td>\n<td>Family</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10–13</td>\n<td>Numbers 1–10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15–18</td>\n<td>Colours</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20–23</td>\n<td>Classroom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25–28</td>\n<td>Body</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30–33</td>\n<td>Animals</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>35–37</td>\n<td>Days</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d04574e7e1\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"L.0 §9 ¶2\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-L.0-9-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §9 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §9 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Grammar across the year: <em>to be</em>, subject pronouns, <em>my / your / his / her</em>, <em>this / that</em>, plural <em>-s</em>, a first <em>there is / there are</em>. Letters continue one per session, A to Z.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e0a90d973b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"L.0 §9 ¶3\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-L.0-9-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §9 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §9 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">The course plan also has review weeks (4, 9, 14, 19, 24, 29, 34, 38). They are not part of the published progression: every session ends with its own exit check (E7) and feed forward (E9).</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b8efd777f4\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"L.0 §10 ¶0\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-L.0-10-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §10 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §10 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">CEFR cross-reference</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e674c41256\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"L.0 §10 ¶1\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-L.0-10-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference L.0 §10 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"L.0 §10 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Secondary reference only. The sessions aim at CEFR <strong>Pre-A1</strong> (Cambridge Pre-A1 Starters, lower). Can-do statements are adapted from the CEFR Companion Volume (2020) Pre-A1 descriptors; they are not an official CEFR test. Letter work matches the Pre-A1 idea of recognising letters (later: spelling one's own name).</p></div>"}, {"id": "S.1", "title": "Session S001: Good morning, Yeay", "order": 1, "goals": ["Course plan outcome: Pupils say good morning and their own name (Listening and Speaking), and recognise and copy the letter A a.", "Success criterion 1: I can say good morning and my name.", "Success criterion 2: I can answer when someone asks my name.", "Success criterion 3: I can greet a new person the same way.", "Success criterion 4: I know that we add the name after good morning.", "Success criterion 5: I can point to A a and copy it."], "metadata": {"status": "draft", "grade": "1", "week": "1", "session": "S001", "setting": "Home, early morning", "characters": "Bora, Sreyneang, Yeay Chan", "subject": "Foreign Languages (English)", "moeys_reference": "see L.0 §1 (Curriculum Framework 2016)", "cefr_cross_reference": "Pre-A1 (adapted, CEFR Companion Volume)", "duration": "one study hour (40 min)", "updated": "2026-11-06 (v1.6.0)"}, "file": "s001-good-morning-yeay.md", "notes": ["<p>Khmer words and pupil sentences to be verified by a native speaker (Grade 1 level). Khmer spelling of the character names (Yeay យាយ, Kru គ្រូ, Bora បូរ៉ា, Sreyneang ស្រីណាង, Sopheak សុភ័ក្ត្រ, Chan ចាន់) also to be verified.</p>\n", "<p>The minute split is ours; the course plan gives the E1–E9 steps but no timings. With 30–50 pupils, E7 is done with a sample of pupils each session, so every pupil is checked across the week.</p>\n", "<p>CEFR Pre-A1 describes recognising letters but prescribes no order for the alphabet. The order (one letter per session, A a to F f in weeks 1–2) comes from the course plan.</p>\n"], "blocks": [{"ref": "S.1 §0 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-0-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "e0ace45ecb", "text": "Session S001: Good morning, Yeay", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §0 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-0-1", "kind": "figure", "h": "da39a3ee5e", "text": "", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §0 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-0-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "4d371440da", "text": "Week 1 · Home, early morning · Bora, Sreyneang, Yeay Chan.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §0 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-0-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "82a0e548fa", "text": "Yeay Chan greets the twins Bora and Sreyneang at home. Say good morning and your name. New letter: A a .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §1 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-1-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "025eec04ab", "text": "MoEYS frame", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §1 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-1-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ac36d97d4a", "text": "This session serves the MoEYS frame in L.0 §1 ¶2 : core competency 4.2, the Listening and Speaking components plus one letter, and one 40-minute study hour.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §1 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-1-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2baba6e82b", "text": "Session syllabus:", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §1 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-1-3", "kind": "table", "h": "0f0f1acdc9", "text": "Function Form Vocabulary Grammar Letter Greeting someone at home in the morning; saying your name Good morning, Yeay! – What is your name? – I am Bora. good morning, name, I (hello, you: recognize) to be: I am A a", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §2 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-2-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "5a49743b7a", "text": "Feed up (E1: theme introduction)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §2 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-2-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "8b7942ee83", "text": "Yeay Chan is already awake. The house is quiet. Bora and Sreyneang come out of the sleeping room. She greets each child by name.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §2 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-2-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "9e822f12d8", "text": "Situational: a grandmother greets two grandchildren in the morning. Broad: greeting someone you live with.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §2 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-2-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ee2df6466a", "text": "Scene: picture morning at home (to be drawn)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §3 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-3-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "7660a32c11", "text": "Words this session", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §3 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-3-1", "kind": "table", "h": "3c4f120b1a", "text": "Word Role good morning reproduce name reproduce I reproduce hello recognize you recognize", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §3 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-3-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "53931d5e54", "text": "Keep the active list this short. Do not add family-role words yet.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §4 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-4-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "dd17342cb4", "text": "Grammar", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §4 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-4-1", "kind": "list", "h": "5da9f97e97", "text": "Primary: I am (identity: I am Bora. ) Reach-ahead: What is your name? / My name is … — children hear and copy. Do not explain is .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §5 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-5-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "f7c6b8a70c", "text": "Letters (MoEYS)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §5 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-5-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "55d56e376a", "text": "Card: letter card A a", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §5 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-5-2", "kind": "table", "h": "32feac4209", "text": "Letter A a Name A Sound /æ/ as in am ( I am ) Whole word Point to a in name (already a session word). Do not add apple . Write Air-write, then copy A a . If the child's Latin-script name uses A/a , copy that letter too.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §5 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-5-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "bd67b83913", "text": "Kindergarten already has Latin letters. This is English use of the same script.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §6 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-6-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "da75f75ee9", "text": "By the end of this session you will be able to:", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §6 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-6-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §6 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-6-2", "kind": "list", "h": "e30fc84ac0", "text": "Say good morning and say your own name. Point to A a (name or sound).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §6 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-6-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §6 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.1-6-4", "kind": "list", "h": "117719f958", "text": "Answer when someone asks your name, and say good morning back.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §6 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.1-6-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §6 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.1-6-6", "kind": "list", "h": "5be156a0ee", "text": "Greet the teacher the same way — good morning plus a name.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §6 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.1-6-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §6 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.1-6-8", "kind": "list", "h": "6ba0edf476", "text": "Notice that good morning stays the same. Adding the name is how we show care.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §7 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-7-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "52f7c040c5", "text": "Words with Khmer", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §7 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-7-1", "kind": "table", "h": "f284c1f193", "text": "Word Khmer good morning អរុណសួស្តី name ឈ្មោះ I ខ្ញុំ hello សួស្តី you អ្នក", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §7 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-7-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a336b8b56a", "text": "Learning goal: Today we say good morning and our name.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §7 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-7-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "aa3b0dba62", "text": "In Khmer: ថ្ងៃនេះ យើងនិយាយ good morning និងប្រាប់ឈ្មោះរបស់យើង។", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §7 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.1-7-4", "kind": "table", "h": "a821d18e58", "text": "# Success criterion (pupil words) RTTI Khmer (pupil words) Picture or gesture cue 1 I can say good morning and my name. Reproduction (R) ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ good morning និងឈ្មោះរបស់ខ្ញុំ។ wave, then hand on chest 2 I can answer when someone asks my name. Training (T1) ខ្ញុំអាចឆ្លើយ ពេលគេសួរឈ្មោះខ្ញុំ។ hand to ear 3 I can greet a new person the same way. Transfer (T2) ខ្ញុំអាចសួរសុខទុក្ខមនុស្សថ្មីតាមរបៀបដដែល។ point to a friend 4 I know that we add the name after good morning . Insight (I) ខ្ញុំដឹងថា យើងបន្ថែមឈ្មោះក្រោយ good morning។ heart 5 I can point to A a and copy it. Letter (R) ខ្ញុំអាចចង្អុល A a ហើយចម្លងវា។ air-write A", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §7 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.1-7-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "40bea74885", "text": "Criteria 1–4 are the four goals above in pupil words; criterion 5 is the letter. Draw the five cues on the board and point to them at the start and at the end.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §8 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-8-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "a343dabcab", "text": "RTTI rubric for the teacher", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §8 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-8-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "fa9039d2ed", "text": "RTTI categories: R Reproduction, T1 Training, T2 Transfer, I Insight. They are categories, not a ladder: a pupil can be strong in Transfer and weak in Reproduction. Pass rule (E7): at least 3 of the 4 Reproduction and Training checks, plus the letter. Transfer and Insight are watched; they do not block a pass.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §8 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-8-2", "kind": "table", "h": "ed635a6f99", "text": "Criterion R – Reproduction T1 – Training T2 – Transfer I – Insight 1. I can say good morning and my name. Look for: good morning is clear, name is the child's own. If not yet: silence, or a giggle with no words. Prompt with the first syllable, not the whole phrase. Say: \"You said it clearly.\" Next (E9): You already have good morning . Tomorrow we say it together two more times, then you say your name. Keep A a — point to it once at home if you have a paper A. Needed to pass. (rated green) — — — 2. I can answer when someone asks my name. — Look for: greeting and name come as one short exchange. If not yet: child can say the words only when you say them first, every time. Stay in E3 one more loop. Say: \"You answered by yourself.\" Next (E9): You can greet Yeay. Next time, try I am and your name in the same breath. Needed to pass. (rated green) — — 3. I can greet a new person the same way. — — Look for: child greets you, or one classmate, without the Yeay picture. If not yet: child only speaks when facing that picture. Stay in the same room. Do not move this to the school door yet. Say: \"You did it with someone new.\" Next (E9): You greeted Yeay clearly. Next time we try the same good morning with one friend. Watched, with help. (rated yellow) — 4. I know that we add the name after good morning . — — — Look for: child can point to Yeay vs a friend and still choose good morning , then add the right name. If not yet: child thinks English has a special grandmother word. Do not force a spoken explanation. A point is enough this week. Say: \"You showed me why.\" Next (E9): You are learning when a name follows good morning . That comes slowly. We will try it again with the teacher. Watched, stretch goal. (rated red) 5. I can point to A a and copy it. (letter) Look for: Points to A a and copies it (air-write counts). If not yet: Points to the wrong card: say the name and sound again, air-write together. Say: \"You found A.\" Next (E9): \"Look for a in your name or on the board.\" Nee", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §9 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-9-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "ba0b563256", "text": "E2: Entry readiness", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §9 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-9-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "3e97b590ad", "text": "Teacher speaks. The child answers by speaking, pointing, or tracing. Pointing at a letter card is reading.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §9 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-9-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §9 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-9-3", "kind": "list", "h": "825d2bddda", "text": "Point to the picture that shows morning at home. (Use picture morning at home (to be drawn) and one night-time distractor if you have it.) Say your name. Point to A a (letter card A a). Say the letter name A or the sound /æ/.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §9 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.1-9-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §9 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.1-9-5", "kind": "list", "h": "0e3cb59aef", "text": "Point to yourself, then point to the teacher.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §9 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.1-9-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "48e165d43a", "text": "Routing: 3–4 confident = you may move quickly through E3. Any unsure = do E3–E6 in full. This is the first English session. Almost every child should do the full path.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b2a0279bfc", "text": "E3: Core teaching conversation", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "13748d40b1", "text": "Setting: the twins' home, early morning. Default learner role: Bora or Sreyneang. Either twin role is fine. Switch if a child wants Yeay's lines.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c4ff4dfad2", "text": "Audio: recording home greetings (to be recorded)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ba7ca09fdf", "text": "Yeay Chan: Good morning, Bora!", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "8ed7fc7ade", "text": "Bora: Good morning, Yeay!", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e422410db1", "text": "Yeay Chan: Good morning, Sreyneang!", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5b176c8144", "text": "Sreyneang: Good morning, Yeay!", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7b2ef37015", "text": "Yeay Chan: Bora, what is your name?", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "8b2c895baa", "text": "Bora: I am Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶11", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-11", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "75e2f08f27", "text": "Yeay Chan: Sreyneang, what is your name?", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶12", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-12", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "523d57e406", "text": "Sreyneang: I am Sreyneang.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶13", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-13", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "76078cb665", "text": "Children repeat the greetings from the Reproduction block, then these name lines, both sides.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶14", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-14", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶15", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-15", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a50e892767", "text": "New person, same words. Child turns to the teacher:", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶16", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-16", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "481fb15ff9", "text": "Child: Good morning, [teacher name]!", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶17", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-17", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ec783d1a67", "text": "Teacher: Good morning. What is your name?", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶18", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-18", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d69e247844", "text": "Child: I am [own name].", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶19", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-19", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §10 ¶20", "anchor": "p-S.1-10-20", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "43d690ca26", "text": "Say this in Khmer if needed, then point at the English lines. In Khmer we change the greeting for Yeay. In English we can still say good morning . We add Yeay after it. That is the respect.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §11 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-11-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "d10e9904fa", "text": "E4: Going further", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §11 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-11-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "26b1352b50", "text": "Read to the children in Khmer or very slow English. Do not turn this into a lecture.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §11 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-11-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §11 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-11-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "475f711364", "text": "Why this works Yeay Chan says each child's name. Good morning, Bora is warmer than good morning alone. Bora answers with Good morning, Yeay — he gives the name back.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §11 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.1-11-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §11 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.1-11-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c935c520ee", "text": "Watch out for", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §11 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.1-11-6", "kind": "list", "h": "feed37eedc", "text": "Whispering the name so nobody hears it. Ask once more, softly, face to face. Good morning teacher said at home to Yeay. The pattern is good morning + the name you use for that person. Copying I am Bora when the child is not Bora. Use the child's real name from the first answer.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §11 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.1-11-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §11 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.1-11-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c55fe2eae4", "text": "Cultural context Khmer greetings mark age and family ( yeay , ming , pu ). English good morning does not change. The name after it does the work that the Khmer title does. Western classes often skip the name. Here we keep it.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §11 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.1-11-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "48136dddf5", "text": "Going further", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §11 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.1-11-10", "kind": "list", "h": "58296d67fe", "text": "Who do you say good morning to first in your house? If you meet a neighbour at the gate, do you use their name?", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §12 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-12-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "f7c6b8a70c", "text": "Letters (MoEYS)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §12 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-12-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "55d56e376a", "text": "Card: letter card A a", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §12 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-12-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "1d2ba76fda", "text": "Show A a . Children say the name A , then the sound /æ/. Find a in name or am . Air-write, then copy A a on slate or paper. One letter only. Do not add extra words.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §13 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-13-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "e2f0c8f8c9", "text": "E5: Teacher notes", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §13 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-13-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b520b8623f", "text": "For the teacher. Not for the child to read.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §13 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-13-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5915f22653", "text": "Lesson intent This is the first English habit: a morning greeting plus a name. If this is secure, week 2 at school is the same words with a new person.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §13 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-13-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b230d097fd", "text": "RTTI guidance", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §13 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.1-13-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e171cdee76", "text": "Reproduction (R) — Strong: good morning is clear, name is the child's own. Weak: silence, or a giggle with no words. Prompt with the first syllable, not the whole phrase.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §13 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.1-13-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e1815d1200", "text": "Training (T1) — Strong: greeting and name come as one short exchange. Weak: child can say the words only when you say them first, every time. Stay in E3 one more loop.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §13 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.1-13-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "bd3b598725", "text": "Transfer (T2) — Strong: child greets you, or one classmate, without the Yeay picture. Weak: child only speaks when facing that picture. Stay in the same room. Do not move this to the school door yet.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §13 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.1-13-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "0d3cc8d99b", "text": "Insight (I) — Strong: child can point to Yeay vs a friend and still choose good morning , then add the right name. Weak: child thinks English has a special grandmother word. Do not force a spoken explanation. A point is enough this week.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §13 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.1-13-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2161bc2a7a", "text": "Common errors", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §13 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.1-13-9", "kind": "list", "h": "8c91abc631", "text": "Khmer suo sdei said instead of good morning . Accept it once, then model the English and ask for a repeat. I am dropped: child says only the name. That is fine for Reproduction. Add I am on the second try. Whole-class chant that hides the quiet children. Hear each child once.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §13 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.1-13-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "40605ff1e4", "text": "Reach-ahead grammar flags What is your name? / My name is … may appear if you slip. Prefer I am [name] this week. If is appears, do not teach the rule. Model and move on. He / she is is week 2.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §13 ¶11", "anchor": "p-S.1-13-11", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "3cfb6716a8", "text": "Cultural notes Some children will not look an adult in the eye when they say their name. Do not mark that as weak English. Warmth is in the words and the name, not in Western eye contact.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §13 ¶12", "anchor": "p-S.1-13-12", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d1e98b2f8d", "text": "Letters MoEYS four skills; letter name + sound + copy. Today A a . Kindergarten already has Latin letters. Do not mix Khmer and Latin on the same copy line. Air-write counts if there is no slate. Do not add apple .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §14 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-14-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "49bdda0e0e", "text": "E6: Practice", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §14 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-14-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §14 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-14-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "8c3db6f307", "text": "Stand by the classroom door as if it is the house door. You are Yeay Chan. Each child knocks or waits. You say Good morning, [child's name]! The child answers Good morning, Yeay! Then you ask What is your name? The child says I am [name].", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §14 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-14-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §14 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.1-14-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "fbc3217c0c", "text": "Then the child greets one classmate with Good morning, [classmate's name]. One classmate only. Sit down after that.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §14 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.1-14-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §14 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.1-14-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "cd342ceedb", "text": "Letters Each child air-writes A a , then copies it. If their own name uses Latin A/a , they copy that letter once more.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §15 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-15-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "9e9a020100", "text": "E7: Exit check", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §15 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-15-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b1fc4d6333", "text": "Eight spoken checks, two per category, plus one letter check. Observe. Pass on Reproduction and Training (at least 3 of those 4) and the letter check. Transfer and Insight are watched this week — a point or a short Khmer phrase is enough. They do not block a pass.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §15 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-15-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §15 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-15-3", "kind": "list", "h": "fc0dc4e3b6", "text": "Child says good morning when you enter or when you greet first. Child says their own name when asked.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §15 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.1-15-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §15 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.1-15-5", "kind": "list", "h": "8eff50a7d6", "text": "Child answers I am [name] (or My name is [name] ) without a long freeze. Child says Good morning, Yeay in the door practice, not only good morning .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §15 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.1-15-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §15 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.1-15-7", "kind": "list", "h": "969128cf4c", "text": "Child greets a classmate, not only you. Child uses that classmate's name, or a clear try at the name.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §15 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.1-15-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §15 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.1-15-9", "kind": "list", "h": "b7e46a11b9", "text": "Child points to Yeay (picture or role) as someone you greet with a name. Child points again when you ask who gets a name after good morning — no spoken why yet.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §15 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.1-15-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "39e7720e1c", "text": "Letters 9. Points to A a (letter card A a) and copies it (air-write counts).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §16 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-16-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "66ba33e460", "text": "E8: Formative evaluation and reformat", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §16 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-16-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d2dcd6e100", "text": "Say this to the child by name. Use Khmer for the soft parts if English is still new.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §16 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-16-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "57aa4bd257", "text": "[Name], you said good morning in our house scene. Next we keep the same words and change only the person.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §16 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-16-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "02322e80ab", "text": "Reformat triggers — change E3 only. Maximum two reformats.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §16 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.1-16-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §16 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.1-16-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2c878aac3a", "text": "Reproduction weak: Replay E3 with Yeay Chan and one twin. Drop the second twin.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §16 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.1-16-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §16 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.1-16-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7032ebd339", "text": "Training weak: Stay on the name question with your name only. Do not add the classmate yet.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §16 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.1-16-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §16 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.1-16-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f05c7b0ec6", "text": "Transfer weak: Keep the greeting with you. Move the classmate step to S002.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §16 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.1-16-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §16 ¶11", "anchor": "p-S.1-16-11", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "138a315949", "text": "Insight weak: Skip the spoken why in E7.8. A point to Yeay is enough. Come back in week 2 when teacher is a second name.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §17 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-17-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b170a2e736", "text": "E9: Feed forward", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §17 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-17-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a18b898c3b", "text": "Select the message that matches the weakest exit dimension. One message per child. Speak it. You may show the letter card. Do not hand a full sentence card unless they ask.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §17 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-17-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §17 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-17-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a4b0329c95", "text": "You already have good morning . Tomorrow we say it together two more times, then you say your name. Keep A a — point to it once at home if you have a paper A.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §17 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.1-17-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §17 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.1-17-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "df690f345a", "text": "You can greet Yeay. Next time, try I am and your name in the same breath.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §17 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.1-17-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §17 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.1-17-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "3dd0f63164", "text": "You greeted Yeay clearly. Next time we try the same good morning with one friend.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §17 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.1-17-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §17 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.1-17-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e4effa4c70", "text": "You are learning when a name follows good morning . That comes slowly. We will try it again with the teacher.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §18 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-18-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "81640ecdaf", "text": "Teacher-led session (one study hour, 40 min)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §18 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-18-1", "kind": "table", "h": "27356fb17e", "text": "Step Minutes What happens E1 Theme and feed up 5 Show the picture, say the learning goal, point to the five cues. E2 Entry readiness 4 Quick check; route pupils as in E2. E3 Core conversation 10 Teacher in role; the class answers, then small groups. E4 Going further 4 Watch-out points and the cultural note. E6 Practice and letter 8 Role-play in pairs; air-write and copy the letter. E7 Exit check 6 Spoken checks with a sample of pupils; note the RTTI categories. E8–E9 Reformat and feed forward 3 Back to the five cues; one feed-forward message per pupil or group.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §18 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-18-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "30e5cd2054", "text": "E5 is for the teacher before the session.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §19 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-19-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "86b4ba2ff9", "text": "Story", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §19 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-19-1", "kind": "scene", "h": "da39a3ee5e", "text": "", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §20 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-20-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "e9029a8cd7", "text": "Self-paced app session", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §20 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-20-1", "kind": "list", "h": "157c8e5544", "text": "Listen: the home picture appears with the dialogue (Yeay Chan, Bora, Sreyneang). Tap a person to hear their line again. Say it: record Good morning, Yeay! after Yeay's line; compare with the model. My name: the app asks What is your name? ; the pupil records I am … . Letter card: tap A a to hear the name and the sound /æ/; trace A a with a finger. Quiz: five questions, one per success criterion (below).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §20 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-20-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "53ba7b604f", "text": "The learner story above is the JSON scene player ( scenes/s001.json ); edit that file to change lines or timing without rebuilding Markdown.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §20 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-20-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6df6c9f3e3", "text": "The app shows the five cues at the start and the feed-forward message from E9 at the end.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §21 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-21-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "25c86f6a92", "text": "Quiz", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §21 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-21-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f331673cc7", "text": "Each question checks one success criterion in one RTTI category. After Check , the quiz shows the result per criterion and what to try next.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §21 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-21-2", "kind": "table", "h": "915e707a5c", "text": "Success criterion RTTI Question 1 Reproduction R 1 2 Training T1 2 3 Transfer T2 3 4 Insight I 4 5 Letter A a R 5", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §21 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.1-21-3", "kind": "quiz", "h": "142968cdec", "text": "1. 🌅 It is early morning. Yeay Chan says \"Good morning, Bora!\". What does Bora say? Criterion 1 · RTTI level R Good morning, Yeay! Yes! Bora says good morning and adds Yeay. Goodbye, Yeay! Goodbye is for leaving. In the morning say: Good morning, Yeay! Thank you, Yeay! Thank you is for getting something. Say: Good morning, Yeay! 2. Yeay Chan asks Sreyneang: \"What is your name?\" Criterion 2 · RTTI level T1 Good morning. That is a greeting. Now say the name: I am Sreyneang. I am Sreyneang. Yes! I am and her name. You are Yeay. That is Yeay's name. Say her own name: I am … 3. 🧑‍🏫 You meet the teacher in the morning. What do you say? Criterion 3 · RTTI level T2 Good morning, teacher! Yes! Same words, new person: good morning plus the name. Good morning, Yeay! Yeay is the grandmother at home. Here we add the teacher's name. I am the teacher. You are not the teacher. Greet: Good morning, teacher! 4. Why does Yeay Chan say \"Good morning, Bora!\" and not only \"Good morning!\"? Criterion 4 · RTTI level I Bora is still asleep. Bora is awake. The name shows she cares about him. The name shows care. Yes! Adding the name is how we show care. It is a new word. Good morning does not change. The name is added for care. 5. 🔤 Which card is the letter A a? Criterion 5 · RTTI level R A a Yes! A a. Say the name: A. B b That is B b. Find A a. C c That is C c. Find A a. Check Try again", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §22 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.1-22-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b8efd777f4", "text": "CEFR cross-reference", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §22 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.1-22-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "9ace50ee5c", "text": "Secondary reference only. Pre-A1 can-do statements adapted from the CEFR Companion Volume (2020); not an official CEFR test.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.1 §22 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.1-22-2", "kind": "list", "h": "426b6c16d2", "text": "I can say good morning and my name when someone greets me. I can recognise the letter A a.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}], "html": "<div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e0ace45ecb\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §0 ¶0\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.1-0-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §0 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §0 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶0</button><h1 data-body=\"1\">Session S001: Good morning, Yeay</h1></div><div class=\"blk blk-figure fl-full\" data-h=\"da39a3ee5e\" data-kind=\"figure\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §0 ¶1\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.1-0-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §0 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §0 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶1</button><figure class=\"fig fig-full\" data-body=\"1\" data-marker=\"full\"><button aria-label=\"Enlarge image: Letter card A a\" class=\"img-zoom\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Letter card A a\" data-src=\"images/letter-a.svg\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"assets/images/images/letter-a.svg\"/></button></figure></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4d371440da\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §0 ¶2\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.1-0-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §0 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §0 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Week 1 · Home, early morning · Bora, Sreyneang, Yeay Chan.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"82a0e548fa\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §0 ¶3\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.1-0-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §0 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §0 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">Yeay Chan greets the twins Bora and Sreyneang at home. Say <em>good morning</em> and your name. New letter: <strong>A a</strong>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"025eec04ab\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §1 ¶0\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.1-1-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §1 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §1 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">MoEYS frame</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ac36d97d4a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §1 ¶1\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.1-1-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §1 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §1 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">This session serves the MoEYS frame in <a data-href=\"#p-L.0-1-2\" href=\"#p-L.0-1-2\">L.0 §1 ¶2</a>: core competency 4.2, the Listening and Speaking components plus one letter, and one 40-minute study hour.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2baba6e82b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §1 ¶2\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.1-1-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §1 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §1 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Session syllabus:</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0f0f1acdc9\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §1 ¶3\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.1-1-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §1 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §1 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶3</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Function</th>\n<th>Form</th>\n<th>Vocabulary</th>\n<th>Grammar</th>\n<th>Letter</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Greeting someone at home in the morning; saying your name</td>\n<td>Good morning, Yeay! – What is your name? – I am Bora.</td>\n<td>good morning, name, I (hello, you: recognize)</td>\n<td>to be: I am</td>\n<td>A a</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5a49743b7a\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §2 ¶0\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.1-2-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §2 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §2 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Feed up (E1: theme introduction)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8b7942ee83\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §2 ¶1\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.1-2-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §2 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §2 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Yeay Chan is already awake. The house is quiet. Bora and Sreyneang come out of the sleeping room. She greets each child by name.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9e822f12d8\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §2 ¶2\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.1-2-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §2 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §2 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Situational:</strong> a grandmother greets two grandchildren in the morning.\n<strong>Broad:</strong> greeting someone you live with.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ee2df6466a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §2 ¶3\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.1-2-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §2 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §2 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">Scene: picture <em>morning at home</em> (to be drawn)</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7660a32c11\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §3 ¶0\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.1-3-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §3 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §3 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Words this session</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3c4f120b1a\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §3 ¶1\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.1-3-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §3 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §3 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Word</th>\n<th>Role</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>good morning</td>\n<td>reproduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>name</td>\n<td>reproduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>reproduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hello</td>\n<td>recognize</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>you</td>\n<td>recognize</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"53931d5e54\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §3 ¶2\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.1-3-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §3 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §3 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Keep the active list this short. Do not add family-role words yet.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"dd17342cb4\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §4 ¶0\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-S.1-4-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §4 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §4 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Grammar</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5da9f97e97\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §4 ¶1\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-S.1-4-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §4 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §4 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶1</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Primary:</strong> <em>I am</em> (identity: <em>I am Bora.</em>)</li>\n<li><strong>Reach-ahead:</strong> <em>What is your name?</em> / <em>My name is …</em> — children hear and copy. Do not explain <em>is</em>.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f7c6b8a70c\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §5 ¶0\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.1-5-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §5 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §5 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Letters (MoEYS)</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"55d56e376a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §5 ¶1\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.1-5-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §5 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §5 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Card: letter card A a</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"32feac4209\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §5 ¶2\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.1-5-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §5 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §5 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Letter</td>\n<td><strong>A a</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Name</td>\n<td><em>A</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sound</td>\n<td>/æ/ as in <em>am</em> (<em>I am</em>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Whole word</td>\n<td>Point to <em>a</em> in <em>name</em> (already a session word). Do not add <em>apple</em>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write</td>\n<td>Air-write, then copy <em>A a</em>. If the child's Latin-script name uses <em>A/a</em>, copy that letter too.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"bd67b83913\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §5 ¶3\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.1-5-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §5 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §5 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">Kindergarten already has Latin letters. This is English use of the same script.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"da75f75ee9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §6 ¶0\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.1-6-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §6 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §6 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">By the end of this session you will be able to:</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §6 ¶1\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.1-6-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §6 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §6 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e30fc84ac0\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §6 ¶2\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.1-6-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §6 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §6 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶2</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Say <em>good morning</em> and say your own name. Point to <strong>A a</strong> (name or sound).</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §6 ¶3\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.1-6-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §6 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §6 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"117719f958\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.1 §6 ¶4\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.1-6-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §6 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §6 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶4</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"2\">\n<li>Answer when someone asks your name, and say <em>good morning</em> back.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.1 §6 ¶5\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.1-6-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §6 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §6 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5be156a0ee\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.1 §6 ¶6\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.1-6-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §6 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §6 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶6</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"3\">\n<li>Greet the teacher the same way — <em>good morning</em> plus a name.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.1 §6 ¶7\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.1-6-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §6 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §6 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6ba0edf476\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.1 §6 ¶8\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.1-6-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §6 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §6 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶8</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"4\">\n<li>Notice that <em>good morning</em> stays the same. Adding the name is how we show care.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"52f7c040c5\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §7 ¶0\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.1-7-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §7 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §7 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Words with Khmer</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f284c1f193\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §7 ¶1\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.1-7-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §7 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §7 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Word</th>\n<th>Khmer</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>good morning</td>\n<td>អរុណសួស្តី</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>name</td>\n<td>ឈ្មោះ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hello</td>\n<td>សួស្តី</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>you</td>\n<td>អ្នក</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a336b8b56a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §7 ¶2\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.1-7-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §7 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §7 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Learning goal:</strong> Today we say good morning and our name.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"aa3b0dba62\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §7 ¶3\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.1-7-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §7 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §7 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>In Khmer:</strong> ថ្ងៃនេះ យើងនិយាយ good morning និងប្រាប់ឈ្មោះរបស់យើង។</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a821d18e58\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.1 §7 ¶4\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.1-7-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §7 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §7 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶4</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>Success criterion (pupil words)</th>\n<th>RTTI</th>\n<th>Khmer (pupil words)</th>\n<th>Picture or gesture cue</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>I can say <em>good morning</em> and my name.</td>\n<td>Reproduction (R)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ good morning និងឈ្មោះរបស់ខ្ញុំ។</td>\n<td>wave, then hand on chest</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>I can answer when someone asks my name.</td>\n<td>Training (T1)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចឆ្លើយ ពេលគេសួរឈ្មោះខ្ញុំ។</td>\n<td>hand to ear</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>I can greet a new person the same way.</td>\n<td>Transfer (T2)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចសួរសុខទុក្ខមនុស្សថ្មីតាមរបៀបដដែល។</td>\n<td>point to a friend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>I know that we add the name after <em>good morning</em>.</td>\n<td>Insight (I)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំដឹងថា យើងបន្ថែមឈ្មោះក្រោយ good morning។</td>\n<td>heart</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>I can point to <strong>A a</strong> and copy it.</td>\n<td>Letter (R)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចចង្អុល A a ហើយចម្លងវា។</td>\n<td>air-write A</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"40bea74885\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.1 §7 ¶5\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.1-7-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §7 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §7 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\">Criteria 1–4 are the four goals above in pupil words; criterion 5 is the letter. Draw the five cues on the board and point to them at the start and at the end.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a343dabcab\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §8 ¶0\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.1-8-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §8 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §8 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">RTTI rubric for the teacher</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"fa9039d2ed\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §8 ¶1\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.1-8-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §8 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §8 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">RTTI categories: <strong>R</strong> Reproduction, <strong>T1</strong> Training, <strong>T2</strong> Transfer, <strong>I</strong> Insight. They are categories, not a ladder: a pupil can be strong in Transfer and weak in Reproduction. Pass rule (E7): at least 3 of the 4 Reproduction and Training checks, plus the letter. Transfer and Insight are watched; they do not block a pass.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ed635a6f99\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §8 ¶2\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.1-8-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §8 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §8 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Criterion</th>\n<th>R – Reproduction</th>\n<th>T1 – Training</th>\n<th>T2 – Transfer</th>\n<th>I – Insight</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1. I can say <em>good morning</em> and my name.</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> <em>good morning</em> is clear, name is the child's own. <strong>If not yet:</strong> silence, or a giggle with no words. Prompt with the first syllable, not the whole phrase. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You said it clearly.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> You already have <em>good morning</em>. Tomorrow we say it together two more times, then you say your name. Keep <em>A a</em> — point to it once at home if you have a paper A. <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. I can answer when someone asks my name.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> greeting and name come as one short exchange. <strong>If not yet:</strong> child can say the words only when you say them first, every time. Stay in E3 one more loop. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You answered by yourself.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> You can greet Yeay. Next time, try <em>I am</em> and your name in the same breath. <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. I can greet a new person the same way.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-yellow\"><strong>Look for:</strong> child greets you, or one classmate, without the Yeay picture. <strong>If not yet:</strong> child only speaks when facing that picture. Stay in the same room. Do not move this to the school door yet. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You did it with someone new.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> You greeted Yeay clearly. Next time we try the same <em>good morning</em> with one friend. <em>Watched, with help.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"yellow\" title=\"Rated yellow\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated yellow)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. I know that we add the name after <em>good morning</em>.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-red\"><strong>Look for:</strong> child can point to Yeay vs a friend and still choose <em>good morning</em>, then add the right name. <strong>If not yet:</strong> child thinks English has a special grandmother word. Do not force a spoken explanation. A point is enough this week. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You showed me why.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> You are learning when a name follows <em>good morning</em>. That comes slowly. We will try it again with the teacher. <em>Watched, stretch goal.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"red\" title=\"Rated red\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-xmark\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated red)</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. I can point to <strong>A a</strong> and copy it. (letter)</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> Points to <strong>A a</strong> and copies it (air-write counts). <strong>If not yet:</strong> Points to the wrong card: say the name and sound again, air-write together. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You found A.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> \"Look for a in your name or on the board.\" <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ba0b563256\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §9 ¶0\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.1-9-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §9 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §9 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E2: Entry readiness</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3e97b590ad\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §9 ¶1\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.1-9-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §9 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §9 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Teacher speaks. The child answers by speaking, pointing, or tracing. Pointing at a letter card is reading.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §9 ¶2\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.1-9-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §9 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §9 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"825d2bddda\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §9 ¶3\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.1-9-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §9 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §9 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶3</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Point to the picture that shows morning at home. (Use picture <em>morning at home</em> (to be drawn) and one night-time distractor if you have it.)</li>\n<li>Say your name.</li>\n<li>Point to <strong>A a</strong> (letter card A a). Say the letter name <em>A</em> or the sound /æ/.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.1 §9 ¶4\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.1-9-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §9 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §9 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0e3cb59aef\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.1 §9 ¶5\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.1-9-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §9 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §9 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶5</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"4\">\n<li>Point to yourself, then point to the teacher.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"48e165d43a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.1 §9 ¶6\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.1-9-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §9 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §9 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Routing:</strong> 3–4 confident = you may move quickly through E3. Any unsure = do E3–E6 in full. This is the first English session. Almost every child should do the full path.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b2a0279bfc\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶0\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E3: Core teaching conversation</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"13748d40b1\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶1\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Setting: the twins' home, early morning. Default learner role: Bora or Sreyneang. Either twin role is fine. Switch if a child wants Yeay's lines.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c4ff4dfad2\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶2\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Audio: recording <em>home greetings</em> (to be recorded)</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶3\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ba7ca09fdf\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶4\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Yeay Chan:</strong> Good morning, Bora!</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8ed7fc7ade\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶5\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> Good morning, Yeay!</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e422410db1\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶6\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Yeay Chan:</strong> Good morning, Sreyneang!</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5b176c8144\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶7\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Sreyneang:</strong> Good morning, Yeay!</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶8\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7b2ef37015\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶9\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Yeay Chan:</strong> Bora, what is your name?</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8b2c895baa\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶10\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> I am Bora.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"75e2f08f27\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"11\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶11\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-11\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶11\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶11 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶11</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Yeay Chan:</strong> Sreyneang, what is your name?</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"523d57e406\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"12\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶12\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-12\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶12\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶12 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶12</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Sreyneang:</strong> I am Sreyneang.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"76078cb665\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"13\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶13\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-13\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶13\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶13 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶13</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Children repeat the greetings from the Reproduction block, then these name lines, both sides.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"14\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶14\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-14\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶14\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶14 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶14</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a50e892767\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"15\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶15\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-15\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶15\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶15 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶15</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>New person, same words. Child turns to the teacher:</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"481fb15ff9\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"16\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶16\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-16\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶16\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶16 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶16</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Child:</strong> Good morning, [teacher name]!</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ec783d1a67\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"17\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶17\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-17\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶17\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶17 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶17</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Teacher:</strong> Good morning. What is your name?</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d69e247844\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"18\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶18\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-18\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶18\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶18 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶18</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Child:</strong> I am [own name].</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"19\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶19\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-19\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶19\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶19 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶19</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"43d690ca26\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"20\" data-ref=\"S.1 §10 ¶20\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.1-10-20\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §10 ¶20\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §10 ¶20 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶20</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Say this in Khmer if needed, then point at the English lines.</em>\nIn Khmer we change the greeting for Yeay. In English we can still say <em>good morning</em>. We add <em>Yeay</em> after it. That is the respect.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d10e9904fa\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §11 ¶0\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.1-11-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §11 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §11 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E4: Going further</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"26b1352b50\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §11 ¶1\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.1-11-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §11 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §11 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Read to the children in Khmer or very slow English. Do not turn this into a lecture.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §11 ¶2\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.1-11-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §11 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §11 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"475f711364\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §11 ¶3\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.1-11-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §11 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §11 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Why this works</strong>\nYeay Chan says each child's name. <em>Good morning, Bora</em> is warmer than <em>good morning</em> alone. Bora answers with <em>Good morning, Yeay</em> — he gives the name back.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.1 §11 ¶4\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.1-11-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §11 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §11 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c935c520ee\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.1 §11 ¶5\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.1-11-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §11 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §11 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Watch out for</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"feed37eedc\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.1 §11 ¶6\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.1-11-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §11 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §11 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶6</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Whispering the name so nobody hears it. Ask once more, softly, face to face.</li>\n<li><em>Good morning teacher</em> said at home to Yeay. The pattern is <em>good morning</em> + the name you use for that person.</li>\n<li>Copying <em>I am Bora</em> when the child is not Bora. Use the child's real name from the first answer.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.1 §11 ¶7\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.1-11-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §11 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §11 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c55fe2eae4\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.1 §11 ¶8\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.1-11-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §11 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §11 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Cultural context</strong>\nKhmer greetings mark age and family (<em>yeay</em>, <em>ming</em>, <em>pu</em>). English <em>good morning</em> does not change. The name after it does the work that the Khmer title does. Western classes often skip the name. Here we keep it.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"48136dddf5\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.1 §11 ¶9\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.1-11-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §11 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §11 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Going further</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"58296d67fe\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.1 §11 ¶10\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.1-11-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §11 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §11 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶10</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Who do you say <em>good morning</em> to first in your house?</li>\n<li>If you meet a neighbour at the gate, do you use their name?</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f7c6b8a70c\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §12 ¶0\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.1-12-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §12 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §12 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Letters (MoEYS)</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"55d56e376a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §12 ¶1\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.1-12-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §12 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §12 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Card: letter card A a</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"1d2ba76fda\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §12 ¶2\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.1-12-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §12 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §12 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Show <em>A a</em>. Children say the name <em>A</em>, then the sound /æ/. Find <em>a</em> in <em>name</em> or <em>am</em>. Air-write, then copy <em>A a</em> on slate or paper. One letter only. Do not add extra words.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e2f0c8f8c9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §13 ¶0\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.1-13-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §13 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §13 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E5: Teacher notes</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b520b8623f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §13 ¶1\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.1-13-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §13 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §13 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>For the teacher. Not for the child to read.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5915f22653\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §13 ¶2\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.1-13-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §13 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §13 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Lesson intent</strong>\nThis is the first English habit: a morning greeting plus a name. If this is secure, week 2 at school is the same words with a new person.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b230d097fd\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §13 ¶3\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.1-13-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §13 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §13 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>RTTI guidance</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e171cdee76\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.1 §13 ¶4\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.1-13-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §13 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §13 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong> — Strong: <em>good morning</em> is clear, name is the child's own. Weak: silence, or a giggle with no words. Prompt with the first syllable, not the whole phrase.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e1815d1200\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.1 §13 ¶5\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.1-13-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §13 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §13 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong> — Strong: greeting and name come as one short exchange. Weak: child can say the words only when you say them first, every time. Stay in E3 one more loop.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"bd3b598725\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.1 §13 ¶6\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.1-13-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §13 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §13 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong> — Strong: child greets you, or one classmate, without the Yeay picture. Weak: child only speaks when facing that picture. Stay in the same room. Do not move this to the school door yet.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0d3cc8d99b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.1 §13 ¶7\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.1-13-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §13 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §13 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong> — Strong: child can point to Yeay vs a friend and still choose <em>good morning</em>, then add the right name. Weak: child thinks English has a special grandmother word. Do not force a spoken explanation. A point is enough this week.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2161bc2a7a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.1 §13 ¶8\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.1-13-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §13 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §13 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Common errors</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8c91abc631\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.1 §13 ¶9\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.1-13-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §13 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §13 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶9</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Khmer <em>suo sdei</em> said instead of <em>good morning</em>. Accept it once, then model the English and ask for a repeat.</li>\n<li><em>I am</em> dropped: child says only the name. That is fine for Reproduction. Add <em>I am</em> on the second try.</li>\n<li>Whole-class chant that hides the quiet children. Hear each child once.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"40605ff1e4\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.1 §13 ¶10\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.1-13-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §13 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §13 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reach-ahead grammar flags</strong>\n<em>What is your name?</em> / <em>My name is …</em> may appear if you slip. Prefer <em>I am [name]</em> this week. If <em>is</em> appears, do not teach the rule. Model and move on. <em>He / she is</em> is week 2.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3cfb6716a8\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"11\" data-ref=\"S.1 §13 ¶11\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.1-13-11\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §13 ¶11\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §13 ¶11 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶11</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Cultural notes</strong>\nSome children will not look an adult in the eye when they say their name. Do not mark that as weak English. Warmth is in the words and the name, not in Western eye contact.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d1e98b2f8d\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"12\" data-ref=\"S.1 §13 ¶12\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.1-13-12\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §13 ¶12\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §13 ¶12 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶12</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\nMoEYS four skills; letter name + sound + copy. Today <strong>A a</strong>. Kindergarten already has Latin letters. Do not mix Khmer and Latin on the same copy line. Air-write counts if there is no slate. Do not add <em>apple</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"49bdda0e0e\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §14 ¶0\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.1-14-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §14 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §14 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E6: Practice</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §14 ¶1\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.1-14-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §14 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §14 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8c3db6f307\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §14 ¶2\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.1-14-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §14 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §14 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Stand by the classroom door as if it is the house door. You are Yeay Chan. Each child knocks or waits. You say <em>Good morning, [child's name]!</em> The child answers <em>Good morning, Yeay!</em> Then you ask <em>What is your name?</em> The child says <em>I am [name].</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §14 ¶3\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.1-14-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §14 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §14 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"fbc3217c0c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.1 §14 ¶4\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.1-14-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §14 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §14 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\">Then the child greets one classmate with <em>Good morning, [classmate's name].</em> One classmate only. Sit down after that.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.1 §14 ¶5\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.1-14-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §14 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §14 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"cd342ceedb\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.1 §14 ¶6\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.1-14-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §14 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §14 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\nEach child air-writes <strong>A a</strong>, then copies it. If their own name uses Latin <em>A/a</em>, they copy that letter once more.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9e9a020100\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §15 ¶0\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.1-15-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §15 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §15 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E7: Exit check</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b1fc4d6333\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §15 ¶1\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.1-15-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §15 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §15 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Eight spoken checks, two per category, plus one letter check. Observe. Pass on Reproduction and Training (at least 3 of those 4) and the letter check. Transfer and Insight are watched this week — a point or a short Khmer phrase is enough. They do not block a pass.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §15 ¶2\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.1-15-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §15 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §15 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"fc0dc4e3b6\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §15 ¶3\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.1-15-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §15 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §15 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶3</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Child says <em>good morning</em> when you enter or when you greet first.</li>\n<li>Child says their own name when asked.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.1 §15 ¶4\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.1-15-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §15 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §15 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8eff50a7d6\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.1 §15 ¶5\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.1-15-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §15 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §15 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶5</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"3\">\n<li>Child answers <em>I am [name]</em> (or <em>My name is [name]</em>) without a long freeze.</li>\n<li>Child says <em>Good morning, Yeay</em> in the door practice, not only <em>good morning</em>.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.1 §15 ¶6\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.1-15-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §15 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §15 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"969128cf4c\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.1 §15 ¶7\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.1-15-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §15 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §15 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶7</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"5\">\n<li>Child greets a classmate, not only you.</li>\n<li>Child uses that classmate's name, or a clear try at the name.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.1 §15 ¶8\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.1-15-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §15 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §15 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b7e46a11b9\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.1 §15 ¶9\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.1-15-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §15 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §15 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶9</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"7\">\n<li>Child points to Yeay (picture or role) as someone you greet with a name.</li>\n<li>Child points again when you ask who gets a name after <em>good morning</em> — no spoken <em>why</em> yet.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"39e7720e1c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.1 §15 ¶10\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.1-15-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §15 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §15 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\n9. Points to <strong>A a</strong> (letter card A a) and copies it (air-write counts).</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"66ba33e460\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §16 ¶0\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.1-16-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §16 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §16 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E8: Formative evaluation and reformat</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d2dcd6e100\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §16 ¶1\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.1-16-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §16 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §16 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Say this to the child by name. Use Khmer for the soft parts if English is still new.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"57aa4bd257\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §16 ¶2\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.1-16-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §16 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §16 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">[Name], you said <em>good morning</em> in our house scene. Next we keep the same words and change only the person.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"02322e80ab\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §16 ¶3\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.1-16-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §16 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §16 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reformat triggers</strong> — change E3 only. Maximum two reformats.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.1 §16 ¶4\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.1-16-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §16 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §16 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2c878aac3a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.1 §16 ¶5\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.1-16-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §16 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §16 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction weak:</strong> Replay E3 with Yeay Chan and one twin. Drop the second twin.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.1 §16 ¶6\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.1-16-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §16 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §16 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7032ebd339\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.1 §16 ¶7\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.1-16-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §16 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §16 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training weak:</strong> Stay on the name question with your name only. Do not add the classmate yet.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.1 §16 ¶8\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.1-16-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §16 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §16 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f05c7b0ec6\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.1 §16 ¶9\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.1-16-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §16 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §16 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer weak:</strong> Keep the greeting with you. Move the classmate step to S002.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.1 §16 ¶10\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.1-16-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §16 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §16 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"138a315949\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"11\" data-ref=\"S.1 §16 ¶11\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.1-16-11\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §16 ¶11\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §16 ¶11 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶11</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight weak:</strong> Skip the spoken <em>why</em> in E7.8. A point to Yeay is enough. Come back in week 2 when <em>teacher</em> is a second name.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b170a2e736\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §17 ¶0\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.1-17-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §17 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §17 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E9: Feed forward</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a18b898c3b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §17 ¶1\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.1-17-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §17 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §17 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Select the message that matches the weakest exit dimension. One message per child. Speak it. You may show the letter card. Do not hand a full sentence card unless they ask.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §17 ¶2\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.1-17-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §17 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §17 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a4b0329c95\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §17 ¶3\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.1-17-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §17 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §17 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">You already have <em>good morning</em>. Tomorrow we say it together two more times, then you say your name. Keep <em>A a</em> — point to it once at home if you have a paper A.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.1 §17 ¶4\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.1-17-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §17 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §17 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"df690f345a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.1 §17 ¶5\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.1-17-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §17 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §17 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\">You can greet Yeay. Next time, try <em>I am</em> and your name in the same breath.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.1 §17 ¶6\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.1-17-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §17 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §17 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3dd0f63164\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.1 §17 ¶7\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.1-17-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §17 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §17 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\">You greeted Yeay clearly. Next time we try the same <em>good morning</em> with one friend.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.1 §17 ¶8\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.1-17-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §17 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §17 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e4effa4c70\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.1 §17 ¶9\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.1-17-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §17 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §17 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\">You are learning when a name follows <em>good morning</em>. That comes slowly. We will try it again with the teacher.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"81640ecdaf\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §18 ¶0\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.1-18-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §18 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §18 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Teacher-led session (one study hour, 40 min)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"27356fb17e\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §18 ¶1\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.1-18-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §18 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §18 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Step</th>\n<th>Minutes</th>\n<th>What happens</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>E1 Theme and feed up</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Show the picture, say the learning goal, point to the five cues.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2 Entry readiness</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Quick check; route pupils as in E2.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E3 Core conversation</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>Teacher in role; the class answers, then small groups.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E4 Going further</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Watch-out points and the cultural note.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E6 Practice and letter</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Role-play in pairs; air-write and copy the letter.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E7 Exit check</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Spoken checks with a sample of pupils; note the RTTI categories.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E8–E9 Reformat and feed forward</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Back to the five cues; one feed-forward message per pupil or group.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"30e5cd2054\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §18 ¶2\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.1-18-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §18 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §18 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">E5 is for the teacher before the session.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"86b4ba2ff9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §19 ¶0\" data-sec=\"19\" id=\"p-S.1-19-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §19 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §19 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§19 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Story</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-scene\" data-h=\"da39a3ee5e\" data-kind=\"scene\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §19 ¶1\" data-sec=\"19\" id=\"p-S.1-19-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §19 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §19 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§19 ¶1</button><div class=\"tli-scene-player\" data-body=\"1\" data-scene=\"scenes/s001.json\"></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e9029a8cd7\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §20 ¶0\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.1-20-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §20 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §20 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Self-paced app session</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"157c8e5544\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §20 ¶1\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.1-20-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §20 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §20 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶1</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Listen:</strong> the home picture appears with the dialogue (Yeay Chan, Bora, Sreyneang). Tap a person to hear their line again.</li>\n<li><strong>Say it:</strong> record <em>Good morning, Yeay!</em> after Yeay's line; compare with the model.</li>\n<li><strong>My name:</strong> the app asks <em>What is your name?</em>; the pupil records <em>I am …</em>.</li>\n<li><strong>Letter card:</strong> tap <strong>A a</strong> to hear the name and the sound /æ/; trace A a with a finger.</li>\n<li><strong>Quiz:</strong> five questions, one per success criterion (below).</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"53ba7b604f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §20 ¶2\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.1-20-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §20 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §20 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">The learner story above is the JSON scene player (<code>scenes/s001.json</code>); edit that file to change lines or timing without rebuilding Markdown.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6df6c9f3e3\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §20 ¶3\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.1-20-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §20 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §20 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">The app shows the five cues at the start and the feed-forward message from E9 at the end.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"25c86f6a92\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §21 ¶0\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.1-21-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §21 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §21 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Quiz</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f331673cc7\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §21 ¶1\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.1-21-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §21 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §21 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Each question checks one success criterion in one RTTI category. After <strong>Check</strong>, the quiz shows the result per criterion and what to try next.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"915e707a5c\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §21 ¶2\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.1-21-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §21 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §21 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Success criterion</th>\n<th>RTTI</th>\n<th>Question</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1 Reproduction</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 Training</td>\n<td>T1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 Transfer</td>\n<td>T2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 Insight</td>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 Letter A a</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-quiz\" data-h=\"142968cdec\" data-kind=\"quiz\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.1 §21 ¶3\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.1-21-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §21 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §21 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶3</button><div aria-label=\"Quiz\" class=\"quiz\" data-body=\"1\" role=\"group\"><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"R\" data-q=\"1\" data-sc=\"SC1\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">1.</span> 🌅 It is early morning. Yeay Chan says \"Good morning, Bora!\". What does Bora say?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 1 · RTTI level R</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Good morning, Yeay!</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Bora says good morning and adds Yeay.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Goodbye, Yeay!</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Goodbye is for leaving. In the morning say: Good morning, Yeay!</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Thank you, Yeay!</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Thank you is for getting something. Say: Good morning, Yeay!</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"T1\" data-q=\"2\" data-sc=\"SC2\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">2.</span> Yeay Chan asks Sreyneang: \"What is your name?\"</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 2 · RTTI level T1</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Good morning.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is a greeting. Now say the name: I am Sreyneang.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">I am Sreyneang.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! I am and her name.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">You are Yeay.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is Yeay's name. Say her own name: I am …</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"T2\" data-q=\"3\" data-sc=\"SC3\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">3.</span> 🧑‍🏫 You meet the teacher in the morning. What do you say?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 3 · RTTI level T2</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Good morning, teacher!</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Same words, new person: good morning plus the name.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Good morning, Yeay!</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yeay is the grandmother at home. Here we add the teacher's name.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">I am the teacher.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">You are not the teacher. Greet: Good morning, teacher!</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"I\" data-q=\"4\" data-sc=\"SC4\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">4.</span> Why does Yeay Chan say \"Good morning, Bora!\" and not only \"Good morning!\"?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 4 · RTTI level I</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Bora is still asleep.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Bora is awake. The name shows she cares about him.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">The name shows care.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Adding the name is how we show care.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">It is a new word.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Good morning does not change. The name is added for care.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"R\" data-q=\"5\" data-sc=\"SC5\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">5.</span> 🔤 Which card is the letter A a?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 5 · RTTI level R</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">A a</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! A a. Say the name: A.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">B b</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is B b. Find A a.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">C c</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is C c. Find A a.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><div class=\"quiz-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary quiz-check\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-check-double\"></i> Check</button><button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary quiz-retry\" hidden=\"\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate-left\"></i> Try again</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-score\" role=\"status\"></span></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-rtti\" hidden=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b8efd777f4\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.1 §22 ¶0\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.1-22-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §22 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §22 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">CEFR cross-reference</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9ace50ee5c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.1 §22 ¶1\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.1-22-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §22 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §22 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Secondary reference only. Pre-A1 can-do statements adapted from the CEFR Companion Volume (2020); not an official CEFR test.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"426b6c16d2\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.1 §22 ¶2\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.1-22-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.1 §22 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.1 §22 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶2</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>I can say <em>good morning</em> and my name when someone greets me.</li>\n<li>I can recognise the letter A a.</li>\n</ul></div>"}, {"id": "S.2", "title": "Session S002: I am, you are", "order": 2, "goals": ["Course plan outcome: Pupils say who they are and who the other person is with I am / you are (Listening and Speaking), and recognise and copy the letter B b.", "Success criterion 1: I can say I am and my name, and you are and my friend's name.", "Success criterion 2: I can do a short pair: Hello. I am … – Hello. You are …", "Success criterion 3: I can say I am and you are with the teacher.", "Success criterion 4: I know that I is the speaker and you is the other person.", "Success criterion 5: I can point to B b and copy it."], "metadata": {"status": "draft", "grade": "1", "week": "1", "session": "S002", "setting": "Home, still morning", "characters": "Bora, Sreyneang, Yeay Chan", "subject": "Foreign Languages (English)", "moeys_reference": "see L.0 §1 (Curriculum Framework 2016)", "cefr_cross_reference": "Pre-A1 (adapted, CEFR Companion Volume)", "duration": "one study hour (40 min)", "updated": "2026-11-06 (v1.6.0)"}, "file": "s002-i-am-you-are.md", "notes": ["<p>Khmer words and pupil sentences to be verified by a native speaker (Grade 1 level). Khmer spelling of the character names (Yeay យាយ, Kru គ្រូ, Bora បូរ៉ា, Sreyneang ស្រីណាង, Sopheak សុភ័ក្ត្រ, Chan ចាន់) also to be verified.</p>\n", "<p>The minute split is ours; the course plan gives the E1–E9 steps but no timings. With 30–50 pupils, E7 is done with a sample of pupils each session, so every pupil is checked across the week.</p>\n", "<p>CEFR Pre-A1 describes recognising letters but prescribes no order for the alphabet. The order (one letter per session, A a to F f in weeks 1–2) comes from the course plan.</p>\n"], "blocks": [{"ref": "S.2 §0 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-0-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "2e135f2914", "text": "Session S002: I am, you are", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §0 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-0-1", "kind": "figure", "h": "da39a3ee5e", "text": "", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §0 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-0-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "9727ca56ef", "text": "Week 1 · Home, still morning · Bora, Sreyneang, Yeay Chan.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §0 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-0-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a2649d7e59", "text": "Point with the twins: I am for me, you are for the person I talk to. New letter: B b .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §1 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-1-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "025eec04ab", "text": "MoEYS frame", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §1 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-1-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ac36d97d4a", "text": "This session serves the MoEYS frame in L.0 §1 ¶2 : core competency 4.2, the Listening and Speaking components plus one letter, and one 40-minute study hour.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §1 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-1-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2baba6e82b", "text": "Session syllabus:", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §1 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-1-3", "kind": "table", "h": "7c1ffd7294", "text": "Function Form Vocabulary Grammar Letter Saying who you are and who the other person is Hello. I am Bora. – Hello. You are Bora. I, you, name, hello (good morning: reinforce) to be: I am / you are B b", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §2 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-2-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "5a49743b7a", "text": "Feed up (E1: theme introduction)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §2 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-2-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "15268f42b4", "text": "Yeay Chan sits with the twins. She points to Bora, then to Sreyneang. The children learn two small sentences: I am … and You are …", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §2 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-2-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c36d92fa0a", "text": "Situational: naming yourself and the person in front of you. Broad: identity with to be .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §2 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-2-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "071f0e2d7e", "text": "Scene: picture I and you (to be drawn)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §3 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-3-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "7660a32c11", "text": "Words this session", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §3 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-3-1", "kind": "table", "h": "ef34afb1d7", "text": "Word Role I reproduce you reproduce name reproduce hello reproduce good morning reinforce", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §4 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-4-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "dd17342cb4", "text": "Grammar", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §4 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-4-1", "kind": "list", "h": "4ce674f4b3", "text": "Primary: I am / you are Reinforce: good morning from S001 Reach-ahead: he is / she is — do not teach. If it slips out, model and move on (S005).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §5 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-5-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "f7c6b8a70c", "text": "Letters (MoEYS)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §5 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-5-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "fdf9cf7e87", "text": "Card: letter card B b", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §5 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-5-2", "kind": "table", "h": "753989992e", "text": "Letter B b Name B Sound /b/ as in Bora (story name, already in the room). Whole word Point to B at the start of Bora . Do not add ball . Write Air-write, then copy B b .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §6 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-6-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "da75f75ee9", "text": "By the end of this session you will be able to:", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §6 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-6-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §6 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-6-2", "kind": "list", "h": "72da8eddbe", "text": "Say I am + your name. Point to a friend and say you are + their name. Point to B b .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §6 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-6-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §6 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.2-6-4", "kind": "list", "h": "806974b67a", "text": "Do a two-line pair: Hello. I am [name]. — Hello. You are [name].", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §6 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.2-6-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §6 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.2-6-6", "kind": "list", "h": "db2cbf06a6", "text": "Use I am / you are with the teacher, not only with the twin picture.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §6 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.2-6-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §6 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.2-6-8", "kind": "list", "h": "37951d5d2e", "text": "Feel the difference: I is the speaker. You is the person you talk to. The words swap when it is the other person's turn.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §7 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-7-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "52f7c040c5", "text": "Words with Khmer", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §7 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-7-1", "kind": "table", "h": "aabfa7b864", "text": "Word Khmer I ខ្ញុំ you អ្នក name ឈ្មោះ hello សួស្តី good morning អរុណសួស្តី", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §7 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-7-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d466e110d2", "text": "Learning goal: Today we say I am and you are.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §7 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-7-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c3d9faca8a", "text": "In Khmer: ថ្ងៃនេះ យើងនិយាយ I am និង you are។", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §7 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.2-7-4", "kind": "table", "h": "a15fe26ad9", "text": "# Success criterion (pupil words) RTTI Khmer (pupil words) Picture or gesture cue 1 I can say I am and my name, and you are and my friend's name. Reproduction (R) ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ I am និងឈ្មោះខ្ញុំ ហើយ you are និងឈ្មោះមិត្ត។ hand on chest, then point 2 I can do a short pair: Hello. I am … – Hello. You are … Training (T1) ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយជាគូ៖ Hello. I am … – Hello. You are … two hands talking 3 I can say I am and you are with the teacher. Transfer (T2) ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ I am និង you are ជាមួយគ្រូ។ point to the teacher 4 I know that I is the speaker and you is the other person. Insight (I) ខ្ញុំដឹងថា I គឺអ្នកនិយាយ ហើយ you គឺអ្នកម្នាក់ទៀត។ swap hands 5 I can point to B b and copy it. Letter (R) ខ្ញុំអាចចង្អុល B b ហើយចម្លងវា។ air-write B", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §7 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.2-7-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "40bea74885", "text": "Criteria 1–4 are the four goals above in pupil words; criterion 5 is the letter. Draw the five cues on the board and point to them at the start and at the end.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §8 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-8-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "a343dabcab", "text": "RTTI rubric for the teacher", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §8 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-8-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "fa9039d2ed", "text": "RTTI categories: R Reproduction, T1 Training, T2 Transfer, I Insight. They are categories, not a ladder: a pupil can be strong in Transfer and weak in Reproduction. Pass rule (E7): at least 3 of the 4 Reproduction and Training checks, plus the letter. Transfer and Insight are watched; they do not block a pass.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §8 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-8-2", "kind": "table", "h": "27b1c5f010", "text": "Criterion R – Reproduction T1 – Training T2 – Transfer I – Insight 1. I can say I am and my name, and you are and my friend's name. Look for: I am [own name] is automatic. If not yet: child still needs the S001 chant every time. Say: \"You said it clearly.\" Next (E9): Say I am and your name three times before the next session — at the door is enough. Point to B if you see it. Needed to pass. (rated green) — — — 2. I can do a short pair: Hello. I am … – Hello. You are … — Look for: two-line pair without a freeze. If not yet: child can only complete your sentence. Say: \"You answered by yourself.\" Next (E9): You know I am . Next time put you are right after it, looking at your friend. Needed to pass. (rated green) — — 3. I can say I am and you are with the teacher. — — Look for: works with you, away from the twins picture. If not yet: only works when facing Bora/Sreyneang cards. Say: \"You did it with someone new.\" Next (E9): It works with your classmate. Next time try I am / you are with me at the door. Watched, with help. (rated yellow) — 4. I know that I is the speaker and you is the other person. — — — Look for: child laughs or nods when you swap seats and I / you swap. If not yet: child thinks I is a name like Bora. Use the chest-point. Do not explain pronoun . Say: \"You showed me why.\" Next (E9): Watch who is talking. I walks with that person. We will use that again when we meet he and she . Watched, stretch goal. (rated red) 5. I can point to B b and copy it. (letter) Look for: Points to B b and copies it (air-write counts). If not yet: Points to the wrong card: say the name and sound again, air-write together. Say: \"You found B.\" Next (E9): \"Look for b in your name or on the board.\" Needed to pass. (rated green) — — —", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §9 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-9-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "ba0b563256", "text": "E2: Entry readiness", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §9 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-9-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e71ead9192", "text": "From S001. Speaking, pointing, tracing.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §9 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-9-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §9 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-9-3", "kind": "list", "h": "4745758596", "text": "Say good morning . Say your name. Point to B b (letter card B b). Say B or /b/.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §9 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.2-9-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §9 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.2-9-5", "kind": "list", "h": "f142674766", "text": "Point to yourself when the teacher says I . Point to the teacher when they say you .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §9 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.2-9-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7c524fe058", "text": "Routing: 0 wrong = move through E3 at a light pace. 1–2 wrong = full E3–E6. 3 wrong = replay S001 E3 first.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b2a0279bfc", "text": "E3: Core teaching conversation", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a0c14e277c", "text": "Yeay Chan helps the twins name I and you . Default learner role: either twin.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "13372b6af1", "text": "Audio: recording I am / you are (to be recorded)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a19c50706a", "text": "Yeay Chan: Hello, Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f57b7728f6", "text": "Bora: Hello, Yeay. I am Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a4045a6e66", "text": "Yeay Chan: Hello, Sreyneang.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "0f9496ca13", "text": "Sreyneang: Hello, Yeay. I am Sreyneang.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "11619d323c", "text": "Yeay Chan: Bora, you are Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "1404f8777f", "text": "Bora: Yes. I am Bora. You are Yeay.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶11", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-11", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ad1ee7f5b0", "text": "Yeay Chan: Sreyneang, you are Sreyneang.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶12", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-12", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c5f7a52c3c", "text": "Sreyneang: Yes. I am Sreyneang. You are Yeay.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶13", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-13", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶14", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-14", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7ce128bfd1", "text": "Child and teacher, no picture:", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶15", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-15", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d11fd0f37b", "text": "Child: Hello. I am [name].", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶16", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-16", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "bc15997cef", "text": "Teacher: Hello. You are [name]. I am [teacher name].", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶17", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-17", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "1885207173", "text": "Child: You are [teacher name].", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶18", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-18", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §10 ¶19", "anchor": "p-S.2-10-19", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "3bc20d9562", "text": "Hold your own chest, then point to the child. I stays with the speaker. When Sreyneang talks, I is Sreyneang. You is always the other person.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §11 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-11-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "d10e9904fa", "text": "E4: Going further", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §11 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-11-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §11 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-11-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "259136d394", "text": "Why this works Bora says I am Bora about himself. He says You are Yeay to the person he is looking at. The pointing in the room is the grammar.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §11 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-11-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §11 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.2-11-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c935c520ee", "text": "Watch out for", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §11 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.2-11-5", "kind": "list", "h": "a6f2697e6d", "text": "I am + someone else's name (echoing the last child). Reset with a silent point to the child's own chest. You are said while pointing at oneself. Smile, switch the point, try once more. Adding he / she because an older sibling uses it. Leave it for S005.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §11 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.2-11-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §11 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.2-11-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "64a10bc303", "text": "Cultural context Khmer khnhom / anak (or a kinship term instead of you ) does a similar job. English you is one word for Yeay and for a friend. The respect stays in the name, not in a different pronoun.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §11 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.2-11-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "48136dddf5", "text": "Going further", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §11 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.2-11-9", "kind": "list", "h": "593284287e", "text": "If I turn to a new person, who is you now? Can two children both say I am and both be right?", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §12 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-12-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "f7c6b8a70c", "text": "Letters (MoEYS)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §12 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-12-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "fdf9cf7e87", "text": "Card: letter card B b", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §12 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-12-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "4d7b855980", "text": "Show B b . Name B , sound /b/. Point to B in Bora . Air-write, then copy B b . One letter only.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §13 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-13-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "e2f0c8f8c9", "text": "E5: Teacher notes", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §13 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-13-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "69e059f56a", "text": "For the teacher.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §13 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-13-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b18f54dce0", "text": "Lesson intent Lock I am / you are as body grammar (point + speak) so week 2 can add he is / she is without confusion.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §13 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-13-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b230d097fd", "text": "RTTI guidance", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §13 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.2-13-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7b5dabcaee", "text": "Reproduction (R) — Strong: I am [own name] is automatic. Weak: child still needs the S001 chant every time.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §13 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.2-13-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "9b724b1c7e", "text": "Training (T1) — Strong: two-line pair without a freeze. Weak: child can only complete your sentence.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §13 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.2-13-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "edf33be8af", "text": "Transfer (T2) — Strong: works with you, away from the twins picture. Weak: only works when facing Bora/Sreyneang cards.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §13 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.2-13-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "facc63a005", "text": "Insight (I) — Strong: child laughs or nods when you swap seats and I / you swap. Weak: child thinks I is a name like Bora. Use the chest-point. Do not explain pronoun .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §13 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.2-13-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2161bc2a7a", "text": "Common errors", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §13 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.2-13-9", "kind": "list", "h": "4a43caa9b6", "text": "Khmer word order leftover: name first, then I am . Accept, then model I am [name] . You is — do not lecture. Repeat you are and move on. Whole-class I am shouted together, so nobody owns a name.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §13 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.2-13-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "4acfc3d5dc", "text": "Reach-ahead He is / she is — S005. This / that — later weeks.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §13 ¶11", "anchor": "p-S.2-13-11", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "495425ddfd", "text": "Cultural notes Pointing at a person with one finger can feel sharp. Use an open hand toward the person, and the chest for I .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §13 ¶12", "anchor": "p-S.2-13-12", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2278d3f6d9", "text": "Letters Today B b . Name, /b/, copy. Point in Bora . No extra word.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §14 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-14-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "49bdda0e0e", "text": "E6: Practice", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §14 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-14-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §14 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-14-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "89a0f6eb1a", "text": "Circle. Child A: Hello. I am [name]. Child B: Hello. You are [name]. I am [name]. Child A: You are [name]. Swap.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §14 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-14-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §14 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.2-14-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f165cf64ae", "text": "One child leaves the circle and greets you at the board with the same four lines. New place, same words.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §14 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.2-14-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §14 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.2-14-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "eab2ec812b", "text": "Letters Air-write B b , then copy. Point to B in Bora if the name card is up.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §15 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-15-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "9e9a020100", "text": "E7: Exit check", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §15 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-15-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "0baff986e0", "text": "Eight spoken checks, two per category, plus one letter check. Pass on Reproduction and Training (at least 3 of those 4) and the letter check. Transfer and Insight are watched — they do not block a pass.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §15 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-15-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §15 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-15-3", "kind": "list", "h": "ca3a602f0e", "text": "I am [own name]. Points correctly for I (self) and you (you).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §15 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.2-15-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §15 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.2-15-5", "kind": "list", "h": "c2d9d84c27", "text": "Completes the two-line pair with a classmate. Uses you are + the classmate's real name.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §15 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.2-15-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §15 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.2-15-7", "kind": "list", "h": "c23b7a3335", "text": "Does the pair with you, not only a classmate. Still uses I am after you change places in the room.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §15 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.2-15-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §15 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.2-15-9", "kind": "list", "h": "3ca0a5b2c0", "text": "After you swap seats, child can show that I moved with the speaker. In Khmer or by pointing: I is not a person's name. It means the speaker.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §15 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.2-15-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "3fed1c2293", "text": "Letters 9. Points to B b (letter card B b) and copies it (air-write counts).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §16 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-16-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "66ba33e460", "text": "E8: Formative evaluation and reformat", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §16 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-16-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "375ad3f15f", "text": "[Name], you can say who you are. You are is the new piece. We will use both again tomorrow with hello .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §16 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-16-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2eccf29380", "text": "Reformat triggers — E3 only. Max two.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §16 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-16-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §16 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.2-16-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b82244660a", "text": "Reproduction weak: Only I am [name] with chest-point. Drop you are until the next loop.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §16 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.2-16-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §16 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.2-16-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "020b90619c", "text": "Training weak: You take Yeay's lines. Child takes one twin only.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §16 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.2-16-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §16 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.2-16-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "4705cdc4f9", "text": "Transfer weak: Stay at the desks. Skip the board.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §16 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.2-16-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §16 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.2-16-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c85b9ae58e", "text": "Insight weak: Do not ask for words about I / you . The chest-point is the whole Insight check.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §17 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-17-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b170a2e736", "text": "E9: Feed forward", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §17 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-17-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "278c4382bd", "text": "One message. Spoken.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §17 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-17-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §17 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-17-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7b0e33e919", "text": "Say I am and your name three times before the next session — at the door is enough. Point to B if you see it.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §17 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.2-17-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §17 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.2-17-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "78743a1776", "text": "You know I am . Next time put you are right after it, looking at your friend.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §17 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.2-17-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §17 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.2-17-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "873d8d31eb", "text": "It works with your classmate. Next time try I am / you are with me at the door.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §17 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.2-17-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §17 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.2-17-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "fd7738bf32", "text": "Watch who is talking. I walks with that person. We will use that again when we meet he and she .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §18 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-18-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "81640ecdaf", "text": "Teacher-led session (one study hour, 40 min)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §18 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-18-1", "kind": "table", "h": "27356fb17e", "text": "Step Minutes What happens E1 Theme and feed up 5 Show the picture, say the learning goal, point to the five cues. E2 Entry readiness 4 Quick check; route pupils as in E2. E3 Core conversation 10 Teacher in role; the class answers, then small groups. E4 Going further 4 Watch-out points and the cultural note. E6 Practice and letter 8 Role-play in pairs; air-write and copy the letter. E7 Exit check 6 Spoken checks with a sample of pupils; note the RTTI categories. E8–E9 Reformat and feed forward 3 Back to the five cues; one feed-forward message per pupil or group.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §18 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-18-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "30e5cd2054", "text": "E5 is for the teacher before the session.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §19 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-19-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "86b4ba2ff9", "text": "Story", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §19 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-19-1", "kind": "scene", "h": "da39a3ee5e", "text": "", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §20 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-20-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "e9029a8cd7", "text": "Self-paced app session", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §20 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-20-1", "kind": "list", "h": "2592e52e01", "text": "Listen: the home picture with the dialogue; tap Bora, Sreyneang or Yeay Chan to hear the line. Point and say: a hand points to the speaker ( I am ) or to the other person ( you are ); the pupil records the sentence. Pair game: the app plays one twin; the pupil answers Hello. You are … . Letter card: tap B b (name and sound /b/); find B at the start of Bora ; trace B b. Quiz: five questions.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §20 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-20-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "58ce12752a", "text": "The learner story above is the JSON scene player ( scenes/s002.json ); edit that file to change lines or timing without rebuilding Markdown.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §20 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-20-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6df6c9f3e3", "text": "The app shows the five cues at the start and the feed-forward message from E9 at the end.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §21 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-21-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "25c86f6a92", "text": "Quiz", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §21 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-21-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f331673cc7", "text": "Each question checks one success criterion in one RTTI category. After Check , the quiz shows the result per criterion and what to try next.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §21 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-21-2", "kind": "table", "h": "0355642a8e", "text": "Success criterion RTTI Question 1 Reproduction R 1 2 Training T1 2 3 Transfer T2 3 4 Insight I 4 5 Letter B b R 5", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §21 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.2-21-3", "kind": "quiz", "h": "57837a12fc", "text": "1. Bora points to himself. What does he say? Criterion 1 · RTTI level R I am Bora. Yes! I is the speaker: I am Bora. You are Bora. You is for the other person. Bora says: I am Bora. I am Yeay. That is not his name. Bora says: I am Bora. 2. Sreyneang says \"Hello. I am Sreyneang.\" What does Bora answer? Criterion 2 · RTTI level T1 Hello. I am Sreyneang. That is her line. Bora talks to her: You are Sreyneang. Hello. You are Sreyneang. Yes! You are and her name. Good night, Sreyneang. It is morning. Say: Hello. You are Sreyneang. 3. 🧑‍🏫 The teacher says \"Hello. I am Kru Sopheak.\" What do you say? Criterion 3 · RTTI level T2 I am Kru Sopheak. You are not Kru Sopheak. Say: You are Kru Sopheak. Hello. You are Bora. Talk to the teacher: You are Kru Sopheak. You are Kru Sopheak. Yes! You used you are with a new person. 4. Bora says \"I am Bora.\" Then Sreyneang talks. Who is \"I\" now? Criterion 4 · RTTI level I Bora Bora is not talking now. I is always the speaker. Sreyneang Yes! I moves with the speaker. Yeay Chan Yeay Chan is listening. I is the one who talks. 5. 🔤 Which card is the letter B b? Criterion 5 · RTTI level R A a That is A a. Find B b. B b Yes! B b, as at the start of Bora. D d That is D d. Find B b. Check Try again", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §22 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.2-22-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b8efd777f4", "text": "CEFR cross-reference", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §22 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.2-22-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "9ace50ee5c", "text": "Secondary reference only. Pre-A1 can-do statements adapted from the CEFR Companion Volume (2020); not an official CEFR test.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.2 §22 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.2-22-2", "kind": "list", "h": "0f72034ba4", "text": "I can say who I am and who you are with I am / you are . I can recognise the letter B b.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}], "html": "<div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2e135f2914\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §0 ¶0\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.2-0-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §0 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §0 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶0</button><h1 data-body=\"1\">Session S002: I am, you are</h1></div><div class=\"blk blk-figure fl-full\" data-h=\"da39a3ee5e\" data-kind=\"figure\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §0 ¶1\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.2-0-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §0 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §0 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶1</button><figure class=\"fig fig-full\" data-body=\"1\" data-marker=\"full\"><button aria-label=\"Enlarge image: Letter card B b\" class=\"img-zoom\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Letter card B b\" data-src=\"images/letter-b.svg\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"assets/images/images/letter-b.svg\"/></button></figure></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9727ca56ef\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §0 ¶2\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.2-0-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §0 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §0 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Week 1 · Home, still morning · Bora, Sreyneang, Yeay Chan.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a2649d7e59\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §0 ¶3\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.2-0-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §0 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §0 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">Point with the twins: <em>I am</em> for me, <em>you are</em> for the person I talk to. New letter: <strong>B b</strong>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"025eec04ab\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §1 ¶0\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.2-1-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §1 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §1 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">MoEYS frame</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ac36d97d4a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §1 ¶1\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.2-1-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §1 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §1 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">This session serves the MoEYS frame in <a data-href=\"#p-L.0-1-2\" href=\"#p-L.0-1-2\">L.0 §1 ¶2</a>: core competency 4.2, the Listening and Speaking components plus one letter, and one 40-minute study hour.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2baba6e82b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §1 ¶2\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.2-1-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §1 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §1 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Session syllabus:</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7c1ffd7294\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §1 ¶3\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.2-1-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §1 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §1 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶3</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Function</th>\n<th>Form</th>\n<th>Vocabulary</th>\n<th>Grammar</th>\n<th>Letter</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Saying who you are and who the other person is</td>\n<td>Hello. I am Bora. – Hello. You are Bora.</td>\n<td>I, you, name, hello (good morning: reinforce)</td>\n<td>to be: I am / you are</td>\n<td>B b</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5a49743b7a\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §2 ¶0\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.2-2-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §2 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §2 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Feed up (E1: theme introduction)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"15268f42b4\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §2 ¶1\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.2-2-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §2 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §2 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Yeay Chan sits with the twins. She points to Bora, then to Sreyneang. The children learn two small sentences: <em>I am …</em> and <em>You are …</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c36d92fa0a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §2 ¶2\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.2-2-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §2 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §2 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Situational:</strong> naming yourself and the person in front of you.\n<strong>Broad:</strong> identity with <em>to be</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"071f0e2d7e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §2 ¶3\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.2-2-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §2 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §2 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">Scene: picture <em>I and you</em> (to be drawn)</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7660a32c11\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §3 ¶0\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.2-3-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §3 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §3 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Words this session</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ef34afb1d7\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §3 ¶1\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.2-3-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §3 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §3 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Word</th>\n<th>Role</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>reproduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>you</td>\n<td>reproduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>name</td>\n<td>reproduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hello</td>\n<td>reproduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>good morning</td>\n<td>reinforce</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"dd17342cb4\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §4 ¶0\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-S.2-4-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §4 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §4 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Grammar</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4ce674f4b3\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §4 ¶1\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-S.2-4-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §4 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §4 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶1</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Primary:</strong> <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em></li>\n<li><strong>Reinforce:</strong> <em>good morning</em> from S001</li>\n<li><strong>Reach-ahead:</strong> <em>he is / she is</em> — do not teach. If it slips out, model and move on (S005).</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f7c6b8a70c\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §5 ¶0\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.2-5-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §5 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §5 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Letters (MoEYS)</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"fdf9cf7e87\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §5 ¶1\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.2-5-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §5 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §5 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Card: letter card B b</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"753989992e\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §5 ¶2\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.2-5-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §5 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §5 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Letter</td>\n<td><strong>B b</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Name</td>\n<td><em>B</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sound</td>\n<td>/b/ as in <em>Bora</em> (story name, already in the room).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Whole word</td>\n<td>Point to <em>B</em> at the start of <em>Bora</em>. Do not add <em>ball</em>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write</td>\n<td>Air-write, then copy <em>B b</em>.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"da75f75ee9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §6 ¶0\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.2-6-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §6 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §6 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">By the end of this session you will be able to:</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §6 ¶1\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.2-6-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §6 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §6 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"72da8eddbe\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §6 ¶2\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.2-6-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §6 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §6 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶2</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Say <em>I am</em> + your name. Point to a friend and say <em>you are</em> + their name. Point to <strong>B b</strong>.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §6 ¶3\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.2-6-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §6 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §6 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"806974b67a\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.2 §6 ¶4\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.2-6-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §6 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §6 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶4</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"2\">\n<li>Do a two-line pair: <em>Hello. I am [name].</em> — <em>Hello. You are [name].</em></li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.2 §6 ¶5\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.2-6-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §6 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §6 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"db2cbf06a6\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.2 §6 ¶6\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.2-6-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §6 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §6 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶6</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"3\">\n<li>Use <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em> with the teacher, not only with the twin picture.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.2 §6 ¶7\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.2-6-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §6 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §6 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"37951d5d2e\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.2 §6 ¶8\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.2-6-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §6 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §6 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶8</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"4\">\n<li>Feel the difference: <em>I</em> is the speaker. <em>You</em> is the person you talk to. The words swap when it is the other person's turn.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"52f7c040c5\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §7 ¶0\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.2-7-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §7 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §7 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Words with Khmer</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"aabfa7b864\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §7 ¶1\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.2-7-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §7 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §7 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Word</th>\n<th>Khmer</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>you</td>\n<td>អ្នក</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>name</td>\n<td>ឈ្មោះ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hello</td>\n<td>សួស្តី</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>good morning</td>\n<td>អរុណសួស្តី</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d466e110d2\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §7 ¶2\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.2-7-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §7 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §7 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Learning goal:</strong> Today we say I am and you are.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c3d9faca8a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §7 ¶3\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.2-7-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §7 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §7 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>In Khmer:</strong> ថ្ងៃនេះ យើងនិយាយ I am និង you are។</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a15fe26ad9\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.2 §7 ¶4\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.2-7-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §7 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §7 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶4</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>Success criterion (pupil words)</th>\n<th>RTTI</th>\n<th>Khmer (pupil words)</th>\n<th>Picture or gesture cue</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>I can say <em>I am</em> and my name, and <em>you are</em> and my friend's name.</td>\n<td>Reproduction (R)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ I am និងឈ្មោះខ្ញុំ ហើយ you are និងឈ្មោះមិត្ត។</td>\n<td>hand on chest, then point</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>I can do a short pair: <em>Hello. I am …</em> – <em>Hello. You are …</em></td>\n<td>Training (T1)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយជាគូ៖ Hello. I am … – Hello. You are …</td>\n<td>two hands talking</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>I can say <em>I am</em> and <em>you are</em> with the teacher.</td>\n<td>Transfer (T2)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ I am និង you are ជាមួយគ្រូ។</td>\n<td>point to the teacher</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>I know that <em>I</em> is the speaker and <em>you</em> is the other person.</td>\n<td>Insight (I)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំដឹងថា I គឺអ្នកនិយាយ ហើយ you គឺអ្នកម្នាក់ទៀត។</td>\n<td>swap hands</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>I can point to <strong>B b</strong> and copy it.</td>\n<td>Letter (R)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចចង្អុល B b ហើយចម្លងវា។</td>\n<td>air-write B</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"40bea74885\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.2 §7 ¶5\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.2-7-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §7 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §7 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\">Criteria 1–4 are the four goals above in pupil words; criterion 5 is the letter. Draw the five cues on the board and point to them at the start and at the end.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a343dabcab\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §8 ¶0\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.2-8-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §8 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §8 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">RTTI rubric for the teacher</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"fa9039d2ed\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §8 ¶1\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.2-8-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §8 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §8 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">RTTI categories: <strong>R</strong> Reproduction, <strong>T1</strong> Training, <strong>T2</strong> Transfer, <strong>I</strong> Insight. They are categories, not a ladder: a pupil can be strong in Transfer and weak in Reproduction. Pass rule (E7): at least 3 of the 4 Reproduction and Training checks, plus the letter. Transfer and Insight are watched; they do not block a pass.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"27b1c5f010\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §8 ¶2\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.2-8-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §8 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §8 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Criterion</th>\n<th>R – Reproduction</th>\n<th>T1 – Training</th>\n<th>T2 – Transfer</th>\n<th>I – Insight</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1. I can say <em>I am</em> and my name, and <em>you are</em> and my friend's name.</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> <em>I am [own name]</em> is automatic. <strong>If not yet:</strong> child still needs the S001 chant every time. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You said it clearly.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> Say <em>I am</em> and your name three times before the next session — at the door is enough. Point to <em>B</em> if you see it. <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. I can do a short pair: <em>Hello. I am …</em> – <em>Hello. You are …</em></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> two-line pair without a freeze. <strong>If not yet:</strong> child can only complete your sentence. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You answered by yourself.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> You know <em>I am</em>. Next time put <em>you are</em> right after it, looking at your friend. <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. I can say <em>I am</em> and <em>you are</em> with the teacher.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-yellow\"><strong>Look for:</strong> works with you, away from the twins picture. <strong>If not yet:</strong> only works when facing Bora/Sreyneang cards. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You did it with someone new.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> It works with your classmate. Next time try <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em> with me at the door. <em>Watched, with help.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"yellow\" title=\"Rated yellow\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated yellow)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. I know that <em>I</em> is the speaker and <em>you</em> is the other person.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-red\"><strong>Look for:</strong> child laughs or nods when you swap seats and <em>I</em> / <em>you</em> swap. <strong>If not yet:</strong> child thinks <em>I</em> is a name like Bora. Use the chest-point. Do not explain <em>pronoun</em>. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You showed me why.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> Watch who is talking. <em>I</em> walks with that person. We will use that again when we meet <em>he</em> and <em>she</em>. <em>Watched, stretch goal.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"red\" title=\"Rated red\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-xmark\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated red)</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. I can point to <strong>B b</strong> and copy it. (letter)</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> Points to <strong>B b</strong> and copies it (air-write counts). <strong>If not yet:</strong> Points to the wrong card: say the name and sound again, air-write together. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You found B.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> \"Look for b in your name or on the board.\" <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ba0b563256\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §9 ¶0\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.2-9-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §9 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §9 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E2: Entry readiness</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e71ead9192\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §9 ¶1\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.2-9-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §9 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §9 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>From S001. Speaking, pointing, tracing.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §9 ¶2\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.2-9-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §9 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §9 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4745758596\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §9 ¶3\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.2-9-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §9 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §9 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶3</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Say <em>good morning</em>.</li>\n<li>Say your name.</li>\n<li>Point to <strong>B b</strong> (letter card B b). Say <em>B</em> or /b/.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.2 §9 ¶4\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.2-9-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §9 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §9 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f142674766\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.2 §9 ¶5\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.2-9-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §9 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §9 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶5</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"4\">\n<li>Point to yourself when the teacher says <em>I</em>. Point to the teacher when they say <em>you</em>.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7c524fe058\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.2 §9 ¶6\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.2-9-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §9 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §9 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Routing:</strong> 0 wrong = move through E3 at a light pace. 1–2 wrong = full E3–E6. 3 wrong = replay S001 E3 first.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b2a0279bfc\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶0\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E3: Core teaching conversation</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a0c14e277c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶1\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Yeay Chan helps the twins name <em>I</em> and <em>you</em>. Default learner role: either twin.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"13372b6af1\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶2\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Audio: recording <em>I am / you are</em> (to be recorded)</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶3\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a19c50706a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶4\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Yeay Chan:</strong> Hello, Bora.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f57b7728f6\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶5\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> Hello, Yeay. I am Bora.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a4045a6e66\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶6\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Yeay Chan:</strong> Hello, Sreyneang.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0f9496ca13\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶7\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Sreyneang:</strong> Hello, Yeay. I am Sreyneang.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶8\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"11619d323c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶9\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Yeay Chan:</strong> Bora, you are Bora.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"1404f8777f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶10\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> Yes. I am Bora. You are Yeay.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ad1ee7f5b0\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"11\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶11\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-11\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶11\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶11 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶11</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Yeay Chan:</strong> Sreyneang, you are Sreyneang.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c5f7a52c3c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"12\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶12\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-12\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶12\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶12 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶12</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Sreyneang:</strong> Yes. I am Sreyneang. You are Yeay.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"13\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶13\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-13\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶13\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶13 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶13</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7ce128bfd1\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"14\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶14\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-14\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶14\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶14 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶14</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Child and teacher, no picture:</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d11fd0f37b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"15\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶15\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-15\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶15\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶15 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶15</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Child:</strong> Hello. I am [name].</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"bc15997cef\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"16\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶16\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-16\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶16\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶16 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶16</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Teacher:</strong> Hello. You are [name]. I am [teacher name].</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"1885207173\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"17\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶17\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-17\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶17\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶17 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶17</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Child:</strong> You are [teacher name].</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"18\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶18\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-18\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶18\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶18 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶18</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3bc20d9562\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"19\" data-ref=\"S.2 §10 ¶19\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.2-10-19\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §10 ¶19\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §10 ¶19 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶19</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Hold your own chest, then point to the child.</em>\n<em>I</em> stays with the speaker. When Sreyneang talks, <em>I</em> is Sreyneang. <em>You</em> is always the other person.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d10e9904fa\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §11 ¶0\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.2-11-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §11 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §11 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E4: Going further</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §11 ¶1\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.2-11-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §11 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §11 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"259136d394\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §11 ¶2\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.2-11-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §11 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §11 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Why this works</strong>\nBora says <em>I am Bora</em> about himself. He says <em>You are Yeay</em> to the person he is looking at. The pointing in the room is the grammar.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §11 ¶3\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.2-11-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §11 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §11 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c935c520ee\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.2 §11 ¶4\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.2-11-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §11 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §11 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Watch out for</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a6f2697e6d\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.2 §11 ¶5\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.2-11-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §11 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §11 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶5</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><em>I am</em> + someone else's name (echoing the last child). Reset with a silent point to the child's own chest.</li>\n<li><em>You are</em> said while pointing at oneself. Smile, switch the point, try once more.</li>\n<li>Adding <em>he</em> / <em>she</em> because an older sibling uses it. Leave it for S005.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.2 §11 ¶6\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.2-11-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §11 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §11 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"64a10bc303\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.2 §11 ¶7\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.2-11-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §11 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §11 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Cultural context</strong>\nKhmer <em>khnhom</em> / <em>anak</em> (or a kinship term instead of <em>you</em>) does a similar job. English <em>you</em> is one word for Yeay and for a friend. The respect stays in the name, not in a different pronoun.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"48136dddf5\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.2 §11 ¶8\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.2-11-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §11 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §11 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Going further</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"593284287e\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.2 §11 ¶9\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.2-11-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §11 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §11 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶9</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>If I turn to a new person, who is <em>you</em> now?</li>\n<li>Can two children both say <em>I am</em> and both be right?</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f7c6b8a70c\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §12 ¶0\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.2-12-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §12 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §12 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Letters (MoEYS)</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"fdf9cf7e87\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §12 ¶1\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.2-12-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §12 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §12 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Card: letter card B b</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4d7b855980\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §12 ¶2\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.2-12-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §12 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §12 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Show <em>B b</em>. Name <em>B</em>, sound /b/. Point to <em>B</em> in <em>Bora</em>. Air-write, then copy <em>B b</em>. One letter only.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e2f0c8f8c9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §13 ¶0\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.2-13-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §13 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §13 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E5: Teacher notes</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"69e059f56a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §13 ¶1\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.2-13-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §13 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §13 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>For the teacher.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b18f54dce0\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §13 ¶2\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.2-13-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §13 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §13 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Lesson intent</strong>\nLock <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em> as body grammar (point + speak) so week 2 can add <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em> without confusion.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b230d097fd\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §13 ¶3\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.2-13-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §13 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §13 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>RTTI guidance</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7b5dabcaee\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.2 §13 ¶4\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.2-13-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §13 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §13 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong> — Strong: <em>I am [own name]</em> is automatic. Weak: child still needs the S001 chant every time.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9b724b1c7e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.2 §13 ¶5\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.2-13-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §13 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §13 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong> — Strong: two-line pair without a freeze. Weak: child can only complete your sentence.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"edf33be8af\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.2 §13 ¶6\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.2-13-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §13 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §13 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong> — Strong: works with you, away from the twins picture. Weak: only works when facing Bora/Sreyneang cards.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"facc63a005\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.2 §13 ¶7\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.2-13-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §13 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §13 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong> — Strong: child laughs or nods when you swap seats and <em>I</em> / <em>you</em> swap. Weak: child thinks <em>I</em> is a name like Bora. Use the chest-point. Do not explain <em>pronoun</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2161bc2a7a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.2 §13 ¶8\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.2-13-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §13 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §13 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Common errors</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4a43caa9b6\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.2 §13 ¶9\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.2-13-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §13 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §13 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶9</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Khmer word order leftover: name first, then <em>I am</em>. Accept, then model <em>I am [name]</em>.</li>\n<li><em>You is</em> — do not lecture. Repeat <em>you are</em> and move on.</li>\n<li>Whole-class <em>I am</em> shouted together, so nobody owns a name.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4acfc3d5dc\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.2 §13 ¶10\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.2-13-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §13 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §13 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reach-ahead</strong>\n<em>He is / she is</em> — S005. <em>This / that</em> — later weeks.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"495425ddfd\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"11\" data-ref=\"S.2 §13 ¶11\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.2-13-11\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §13 ¶11\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §13 ¶11 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶11</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Cultural notes</strong>\nPointing at a person with one finger can feel sharp. Use an open hand toward the person, and the chest for <em>I</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2278d3f6d9\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"12\" data-ref=\"S.2 §13 ¶12\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.2-13-12\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §13 ¶12\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §13 ¶12 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶12</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\nToday <strong>B b</strong>. Name, /b/, copy. Point in <em>Bora</em>. No extra word.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"49bdda0e0e\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §14 ¶0\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.2-14-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §14 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §14 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E6: Practice</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §14 ¶1\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.2-14-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §14 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §14 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"89a0f6eb1a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §14 ¶2\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.2-14-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §14 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §14 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Circle. Child A: <em>Hello. I am [name].</em> Child B: <em>Hello. You are [name]. I am [name].</em> Child A: <em>You are [name].</em> Swap.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §14 ¶3\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.2-14-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §14 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §14 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f165cf64ae\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.2 §14 ¶4\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.2-14-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §14 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §14 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\">One child leaves the circle and greets you at the board with the same four lines. New place, same words.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.2 §14 ¶5\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.2-14-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §14 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §14 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"eab2ec812b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.2 §14 ¶6\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.2-14-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §14 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §14 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\nAir-write <strong>B b</strong>, then copy. Point to <em>B</em> in <em>Bora</em> if the name card is up.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9e9a020100\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §15 ¶0\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.2-15-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §15 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §15 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E7: Exit check</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0baff986e0\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §15 ¶1\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.2-15-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §15 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §15 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Eight spoken checks, two per category, plus one letter check. Pass on Reproduction and Training (at least 3 of those 4) and the letter check. Transfer and Insight are watched — they do not block a pass.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §15 ¶2\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.2-15-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §15 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §15 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ca3a602f0e\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §15 ¶3\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.2-15-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §15 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §15 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶3</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li><em>I am [own name].</em></li>\n<li>Points correctly for <em>I</em> (self) and <em>you</em> (you).</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.2 §15 ¶4\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.2-15-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §15 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §15 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c2d9d84c27\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.2 §15 ¶5\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.2-15-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §15 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §15 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶5</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"3\">\n<li>Completes the two-line pair with a classmate.</li>\n<li>Uses <em>you are</em> + the classmate's real name.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.2 §15 ¶6\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.2-15-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §15 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §15 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c23b7a3335\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.2 §15 ¶7\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.2-15-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §15 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §15 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶7</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"5\">\n<li>Does the pair with you, not only a classmate.</li>\n<li>Still uses <em>I am</em> after you change places in the room.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.2 §15 ¶8\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.2-15-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §15 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §15 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3ca0a5b2c0\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.2 §15 ¶9\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.2-15-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §15 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §15 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶9</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"7\">\n<li>After you swap seats, child can show that <em>I</em> moved with the speaker.</li>\n<li>In Khmer or by pointing: <em>I</em> is not a person's name. It means the speaker.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3fed1c2293\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.2 §15 ¶10\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.2-15-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §15 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §15 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\n9. Points to <strong>B b</strong> (letter card B b) and copies it (air-write counts).</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"66ba33e460\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §16 ¶0\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.2-16-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §16 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §16 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E8: Formative evaluation and reformat</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"375ad3f15f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §16 ¶1\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.2-16-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §16 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §16 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">[Name], you can say who you are. <em>You are</em> is the new piece. We will use both again tomorrow with <em>hello</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2eccf29380\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §16 ¶2\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.2-16-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §16 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §16 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reformat triggers</strong> — E3 only. Max two.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §16 ¶3\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.2-16-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §16 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §16 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b82244660a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.2 §16 ¶4\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.2-16-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §16 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §16 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction weak:</strong> Only <em>I am [name]</em> with chest-point. Drop <em>you are</em> until the next loop.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.2 §16 ¶5\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.2-16-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §16 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §16 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"020b90619c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.2 §16 ¶6\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.2-16-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §16 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §16 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training weak:</strong> You take Yeay's lines. Child takes one twin only.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.2 §16 ¶7\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.2-16-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §16 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §16 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4705cdc4f9\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.2 §16 ¶8\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.2-16-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §16 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §16 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer weak:</strong> Stay at the desks. Skip the board.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.2 §16 ¶9\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.2-16-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §16 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §16 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c85b9ae58e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.2 §16 ¶10\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.2-16-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §16 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §16 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight weak:</strong> Do not ask for words about <em>I</em> / <em>you</em>. The chest-point is the whole Insight check.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b170a2e736\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §17 ¶0\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.2-17-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §17 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §17 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E9: Feed forward</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"278c4382bd\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §17 ¶1\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.2-17-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §17 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §17 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>One message. Spoken.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §17 ¶2\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.2-17-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §17 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §17 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7b0e33e919\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §17 ¶3\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.2-17-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §17 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §17 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">Say <em>I am</em> and your name three times before the next session — at the door is enough. Point to <em>B</em> if you see it.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.2 §17 ¶4\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.2-17-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §17 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §17 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"78743a1776\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.2 §17 ¶5\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.2-17-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §17 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §17 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\">You know <em>I am</em>. Next time put <em>you are</em> right after it, looking at your friend.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.2 §17 ¶6\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.2-17-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §17 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §17 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"873d8d31eb\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.2 §17 ¶7\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.2-17-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §17 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §17 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\">It works with your classmate. Next time try <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em> with me at the door.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.2 §17 ¶8\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.2-17-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §17 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §17 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"fd7738bf32\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.2 §17 ¶9\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.2-17-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §17 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §17 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\">Watch who is talking. <em>I</em> walks with that person. We will use that again when we meet <em>he</em> and <em>she</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"81640ecdaf\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §18 ¶0\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.2-18-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §18 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §18 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Teacher-led session (one study hour, 40 min)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"27356fb17e\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §18 ¶1\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.2-18-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §18 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §18 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Step</th>\n<th>Minutes</th>\n<th>What happens</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>E1 Theme and feed up</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Show the picture, say the learning goal, point to the five cues.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2 Entry readiness</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Quick check; route pupils as in E2.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E3 Core conversation</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>Teacher in role; the class answers, then small groups.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E4 Going further</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Watch-out points and the cultural note.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E6 Practice and letter</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Role-play in pairs; air-write and copy the letter.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E7 Exit check</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Spoken checks with a sample of pupils; note the RTTI categories.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E8–E9 Reformat and feed forward</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Back to the five cues; one feed-forward message per pupil or group.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"30e5cd2054\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §18 ¶2\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.2-18-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §18 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §18 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">E5 is for the teacher before the session.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"86b4ba2ff9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §19 ¶0\" data-sec=\"19\" id=\"p-S.2-19-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §19 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §19 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§19 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Story</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-scene\" data-h=\"da39a3ee5e\" data-kind=\"scene\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §19 ¶1\" data-sec=\"19\" id=\"p-S.2-19-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §19 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §19 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§19 ¶1</button><div class=\"tli-scene-player\" data-body=\"1\" data-scene=\"scenes/s002.json\"></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e9029a8cd7\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §20 ¶0\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.2-20-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §20 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §20 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Self-paced app session</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2592e52e01\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §20 ¶1\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.2-20-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §20 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §20 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶1</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Listen:</strong> the home picture with the dialogue; tap Bora, Sreyneang or Yeay Chan to hear the line.</li>\n<li><strong>Point and say:</strong> a hand points to the speaker (<em>I am</em>) or to the other person (<em>you are</em>); the pupil records the sentence.</li>\n<li><strong>Pair game:</strong> the app plays one twin; the pupil answers <em>Hello. You are …</em>.</li>\n<li><strong>Letter card:</strong> tap <strong>B b</strong> (name and sound /b/); find B at the start of <em>Bora</em>; trace B b.</li>\n<li><strong>Quiz:</strong> five questions.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"58ce12752a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §20 ¶2\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.2-20-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §20 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §20 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">The learner story above is the JSON scene player (<code>scenes/s002.json</code>); edit that file to change lines or timing without rebuilding Markdown.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6df6c9f3e3\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §20 ¶3\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.2-20-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §20 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §20 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">The app shows the five cues at the start and the feed-forward message from E9 at the end.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"25c86f6a92\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §21 ¶0\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.2-21-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §21 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §21 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Quiz</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f331673cc7\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §21 ¶1\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.2-21-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §21 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §21 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Each question checks one success criterion in one RTTI category. After <strong>Check</strong>, the quiz shows the result per criterion and what to try next.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0355642a8e\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §21 ¶2\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.2-21-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §21 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §21 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Success criterion</th>\n<th>RTTI</th>\n<th>Question</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1 Reproduction</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 Training</td>\n<td>T1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 Transfer</td>\n<td>T2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 Insight</td>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 Letter B b</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-quiz\" data-h=\"57837a12fc\" data-kind=\"quiz\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.2 §21 ¶3\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.2-21-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §21 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §21 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶3</button><div aria-label=\"Quiz\" class=\"quiz\" data-body=\"1\" role=\"group\"><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"R\" data-q=\"1\" data-sc=\"SC1\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">1.</span> Bora points to himself. What does he say?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 1 · RTTI level R</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">I am Bora.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! I is the speaker: I am Bora.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">You are Bora.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">You is for the other person. Bora says: I am Bora.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">I am Yeay.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is not his name. Bora says: I am Bora.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"T1\" data-q=\"2\" data-sc=\"SC2\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">2.</span> Sreyneang says \"Hello. I am Sreyneang.\" What does Bora answer?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 2 · RTTI level T1</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Hello. I am Sreyneang.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is her line. Bora talks to her: You are Sreyneang.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Hello. You are Sreyneang.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! You are and her name.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Good night, Sreyneang.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">It is morning. Say: Hello. You are Sreyneang.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"T2\" data-q=\"3\" data-sc=\"SC3\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">3.</span> 🧑‍🏫 The teacher says \"Hello. I am Kru Sopheak.\" What do you say?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 3 · RTTI level T2</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">I am Kru Sopheak.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">You are not Kru Sopheak. Say: You are Kru Sopheak.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Hello. You are Bora.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Talk to the teacher: You are Kru Sopheak.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">You are Kru Sopheak.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! You used you are with a new person.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"I\" data-q=\"4\" data-sc=\"SC4\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">4.</span> Bora says \"I am Bora.\" Then Sreyneang talks. Who is \"I\" now?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 4 · RTTI level I</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Bora</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Bora is not talking now. I is always the speaker.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Sreyneang</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! I moves with the speaker.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Yeay Chan</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yeay Chan is listening. I is the one who talks.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"R\" data-q=\"5\" data-sc=\"SC5\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">5.</span> 🔤 Which card is the letter B b?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 5 · RTTI level R</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">A a</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is A a. Find B b.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">B b</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! B b, as at the start of Bora.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">D d</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is D d. Find B b.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><div class=\"quiz-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary quiz-check\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-check-double\"></i> Check</button><button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary quiz-retry\" hidden=\"\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate-left\"></i> Try again</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-score\" role=\"status\"></span></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-rtti\" hidden=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b8efd777f4\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.2 §22 ¶0\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.2-22-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §22 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §22 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">CEFR cross-reference</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9ace50ee5c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.2 §22 ¶1\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.2-22-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §22 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §22 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Secondary reference only. Pre-A1 can-do statements adapted from the CEFR Companion Volume (2020); not an official CEFR test.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0f72034ba4\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.2 §22 ¶2\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.2-22-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.2 §22 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.2 §22 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶2</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>I can say who I am and who you are with <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em>.</li>\n<li>I can recognise the letter B b.</li>\n</ul></div>"}, {"id": "S.3", "title": "Session S003: Hello later in the morning", "order": 3, "goals": ["Course plan outcome: Pupils choose good morning or hello and greet with I am / you are (Listening and Speaking), and recognise and copy the letter C c.", "Success criterion 1: I can say hello and good morning.", "Success criterion 2: I can greet Yeay with hello and say I am / you are.", "Success criterion 3: I can choose good morning or hello for the time.", "Success criterion 4: I know good morning is for the morning, and hello works later too.", "Success criterion 5: I can point to C c and copy it."], "metadata": {"status": "draft", "grade": "1", "week": "1", "session": "S003", "setting": "Home, later in the morning", "characters": "Bora, Sreyneang, Yeay Chan", "subject": "Foreign Languages (English)", "moeys_reference": "see L.0 §1 (Curriculum Framework 2016)", "cefr_cross_reference": "Pre-A1 (adapted, CEFR Companion Volume)", "duration": "one study hour (40 min)", "updated": "2026-11-06 (v1.6.0)"}, "file": "s003-hello-later.md", "notes": ["<p>Khmer words and pupil sentences to be verified by a native speaker (Grade 1 level). Khmer spelling of the character names (Yeay យាយ, Kru គ្រូ, Bora បូរ៉ា, Sreyneang ស្រីណាង, Sopheak សុភ័ក្ត្រ, Chan ចាន់) also to be verified.</p>\n", "<p>The minute split is ours; the course plan gives the E1–E9 steps but no timings. With 30–50 pupils, E7 is done with a sample of pupils each session, so every pupil is checked across the week.</p>\n", "<p>CEFR Pre-A1 describes recognising letters but prescribes no order for the alphabet. The order (one letter per session, A a to F f in weeks 1–2) comes from the course plan.</p>\n"], "blocks": [{"ref": "S.3 §0 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-0-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "5d17391582", "text": "Session S003: Hello later in the morning", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §0 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-0-1", "kind": "figure", "h": "da39a3ee5e", "text": "", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §0 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-0-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a7ed7bc9e0", "text": "Week 1 · Home, later in the morning · Bora, Sreyneang, Yeay Chan.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §0 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-0-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "45d139c04c", "text": "Good morning is for the start of the day. Hello can be said later, still at home. New letter: C c .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §1 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-1-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "025eec04ab", "text": "MoEYS frame", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §1 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-1-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ac36d97d4a", "text": "This session serves the MoEYS frame in L.0 §1 ¶2 : core competency 4.2, the Listening and Speaking components plus one letter, and one 40-minute study hour.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §1 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-1-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2baba6e82b", "text": "Session syllabus:", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §1 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-1-3", "kind": "table", "h": "c6581ef18c", "text": "Function Form Vocabulary Grammar Letter Choosing a greeting for the time of day Hello, Bora. – Hello, Yeay. I am Bora. You are Yeay. hello, good morning (I, you, name: reinforce) to be: I am / you are in a new greeting C c", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §2 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-2-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "5a49743b7a", "text": "Feed up (E1: theme introduction)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §2 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-2-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f7b4d47b56", "text": "The sun is higher. Bora comes back in from the yard. It is not first-wake time. Yeay Chan says hello , not good morning .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §2 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-2-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "79b40a08a9", "text": "Situational: a later greeting at home. Broad: choosing good morning or hello .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §2 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-2-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "4201efb018", "text": "Scene: picture later morning at home (to be drawn)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §3 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-3-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "7660a32c11", "text": "Words this session", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §3 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-3-1", "kind": "table", "h": "39055509a6", "text": "Word Role hello reproduce good morning reproduce I reinforce you reinforce name reinforce", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §4 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-4-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "dd17342cb4", "text": "Grammar", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §4 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-4-1", "kind": "list", "h": "98b61fbef3", "text": "Primary: I am / you are in a new greeting Reach-ahead: time words ( later , now ). Children may hear now . Do not teach clock language.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §5 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-5-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "f7c6b8a70c", "text": "Letters (MoEYS)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §5 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-5-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d71bdea515", "text": "Card: letter card C c", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §5 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-5-2", "kind": "table", "h": "c5ded08f9b", "text": "Letter C c Name C Sound /k/ (hard c ). No session word uses c — name, sound, and copy only. Do not add cat . Write Air-write, then copy C c .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §6 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-6-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "da75f75ee9", "text": "By the end of this session you will be able to:", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §6 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-6-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §6 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-6-2", "kind": "list", "h": "52926a2c92", "text": "Say hello and say good morning as two different phrases. Point to C c .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §6 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-6-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §6 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.3-6-4", "kind": "list", "h": "977b0c2dd4", "text": "Greet Yeay with hello and your name, then I am / you are .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §6 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.3-6-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §6 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.3-6-6", "kind": "list", "h": "d0169cdb3f", "text": "Choose good morning or hello when the teacher changes the \"time\" (dark vs bright picture, or a window).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §6 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.3-6-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §6 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.3-6-8", "kind": "list", "h": "09ecb84d41", "text": "Good morning fits the start of the day. Hello still works later. Both can take a name.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §7 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-7-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "52f7c040c5", "text": "Words with Khmer", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §7 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-7-1", "kind": "table", "h": "d40fffb6f4", "text": "Word Khmer hello សួស្តី good morning អរុណសួស្តី I ខ្ញុំ you អ្នក name ឈ្មោះ", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §7 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-7-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "127486a614", "text": "Learning goal: Today we choose good morning or hello.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §7 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-7-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "40ddcbd0b4", "text": "In Khmer: ថ្ងៃនេះ យើងជ្រើស good morning ឬ hello។", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §7 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.3-7-4", "kind": "table", "h": "f11744ab7e", "text": "# Success criterion (pupil words) RTTI Khmer (pupil words) Picture or gesture cue 1 I can say hello and good morning . Reproduction (R) ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ hello និង good morning។ wave 2 I can greet Yeay with hello and say I am / you are . Training (T1) ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ hello ទៅយាយ ហើយនិយាយ I am / you are។ wave, hand on chest 3 I can choose good morning or hello for the time. Transfer (T2) ខ្ញុំអាចជ្រើស good morning ឬ hello តាមពេលវេលា។ sun picture 4 I know good morning is for the morning, and hello works later too. Insight (I) ខ្ញុំដឹងថា good morning សម្រាប់ពេលព្រឹក ហើយ hello ប្រើពេលក្រោយក៏បាន។ sun rising, sun high 5 I can point to C c and copy it. Letter (R) ខ្ញុំអាចចង្អុល C c ហើយចម្លងវា។ air-write C", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §7 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.3-7-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "40bea74885", "text": "Criteria 1–4 are the four goals above in pupil words; criterion 5 is the letter. Draw the five cues on the board and point to them at the start and at the end.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §8 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-8-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "a343dabcab", "text": "RTTI rubric for the teacher", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §8 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-8-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "fa9039d2ed", "text": "RTTI categories: R Reproduction, T1 Training, T2 Transfer, I Insight. They are categories, not a ladder: a pupil can be strong in Transfer and weak in Reproduction. Pass rule (E7): at least 3 of the 4 Reproduction and Training checks, plus the letter. Transfer and Insight are watched; they do not block a pass.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §8 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-8-2", "kind": "table", "h": "948db97abb", "text": "Criterion R – Reproduction T1 – Training T2 – Transfer I – Insight 1. I can say hello and good morning . Look for: both phrases, on request. If not yet: only one greeting exists for the child. Say: \"You said it clearly.\" Next (E9): Keep both phrases. Say hello once and good morning once on the way to school. Air-write C once. Needed to pass. (rated green) — — — 2. I can greet Yeay with hello and say I am / you are . — Look for: hello + name + I am . If not yet: hello alone, then silence. Say: \"You answered by yourself.\" Next (E9): You can say hello . Next time add the name in the same line. Needed to pass. (rated green) — — 3. I can choose good morning or hello for the time. — — Look for: picture or window cue changes the greeting. If not yet: child always says good morning because that was week 1. Say: \"You did it with someone new.\" Next (E9): You chose a greeting from the sun card. Next week we try good morning with the teacher. Watched, with help. (rated yellow) — 4. I know good morning is for the morning, and hello works later too. — — — Look for: child can sort two pictures (sunrise vs later) into two greetings. If not yet: child thinks one English greeting is \"correct\" and the other is a mistake. Both are correct. Say: \"You showed me why.\" Next (E9): Morning has its own greeting. Later can use hello . Both are kind when a name follows. Watched, stretch goal. (rated red) 5. I can point to C c and copy it. (letter) Look for: Points to C c and copies it (air-write counts). If not yet: Points to the wrong card: say the name and sound again, air-write together. Say: \"You found C.\" Next (E9): \"Look for c in your name or on the board.\" Needed to pass. (rated green) — — —", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §9 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-9-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "ba0b563256", "text": "E2: Entry readiness", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §9 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-9-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b5e76965b5", "text": "Speaking, pointing, tracing.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §9 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-9-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §9 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-9-3", "kind": "list", "h": "4d77fb2c57", "text": "Say good morning . Say I am [name] . Point to C c (letter card C c). Say C or /k/.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §9 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.3-9-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §9 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.3-9-5", "kind": "list", "h": "935d85e371", "text": "Point to a classmate and say you are [name] (or the classmate's name if they cannot finish the sentence).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §9 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.3-9-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "9812f4c421", "text": "Routing: 0 wrong = light E3. 1–2 wrong = full path. 3 wrong = S002 E3 replay.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b2a0279bfc", "text": "E3: Core teaching conversation", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "61e4cb7bc9", "text": "Later morning. Bora has been outside. Default learner role: Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a4ea18536c", "text": "Audio: recording hello at home (to be recorded)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a19c50706a", "text": "Yeay Chan: Hello, Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e3c271bbd2", "text": "Bora: Hello, Yeay.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a4045a6e66", "text": "Yeay Chan: Hello, Sreyneang.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "3ab4f456a3", "text": "Sreyneang: Hello, Yeay.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "3751bb28cc", "text": "Yeay Chan: I am Yeay Chan. You are Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d770d89e6a", "text": "Bora: I am Bora. You are Yeay.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶11", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-11", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "3e631f50a0", "text": "Sreyneang: Hello. I am Sreyneang. You are Yeay.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶12", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-12", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶13", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-13", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6ff6602888", "text": "Teacher holds a morning picture, then hides it (or covers the window with a hand for \"later\").", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶14", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-14", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7667f62d23", "text": "Teacher: (morning picture) … Child: Good morning, [name].", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶15", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-15", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "391072e306", "text": "Teacher: (later / no sun picture) … Child: Hello, [name].", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶16", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-16", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §10 ¶17", "anchor": "p-S.3-10-17", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7170c4325e", "text": "Good morning is a morning hello. When the morning has moved on, hello is enough. We still use the person's name.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §11 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-11-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "d10e9904fa", "text": "E4: Going further", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §11 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-11-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §11 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-11-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ce0c0e8bd9", "text": "Why this works Yeay Chan does not repeat good morning at mid-morning. Hello keeps the warmth without pretending it is first light.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §11 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-11-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §11 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.3-11-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c935c520ee", "text": "Watch out for", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §11 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.3-11-5", "kind": "list", "h": "c7cd68bb28", "text": "Children who treat hello as \"the English word\" and drop good morning forever. Keep both alive. Good night offered by an older sibling. Smile, do not teach it this week. Using hello teacher at home. The name still matches the person.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §11 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.3-11-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §11 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.3-11-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "1f2952640a", "text": "Cultural context Khmer arun suor sdei is marked as morning. Suor sdei is the wider hello. English is doing the same split, in fewer tones.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §11 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.3-11-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "48136dddf5", "text": "Going further", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §11 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.3-11-9", "kind": "list", "h": "b6ccb54801", "text": "What do you say if you see Yeay at lunch? What do you say at first light?", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §12 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-12-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "f7c6b8a70c", "text": "Letters (MoEYS)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §12 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-12-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d71bdea515", "text": "Card: letter card C c", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §12 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-12-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "860a231771", "text": "Show C c . Name C , sound /k/. No session word — skip the hunt. Air-write, then copy C c . Do not add cat .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §13 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-13-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "e2f0c8f8c9", "text": "E5: Teacher notes", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §13 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-13-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "69e059f56a", "text": "For the teacher.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §13 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-13-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "0c53829cd6", "text": "Lesson intent Close week 1 with two greetings and stable I am / you are , ready for school people in week 2.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §13 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-13-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b230d097fd", "text": "RTTI guidance", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §13 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.3-13-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2b6ddc5952", "text": "Reproduction (R) — Strong: both phrases, on request. Weak: only one greeting exists for the child.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §13 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.3-13-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e5c6aeddca", "text": "Training (T1) — Strong: hello + name + I am . Weak: hello alone, then silence.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §13 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.3-13-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b7e08b91c1", "text": "Transfer (T2) — Strong: picture or window cue changes the greeting. Weak: child always says good morning because that was week 1.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §13 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.3-13-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e896fc388b", "text": "Insight (I) — Strong: child can sort two pictures (sunrise vs later) into two greetings. Weak: child thinks one English greeting is \"correct\" and the other is a mistake. Both are correct.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §13 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.3-13-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2161bc2a7a", "text": "Common errors", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §13 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.3-13-9", "kind": "list", "h": "4cab54474a", "text": "Hello good morning as one string. Split with a smile and two hands (one phrase each). Very loud HELLO copied from media. Model a home voice.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §13 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.3-13-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "985e15e8c4", "text": "Reach-ahead Good afternoon / good night — later. Please / thank you — S006.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §13 ¶11", "anchor": "p-S.3-13-11", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "48f6293c0b", "text": "Cultural notes A child who greets an elder with hello and no name is not being rude in English class yet — add the name as the care, not as a scold.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §13 ¶12", "anchor": "p-S.3-13-12", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "63e26a4908", "text": "Letters Today C c . Name, /k/, copy. No session word. Do not add cat .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §14 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-14-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "49bdda0e0e", "text": "E6: Practice", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §14 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-14-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §14 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-14-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ca1ff20765", "text": "Two doors drawn on the board, or two sides of the room: morning and later . Children walk to one side and greet a classmate: Good morning, [name] or Hello, [name] , then I am / you are .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §14 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-14-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §14 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.3-14-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "3e3c08a688", "text": "You flip a simple sun / no-sun card. The child greets you, not the classmate, with the matching phrase.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §14 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.3-14-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §14 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.3-14-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e29534b83", "text": "Letters Air-write C c , then copy. No extra word.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §15 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-15-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "9e9a020100", "text": "E7: Exit check", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §15 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-15-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "0baff986e0", "text": "Eight spoken checks, two per category, plus one letter check. Pass on Reproduction and Training (at least 3 of those 4) and the letter check. Transfer and Insight are watched — they do not block a pass.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §15 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-15-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §15 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-15-3", "kind": "list", "h": "0bf17d3114", "text": "Produces hello . Produces good morning .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §15 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.3-15-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §15 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.3-15-5", "kind": "list", "h": "e28d16dc95", "text": "Hello, Yeay (or Hello + your name) in the later-morning scene. Adds I am [name] in the same turn or the next turn.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §15 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.3-15-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §15 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.3-15-7", "kind": "list", "h": "9a7218eb4d", "text": "Changes greeting when you change the sun card. Greets a classmate with hello + name (not only you).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §15 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.3-15-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §15 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.3-15-9", "kind": "list", "h": "de206a5676", "text": "Points to the morning picture for good morning . Shows (point or Khmer) that hello is still polite later in the day.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §15 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.3-15-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d8d72ebbf9", "text": "Letters 9. Points to C c (letter card C c) and copies it (air-write counts).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §16 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-16-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "66ba33e460", "text": "E8: Formative evaluation and reformat", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §16 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-16-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "53072305c9", "text": "[Name], you have two ways to greet at home. Next week the same good morning meets the teacher.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §16 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-16-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2eccf29380", "text": "Reformat triggers — E3 only. Max two.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §16 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-16-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §16 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.3-16-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "8f8d9604c4", "text": "Reproduction weak: Drill the two phrases with two pictures only. No I am in that loop.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §16 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.3-16-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §16 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.3-16-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "43be65db6f", "text": "Training weak: Yeay + one child. Keep hello, Yeay and I am .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §16 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.3-16-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §16 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.3-16-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5c004281d3", "text": "Transfer weak: You hold the sun card yourself. Child greets only you.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §16 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.3-16-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §16 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.3-16-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "87cc188c9c", "text": "Insight weak: Sorting the two pictures is enough. Do not ask for a spoken rule.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §17 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-17-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b170a2e736", "text": "E9: Feed forward", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §17 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-17-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §17 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-17-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "af05069562", "text": "Keep both phrases. Say hello once and good morning once on the way to school. Air-write C once.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §17 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-17-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §17 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.3-17-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ae3f71954f", "text": "You can say hello . Next time add the name in the same line.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §17 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.3-17-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §17 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.3-17-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ca1dd955f8", "text": "You chose a greeting from the sun card. Next week we try good morning with the teacher.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §17 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.3-17-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §17 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.3-17-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c2dae417f9", "text": "Morning has its own greeting. Later can use hello . Both are kind when a name follows.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §18 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-18-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "81640ecdaf", "text": "Teacher-led session (one study hour, 40 min)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §18 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-18-1", "kind": "table", "h": "27356fb17e", "text": "Step Minutes What happens E1 Theme and feed up 5 Show the picture, say the learning goal, point to the five cues. E2 Entry readiness 4 Quick check; route pupils as in E2. E3 Core conversation 10 Teacher in role; the class answers, then small groups. E4 Going further 4 Watch-out points and the cultural note. E6 Practice and letter 8 Role-play in pairs; air-write and copy the letter. E7 Exit check 6 Spoken checks with a sample of pupils; note the RTTI categories. E8–E9 Reformat and feed forward 3 Back to the five cues; one feed-forward message per pupil or group.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §18 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-18-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "30e5cd2054", "text": "E5 is for the teacher before the session.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §19 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-19-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "86b4ba2ff9", "text": "Story", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §19 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-19-1", "kind": "scene", "h": "da39a3ee5e", "text": "", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §20 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-20-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "e9029a8cd7", "text": "Self-paced app session", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §20 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-20-1", "kind": "list", "h": "cf93d59a65", "text": "Listen: the later-morning picture with the dialogue. Sun or no sun: a sunrise or a high-sun picture appears; the pupil taps Good morning or Hello and records it with a name. Say it: record Hello, Yeay. I am … . Letter card: tap C c (name and sound /k/); trace C c. No extra word. Quiz: five questions.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §20 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-20-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "0de965015e", "text": "The learner story above is the JSON scene player ( scenes/s003.json ); edit that file to change lines or timing without rebuilding Markdown.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §20 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-20-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6df6c9f3e3", "text": "The app shows the five cues at the start and the feed-forward message from E9 at the end.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §21 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-21-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "25c86f6a92", "text": "Quiz", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §21 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-21-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f331673cc7", "text": "Each question checks one success criterion in one RTTI category. After Check , the quiz shows the result per criterion and what to try next.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §21 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-21-2", "kind": "table", "h": "7dd3f808f3", "text": "Success criterion RTTI Question 1 Reproduction R 1 2 Training T1 2 3 Transfer T2 3 4 Insight I 4 5 Letter C c R 5", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §21 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.3-21-3", "kind": "quiz", "h": "da409333f9", "text": "1. ☀️ It is later. Bora comes in from the yard. What does Yeay Chan say? Criterion 1 · RTTI level R Hello, Bora. Yes! Later in the morning, hello is enough. Good night, Bora. Good night is for bedtime. Say: Hello, Bora. Thank you, Bora. Thank you is for getting something. Say: Hello, Bora. 2. Yeay Chan says \"Hello, Bora.\" What does Bora say? Criterion 2 · RTTI level T1 Hello, Bora. Bora is his own name. Greet Yeay: Hello, Yeay. Hello, Yeay. Yes! Hello and the name of the person. You are Bora. Bora is talking about himself. Say: Hello, Yeay. 3. 🌅 The teacher shows a sunrise picture. Which greeting fits? Criterion 3 · RTTI level T2 Good morning! Yes! Sunrise is the start of the day. Goodbye! Goodbye is for leaving. At sunrise say: Good morning! Thank you! Thank you is for getting something. Say: Good morning! 4. Why can we say \"hello\" later in the day? Criterion 4 · RTTI level I Hello is only for school. Hello works at home too. It works at any time. Hello works at any time. Yes! Good morning is for the start of the day; hello still works later. Hello is for a teacher. We said hello to Yeay at home. It works at any time. 5. 🔤 Which card is the letter C c? Criterion 5 · RTTI level R A a That is A a. Find C c. E e That is E e. Find C c. C c Yes! C c. The sound is /k/. Check Try again", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §22 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.3-22-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b8efd777f4", "text": "CEFR cross-reference", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §22 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.3-22-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "9ace50ee5c", "text": "Secondary reference only. Pre-A1 can-do statements adapted from the CEFR Companion Volume (2020); not an official CEFR test.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.3 §22 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.3-22-2", "kind": "list", "h": "2228cac0f7", "text": "I can say hello and good morning and choose one for the time of day. I can recognise the letter C c.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}], "html": "<div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5d17391582\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §0 ¶0\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.3-0-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §0 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §0 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶0</button><h1 data-body=\"1\">Session S003: Hello later in the morning</h1></div><div class=\"blk blk-figure fl-full\" data-h=\"da39a3ee5e\" data-kind=\"figure\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §0 ¶1\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.3-0-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §0 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §0 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶1</button><figure class=\"fig fig-full\" data-body=\"1\" data-marker=\"full\"><button aria-label=\"Enlarge image: Letter card C c\" class=\"img-zoom\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Letter card C c\" data-src=\"images/letter-c.svg\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"assets/images/images/letter-c.svg\"/></button></figure></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a7ed7bc9e0\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §0 ¶2\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.3-0-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §0 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §0 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Week 1 · Home, later in the morning · Bora, Sreyneang, Yeay Chan.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"45d139c04c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §0 ¶3\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.3-0-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §0 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §0 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Good morning</em> is for the start of the day. <em>Hello</em> can be said later, still at home. New letter: <strong>C c</strong>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"025eec04ab\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §1 ¶0\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.3-1-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §1 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §1 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">MoEYS frame</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ac36d97d4a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §1 ¶1\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.3-1-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §1 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §1 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">This session serves the MoEYS frame in <a data-href=\"#p-L.0-1-2\" href=\"#p-L.0-1-2\">L.0 §1 ¶2</a>: core competency 4.2, the Listening and Speaking components plus one letter, and one 40-minute study hour.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2baba6e82b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §1 ¶2\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.3-1-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §1 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §1 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Session syllabus:</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c6581ef18c\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §1 ¶3\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.3-1-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §1 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §1 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶3</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Function</th>\n<th>Form</th>\n<th>Vocabulary</th>\n<th>Grammar</th>\n<th>Letter</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Choosing a greeting for the time of day</td>\n<td>Hello, Bora. – Hello, Yeay. I am Bora. You are Yeay.</td>\n<td>hello, good morning (I, you, name: reinforce)</td>\n<td>to be: I am / you are in a new greeting</td>\n<td>C c</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5a49743b7a\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §2 ¶0\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.3-2-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §2 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §2 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Feed up (E1: theme introduction)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f7b4d47b56\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §2 ¶1\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.3-2-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §2 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §2 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">The sun is higher. Bora comes back in from the yard. It is not first-wake time. Yeay Chan says <em>hello</em>, not <em>good morning</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"79b40a08a9\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §2 ¶2\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.3-2-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §2 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §2 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Situational:</strong> a later greeting at home.\n<strong>Broad:</strong> choosing <em>good morning</em> or <em>hello</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4201efb018\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §2 ¶3\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.3-2-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §2 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §2 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">Scene: picture <em>later morning at home</em> (to be drawn)</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7660a32c11\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §3 ¶0\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.3-3-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §3 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §3 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Words this session</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"39055509a6\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §3 ¶1\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.3-3-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §3 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §3 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Word</th>\n<th>Role</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>hello</td>\n<td>reproduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>good morning</td>\n<td>reproduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>reinforce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>you</td>\n<td>reinforce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>name</td>\n<td>reinforce</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"dd17342cb4\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §4 ¶0\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-S.3-4-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §4 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §4 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Grammar</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"98b61fbef3\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §4 ¶1\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-S.3-4-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §4 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §4 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶1</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Primary:</strong> <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em> in a new greeting</li>\n<li><strong>Reach-ahead:</strong> time words (<em>later</em>, <em>now</em>). Children may hear <em>now</em>. Do not teach clock language.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f7c6b8a70c\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §5 ¶0\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.3-5-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §5 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §5 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Letters (MoEYS)</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d71bdea515\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §5 ¶1\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.3-5-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §5 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §5 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Card: letter card C c</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c5ded08f9b\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §5 ¶2\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.3-5-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §5 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §5 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Letter</td>\n<td><strong>C c</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Name</td>\n<td><em>C</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sound</td>\n<td>/k/ (hard <em>c</em>). No session word uses <em>c</em> — name, sound, and copy only. Do not add <em>cat</em>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write</td>\n<td>Air-write, then copy <em>C c</em>.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"da75f75ee9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §6 ¶0\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.3-6-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §6 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §6 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">By the end of this session you will be able to:</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §6 ¶1\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.3-6-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §6 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §6 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"52926a2c92\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §6 ¶2\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.3-6-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §6 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §6 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶2</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Say <em>hello</em> and say <em>good morning</em> as two different phrases. Point to <strong>C c</strong>.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §6 ¶3\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.3-6-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §6 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §6 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"977b0c2dd4\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.3 §6 ¶4\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.3-6-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §6 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §6 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶4</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"2\">\n<li>Greet Yeay with <em>hello</em> and your name, then <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em>.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.3 §6 ¶5\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.3-6-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §6 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §6 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d0169cdb3f\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.3 §6 ¶6\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.3-6-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §6 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §6 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶6</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"3\">\n<li>Choose <em>good morning</em> or <em>hello</em> when the teacher changes the \"time\" (dark vs bright picture, or a window).</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.3 §6 ¶7\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.3-6-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §6 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §6 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"09ecb84d41\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.3 §6 ¶8\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.3-6-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §6 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §6 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶8</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"4\">\n<li><em>Good morning</em> fits the start of the day. <em>Hello</em> still works later. Both can take a name.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"52f7c040c5\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §7 ¶0\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.3-7-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §7 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §7 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Words with Khmer</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d40fffb6f4\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §7 ¶1\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.3-7-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §7 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §7 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Word</th>\n<th>Khmer</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>hello</td>\n<td>សួស្តី</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>good morning</td>\n<td>អរុណសួស្តី</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>you</td>\n<td>អ្នក</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>name</td>\n<td>ឈ្មោះ</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"127486a614\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §7 ¶2\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.3-7-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §7 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §7 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Learning goal:</strong> Today we choose good morning or hello.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"40ddcbd0b4\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §7 ¶3\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.3-7-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §7 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §7 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>In Khmer:</strong> ថ្ងៃនេះ យើងជ្រើស good morning ឬ hello។</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f11744ab7e\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.3 §7 ¶4\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.3-7-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §7 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §7 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶4</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>Success criterion (pupil words)</th>\n<th>RTTI</th>\n<th>Khmer (pupil words)</th>\n<th>Picture or gesture cue</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>I can say <em>hello</em> and <em>good morning</em>.</td>\n<td>Reproduction (R)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ hello និង good morning។</td>\n<td>wave</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>I can greet Yeay with <em>hello</em> and say <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em>.</td>\n<td>Training (T1)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ hello ទៅយាយ ហើយនិយាយ I am / you are។</td>\n<td>wave, hand on chest</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>I can choose <em>good morning</em> or <em>hello</em> for the time.</td>\n<td>Transfer (T2)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចជ្រើស good morning ឬ hello តាមពេលវេលា។</td>\n<td>sun picture</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>I know <em>good morning</em> is for the morning, and <em>hello</em> works later too.</td>\n<td>Insight (I)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំដឹងថា good morning សម្រាប់ពេលព្រឹក ហើយ hello ប្រើពេលក្រោយក៏បាន។</td>\n<td>sun rising, sun high</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>I can point to <strong>C c</strong> and copy it.</td>\n<td>Letter (R)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចចង្អុល C c ហើយចម្លងវា។</td>\n<td>air-write C</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"40bea74885\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.3 §7 ¶5\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.3-7-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §7 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §7 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\">Criteria 1–4 are the four goals above in pupil words; criterion 5 is the letter. Draw the five cues on the board and point to them at the start and at the end.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a343dabcab\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §8 ¶0\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.3-8-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §8 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §8 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">RTTI rubric for the teacher</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"fa9039d2ed\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §8 ¶1\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.3-8-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §8 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §8 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">RTTI categories: <strong>R</strong> Reproduction, <strong>T1</strong> Training, <strong>T2</strong> Transfer, <strong>I</strong> Insight. They are categories, not a ladder: a pupil can be strong in Transfer and weak in Reproduction. Pass rule (E7): at least 3 of the 4 Reproduction and Training checks, plus the letter. Transfer and Insight are watched; they do not block a pass.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"948db97abb\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §8 ¶2\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.3-8-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §8 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §8 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Criterion</th>\n<th>R – Reproduction</th>\n<th>T1 – Training</th>\n<th>T2 – Transfer</th>\n<th>I – Insight</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1. I can say <em>hello</em> and <em>good morning</em>.</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> both phrases, on request. <strong>If not yet:</strong> only one greeting exists for the child. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You said it clearly.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> Keep both phrases. Say <em>hello</em> once and <em>good morning</em> once on the way to school. Air-write <em>C</em> once. <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. I can greet Yeay with <em>hello</em> and say <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em>.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> <em>hello</em> + name + <em>I am</em>. <strong>If not yet:</strong> <em>hello</em> alone, then silence. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You answered by yourself.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> You can say <em>hello</em>. Next time add the name in the same line. <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. I can choose <em>good morning</em> or <em>hello</em> for the time.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-yellow\"><strong>Look for:</strong> picture or window cue changes the greeting. <strong>If not yet:</strong> child always says <em>good morning</em> because that was week 1. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You did it with someone new.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> You chose a greeting from the sun card. Next week we try <em>good morning</em> with the teacher. <em>Watched, with help.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"yellow\" title=\"Rated yellow\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated yellow)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. I know <em>good morning</em> is for the morning, and <em>hello</em> works later too.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-red\"><strong>Look for:</strong> child can sort two pictures (sunrise vs later) into two greetings. <strong>If not yet:</strong> child thinks one English greeting is \"correct\" and the other is a mistake. Both are correct. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You showed me why.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> Morning has its own greeting. Later can use <em>hello</em>. Both are kind when a name follows. <em>Watched, stretch goal.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"red\" title=\"Rated red\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-xmark\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated red)</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. I can point to <strong>C c</strong> and copy it. (letter)</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> Points to <strong>C c</strong> and copies it (air-write counts). <strong>If not yet:</strong> Points to the wrong card: say the name and sound again, air-write together. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You found C.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> \"Look for c in your name or on the board.\" <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ba0b563256\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §9 ¶0\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.3-9-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §9 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §9 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E2: Entry readiness</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b5e76965b5\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §9 ¶1\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.3-9-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §9 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §9 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Speaking, pointing, tracing.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §9 ¶2\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.3-9-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §9 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §9 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4d77fb2c57\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §9 ¶3\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.3-9-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §9 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §9 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶3</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Say <em>good morning</em>.</li>\n<li>Say <em>I am [name]</em>.</li>\n<li>Point to <strong>C c</strong> (letter card C c). Say <em>C</em> or /k/.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.3 §9 ¶4\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.3-9-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §9 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §9 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"935d85e371\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.3 §9 ¶5\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.3-9-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §9 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §9 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶5</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"4\">\n<li>Point to a classmate and say <em>you are [name]</em> (or the classmate's name if they cannot finish the sentence).</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9812f4c421\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.3 §9 ¶6\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.3-9-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §9 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §9 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Routing:</strong> 0 wrong = light E3. 1–2 wrong = full path. 3 wrong = S002 E3 replay.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b2a0279bfc\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶0\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E3: Core teaching conversation</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"61e4cb7bc9\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶1\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Later morning. Bora has been outside. Default learner role: Bora.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a4ea18536c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶2\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Audio: recording <em>hello at home</em> (to be recorded)</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶3\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a19c50706a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶4\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Yeay Chan:</strong> Hello, Bora.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e3c271bbd2\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶5\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> Hello, Yeay.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a4045a6e66\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶6\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Yeay Chan:</strong> Hello, Sreyneang.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3ab4f456a3\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶7\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Sreyneang:</strong> Hello, Yeay.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶8\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3751bb28cc\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶9\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Yeay Chan:</strong> I am Yeay Chan. You are Bora.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d770d89e6a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶10\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> I am Bora. You are Yeay.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3e631f50a0\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"11\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶11\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-11\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶11\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶11 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶11</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Sreyneang:</strong> Hello. I am Sreyneang. You are Yeay.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"12\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶12\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-12\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶12\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶12 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶12</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6ff6602888\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"13\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶13\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-13\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶13\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶13 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶13</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Teacher holds a morning picture, then hides it (or covers the window with a hand for \"later\").</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7667f62d23\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"14\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶14\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-14\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶14\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶14 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶14</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Teacher:</strong> (morning picture) …\n<strong>Child:</strong> Good morning, [name].</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"391072e306\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"15\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶15\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-15\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶15\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶15 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶15</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Teacher:</strong> (later / no sun picture) …\n<strong>Child:</strong> Hello, [name].</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"16\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶16\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-16\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶16\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶16 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶16</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7170c4325e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"17\" data-ref=\"S.3 §10 ¶17\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.3-10-17\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §10 ¶17\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §10 ¶17 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶17</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Good morning</em> is a morning hello. When the morning has moved on, <em>hello</em> is enough. We still use the person's name.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d10e9904fa\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §11 ¶0\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.3-11-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §11 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §11 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E4: Going further</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §11 ¶1\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.3-11-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §11 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §11 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ce0c0e8bd9\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §11 ¶2\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.3-11-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §11 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §11 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Why this works</strong>\nYeay Chan does not repeat <em>good morning</em> at mid-morning. <em>Hello</em> keeps the warmth without pretending it is first light.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §11 ¶3\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.3-11-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §11 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §11 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c935c520ee\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.3 §11 ¶4\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.3-11-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §11 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §11 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Watch out for</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c7cd68bb28\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.3 §11 ¶5\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.3-11-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §11 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §11 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶5</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Children who treat <em>hello</em> as \"the English word\" and drop <em>good morning</em> forever. Keep both alive.</li>\n<li><em>Good night</em> offered by an older sibling. Smile, do not teach it this week.</li>\n<li>Using <em>hello teacher</em> at home. The name still matches the person.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.3 §11 ¶6\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.3-11-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §11 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §11 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"1f2952640a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.3 §11 ¶7\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.3-11-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §11 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §11 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Cultural context</strong>\nKhmer <em>arun suor sdei</em> is marked as morning. <em>Suor sdei</em> is the wider hello. English is doing the same split, in fewer tones.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"48136dddf5\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.3 §11 ¶8\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.3-11-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §11 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §11 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Going further</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b6ccb54801\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.3 §11 ¶9\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.3-11-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §11 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §11 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶9</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>What do you say if you see Yeay at lunch?</li>\n<li>What do you say at first light?</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f7c6b8a70c\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §12 ¶0\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.3-12-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §12 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §12 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Letters (MoEYS)</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d71bdea515\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §12 ¶1\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.3-12-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §12 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §12 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Card: letter card C c</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"860a231771\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §12 ¶2\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.3-12-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §12 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §12 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Show <em>C c</em>. Name <em>C</em>, sound /k/. No session word — skip the hunt. Air-write, then copy <em>C c</em>. Do not add <em>cat</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e2f0c8f8c9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §13 ¶0\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.3-13-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §13 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §13 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E5: Teacher notes</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"69e059f56a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §13 ¶1\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.3-13-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §13 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §13 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>For the teacher.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0c53829cd6\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §13 ¶2\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.3-13-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §13 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §13 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Lesson intent</strong>\nClose week 1 with two greetings and stable <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em>, ready for school people in week 2.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b230d097fd\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §13 ¶3\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.3-13-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §13 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §13 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>RTTI guidance</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2b6ddc5952\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.3 §13 ¶4\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.3-13-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §13 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §13 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong> — Strong: both phrases, on request. Weak: only one greeting exists for the child.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e5c6aeddca\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.3 §13 ¶5\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.3-13-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §13 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §13 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong> — Strong: <em>hello</em> + name + <em>I am</em>. Weak: <em>hello</em> alone, then silence.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b7e08b91c1\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.3 §13 ¶6\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.3-13-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §13 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §13 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong> — Strong: picture or window cue changes the greeting. Weak: child always says <em>good morning</em> because that was week 1.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e896fc388b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.3 §13 ¶7\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.3-13-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §13 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §13 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong> — Strong: child can sort two pictures (sunrise vs later) into two greetings. Weak: child thinks one English greeting is \"correct\" and the other is a mistake. Both are correct.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2161bc2a7a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.3 §13 ¶8\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.3-13-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §13 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §13 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Common errors</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4cab54474a\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.3 §13 ¶9\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.3-13-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §13 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §13 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶9</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><em>Hello good morning</em> as one string. Split with a smile and two hands (one phrase each).</li>\n<li>Very loud <em>HELLO</em> copied from media. Model a home voice.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"985e15e8c4\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.3 §13 ¶10\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.3-13-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §13 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §13 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reach-ahead</strong>\n<em>Good afternoon</em> / <em>good night</em> — later. <em>Please</em> / <em>thank you</em> — S006.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"48f6293c0b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"11\" data-ref=\"S.3 §13 ¶11\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.3-13-11\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §13 ¶11\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §13 ¶11 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶11</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Cultural notes</strong>\nA child who greets an elder with <em>hello</em> and no name is not being rude in English class yet — add the name as the care, not as a scold.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"63e26a4908\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"12\" data-ref=\"S.3 §13 ¶12\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.3-13-12\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §13 ¶12\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §13 ¶12 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶12</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\nToday <strong>C c</strong>. Name, /k/, copy. No session word. Do not add <em>cat</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"49bdda0e0e\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §14 ¶0\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.3-14-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §14 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §14 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E6: Practice</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §14 ¶1\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.3-14-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §14 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §14 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ca1ff20765\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §14 ¶2\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.3-14-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §14 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §14 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Two doors drawn on the board, or two sides of the room: <em>morning</em> and <em>later</em>. Children walk to one side and greet a classmate: <em>Good morning, [name]</em> or <em>Hello, [name]</em>, then <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §14 ¶3\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.3-14-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §14 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §14 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3e3c08a688\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.3 §14 ¶4\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.3-14-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §14 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §14 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\">You flip a simple sun / no-sun card. The child greets you, not the classmate, with the matching phrase.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.3 §14 ¶5\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.3-14-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §14 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §14 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e29534b83\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.3 §14 ¶6\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.3-14-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §14 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §14 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\nAir-write <strong>C c</strong>, then copy. No extra word.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9e9a020100\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §15 ¶0\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.3-15-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §15 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §15 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E7: Exit check</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0baff986e0\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §15 ¶1\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.3-15-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §15 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §15 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Eight spoken checks, two per category, plus one letter check. Pass on Reproduction and Training (at least 3 of those 4) and the letter check. Transfer and Insight are watched — they do not block a pass.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §15 ¶2\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.3-15-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §15 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §15 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0bf17d3114\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §15 ¶3\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.3-15-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §15 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §15 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶3</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Produces <em>hello</em>.</li>\n<li>Produces <em>good morning</em>.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.3 §15 ¶4\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.3-15-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §15 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §15 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e28d16dc95\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.3 §15 ¶5\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.3-15-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §15 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §15 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶5</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"3\">\n<li><em>Hello, Yeay</em> (or <em>Hello</em> + your name) in the later-morning scene.</li>\n<li>Adds <em>I am [name]</em> in the same turn or the next turn.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.3 §15 ¶6\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.3-15-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §15 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §15 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9a7218eb4d\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.3 §15 ¶7\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.3-15-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §15 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §15 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶7</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"5\">\n<li>Changes greeting when you change the sun card.</li>\n<li>Greets a classmate with <em>hello</em> + name (not only you).</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.3 §15 ¶8\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.3-15-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §15 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §15 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"de206a5676\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.3 §15 ¶9\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.3-15-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §15 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §15 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶9</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"7\">\n<li>Points to the morning picture for <em>good morning</em>.</li>\n<li>Shows (point or Khmer) that <em>hello</em> is still polite later in the day.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d8d72ebbf9\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.3 §15 ¶10\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.3-15-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §15 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §15 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\n9. Points to <strong>C c</strong> (letter card C c) and copies it (air-write counts).</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"66ba33e460\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §16 ¶0\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.3-16-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §16 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §16 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E8: Formative evaluation and reformat</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"53072305c9\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §16 ¶1\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.3-16-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §16 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §16 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">[Name], you have two ways to greet at home. Next week the same <em>good morning</em> meets the teacher.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2eccf29380\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §16 ¶2\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.3-16-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §16 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §16 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reformat triggers</strong> — E3 only. Max two.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §16 ¶3\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.3-16-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §16 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §16 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8f8d9604c4\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.3 §16 ¶4\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.3-16-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §16 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §16 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction weak:</strong> Drill the two phrases with two pictures only. No <em>I am</em> in that loop.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.3 §16 ¶5\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.3-16-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §16 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §16 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"43be65db6f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.3 §16 ¶6\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.3-16-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §16 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §16 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training weak:</strong> Yeay + one child. Keep <em>hello, Yeay</em> and <em>I am</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.3 §16 ¶7\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.3-16-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §16 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §16 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5c004281d3\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.3 §16 ¶8\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.3-16-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §16 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §16 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer weak:</strong> You hold the sun card yourself. Child greets only you.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.3 §16 ¶9\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.3-16-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §16 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §16 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"87cc188c9c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.3 §16 ¶10\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.3-16-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §16 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §16 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight weak:</strong> Sorting the two pictures is enough. Do not ask for a spoken rule.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b170a2e736\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §17 ¶0\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.3-17-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §17 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §17 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E9: Feed forward</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §17 ¶1\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.3-17-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §17 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §17 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"af05069562\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §17 ¶2\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.3-17-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §17 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §17 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Keep both phrases. Say <em>hello</em> once and <em>good morning</em> once on the way to school. Air-write <em>C</em> once.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §17 ¶3\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.3-17-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §17 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §17 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ae3f71954f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.3 §17 ¶4\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.3-17-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §17 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §17 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\">You can say <em>hello</em>. Next time add the name in the same line.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.3 §17 ¶5\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.3-17-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §17 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §17 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ca1dd955f8\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.3 §17 ¶6\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.3-17-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §17 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §17 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\">You chose a greeting from the sun card. Next week we try <em>good morning</em> with the teacher.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.3 §17 ¶7\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.3-17-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §17 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §17 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c2dae417f9\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.3 §17 ¶8\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.3-17-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §17 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §17 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\">Morning has its own greeting. Later can use <em>hello</em>. Both are kind when a name follows.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"81640ecdaf\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §18 ¶0\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.3-18-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §18 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §18 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Teacher-led session (one study hour, 40 min)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"27356fb17e\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §18 ¶1\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.3-18-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §18 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §18 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Step</th>\n<th>Minutes</th>\n<th>What happens</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>E1 Theme and feed up</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Show the picture, say the learning goal, point to the five cues.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2 Entry readiness</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Quick check; route pupils as in E2.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E3 Core conversation</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>Teacher in role; the class answers, then small groups.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E4 Going further</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Watch-out points and the cultural note.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E6 Practice and letter</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Role-play in pairs; air-write and copy the letter.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E7 Exit check</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Spoken checks with a sample of pupils; note the RTTI categories.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E8–E9 Reformat and feed forward</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Back to the five cues; one feed-forward message per pupil or group.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"30e5cd2054\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §18 ¶2\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.3-18-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §18 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §18 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">E5 is for the teacher before the session.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"86b4ba2ff9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §19 ¶0\" data-sec=\"19\" id=\"p-S.3-19-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §19 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §19 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§19 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Story</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-scene\" data-h=\"da39a3ee5e\" data-kind=\"scene\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §19 ¶1\" data-sec=\"19\" id=\"p-S.3-19-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §19 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §19 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§19 ¶1</button><div class=\"tli-scene-player\" data-body=\"1\" data-scene=\"scenes/s003.json\"></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e9029a8cd7\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §20 ¶0\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.3-20-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §20 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §20 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Self-paced app session</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"cf93d59a65\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §20 ¶1\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.3-20-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §20 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §20 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶1</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Listen:</strong> the later-morning picture with the dialogue.</li>\n<li><strong>Sun or no sun:</strong> a sunrise or a high-sun picture appears; the pupil taps <em>Good morning</em> or <em>Hello</em> and records it with a name.</li>\n<li><strong>Say it:</strong> record <em>Hello, Yeay. I am …</em>.</li>\n<li><strong>Letter card:</strong> tap <strong>C c</strong> (name and sound /k/); trace C c. No extra word.</li>\n<li><strong>Quiz:</strong> five questions.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0de965015e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §20 ¶2\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.3-20-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §20 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §20 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">The learner story above is the JSON scene player (<code>scenes/s003.json</code>); edit that file to change lines or timing without rebuilding Markdown.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6df6c9f3e3\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §20 ¶3\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.3-20-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §20 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §20 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">The app shows the five cues at the start and the feed-forward message from E9 at the end.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"25c86f6a92\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §21 ¶0\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.3-21-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §21 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §21 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Quiz</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f331673cc7\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §21 ¶1\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.3-21-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §21 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §21 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Each question checks one success criterion in one RTTI category. After <strong>Check</strong>, the quiz shows the result per criterion and what to try next.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7dd3f808f3\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §21 ¶2\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.3-21-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §21 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §21 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Success criterion</th>\n<th>RTTI</th>\n<th>Question</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1 Reproduction</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 Training</td>\n<td>T1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 Transfer</td>\n<td>T2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 Insight</td>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 Letter C c</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-quiz\" data-h=\"da409333f9\" data-kind=\"quiz\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.3 §21 ¶3\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.3-21-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §21 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §21 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶3</button><div aria-label=\"Quiz\" class=\"quiz\" data-body=\"1\" role=\"group\"><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"R\" data-q=\"1\" data-sc=\"SC1\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">1.</span> ☀️ It is later. Bora comes in from the yard. What does Yeay Chan say?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 1 · RTTI level R</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Hello, Bora.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Later in the morning, hello is enough.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Good night, Bora.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Good night is for bedtime. Say: Hello, Bora.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Thank you, Bora.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Thank you is for getting something. Say: Hello, Bora.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"T1\" data-q=\"2\" data-sc=\"SC2\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">2.</span> Yeay Chan says \"Hello, Bora.\" What does Bora say?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 2 · RTTI level T1</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Hello, Bora.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Bora is his own name. Greet Yeay: Hello, Yeay.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Hello, Yeay.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Hello and the name of the person.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">You are Bora.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Bora is talking about himself. Say: Hello, Yeay.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"T2\" data-q=\"3\" data-sc=\"SC3\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">3.</span> 🌅 The teacher shows a sunrise picture. Which greeting fits?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 3 · RTTI level T2</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Good morning!</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Sunrise is the start of the day.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Goodbye!</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Goodbye is for leaving. At sunrise say: Good morning!</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Thank you!</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Thank you is for getting something. Say: Good morning!</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"I\" data-q=\"4\" data-sc=\"SC4\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">4.</span> Why can we say \"hello\" later in the day?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 4 · RTTI level I</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Hello is only for school.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Hello works at home too. It works at any time.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Hello works at any time.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Good morning is for the start of the day; hello still works later.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Hello is for a teacher.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">We said hello to Yeay at home. It works at any time.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"R\" data-q=\"5\" data-sc=\"SC5\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">5.</span> 🔤 Which card is the letter C c?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 5 · RTTI level R</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">A a</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is A a. Find C c.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">E e</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is E e. Find C c.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">C c</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! C c. The sound is /k/.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><div class=\"quiz-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary quiz-check\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-check-double\"></i> Check</button><button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary quiz-retry\" hidden=\"\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate-left\"></i> Try again</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-score\" role=\"status\"></span></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-rtti\" hidden=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b8efd777f4\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.3 §22 ¶0\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.3-22-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §22 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §22 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">CEFR cross-reference</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9ace50ee5c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.3 §22 ¶1\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.3-22-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §22 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §22 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Secondary reference only. Pre-A1 can-do statements adapted from the CEFR Companion Volume (2020); not an official CEFR test.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2228cac0f7\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.3 §22 ¶2\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.3-22-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.3 §22 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.3 §22 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶2</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>I can say <em>hello</em> and <em>good morning</em> and choose one for the time of day.</li>\n<li>I can recognise the letter C c.</li>\n</ul></div>"}, {"id": "S.4", "title": "Session S004: Good morning, teacher", "order": 4, "goals": ["Course plan outcome: Pupils greet the teacher with good morning and say their name (Listening and Speaking), and recognise and copy the letter D d.", "Success criterion 1: I can say Good morning, teacher.", "Success criterion 2: I can greet the teacher at the door and say I am and my name.", "Success criterion 3: I can use the same greeting at school that I use at home.", "Success criterion 4: I know teacher after good morning does the job of Yeay at home.", "Success criterion 5: I can point to D d and copy it."], "metadata": {"status": "draft", "grade": "1", "week": "2", "session": "S004", "setting": "School, start of the day", "characters": "Bora, Sreyneang, Kru Sopheak", "subject": "Foreign Languages (English)", "moeys_reference": "see L.0 §1 (Curriculum Framework 2016)", "cefr_cross_reference": "Pre-A1 (adapted, CEFR Companion Volume)", "duration": "one study hour (40 min)", "updated": "2026-11-06 (v1.6.0)"}, "file": "s004-good-morning-teacher.md", "notes": ["<p>Khmer words and pupil sentences to be verified by a native speaker (Grade 1 level). Khmer spelling of the character names (Yeay យាយ, Kru គ្រូ, Bora បូរ៉ា, Sreyneang ស្រីណាង, Sopheak សុភ័ក្ត្រ, Chan ចាន់) also to be verified.</p>\n", "<p>The minute split is ours; the course plan gives the E1–E9 steps but no timings. With 30–50 pupils, E7 is done with a sample of pupils each session, so every pupil is checked across the week.</p>\n", "<p>CEFR Pre-A1 describes recognising letters but prescribes no order for the alphabet. The order (one letter per session, A a to F f in weeks 1–2) comes from the course plan.</p>\n"], "blocks": [{"ref": "S.4 §0 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-0-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "2cfd9b575a", "text": "Session S004: Good morning, teacher", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §0 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-0-1", "kind": "figure", "h": "da39a3ee5e", "text": "", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §0 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-0-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b2a3631405", "text": "Week 2 · School, start of the day · Bora, Sreyneang, Kru Sopheak.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §0 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-0-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5baa8875eb", "text": "The same good morning now moves to Kru Sopheak at the classroom door. New letter: D d .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §1 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-1-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "025eec04ab", "text": "MoEYS frame", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §1 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-1-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ac36d97d4a", "text": "This session serves the MoEYS frame in L.0 §1 ¶2 : core competency 4.2, the Listening and Speaking components plus one letter, and one 40-minute study hour.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §1 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-1-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2baba6e82b", "text": "Session syllabus:", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §1 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-1-3", "kind": "table", "h": "87af115406", "text": "Function Form Vocabulary Grammar Letter Greeting the teacher at school Good morning, teacher. – I am Kru Sopheak. You are Bora. good morning, teacher (hello: reinforce; please, thank you: recognize) to be: I am / you are with a new person D d", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §2 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-2-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "5a49743b7a", "text": "Feed up (E1: theme introduction)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §2 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-2-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "8089a8ed6c", "text": "Bora and Sreyneang reach the classroom. Kru Sopheak is at the door. They greet her the way they greeted Yeay — good morning plus the name they use for her: teacher .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §2 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-2-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "fccc623dad", "text": "Situational: greeting the teacher at the classroom door. Broad: the same greeting with a school person.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §2 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-2-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "4a622d85bb", "text": "Scene: picture school door (to be drawn)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §3 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-3-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "7660a32c11", "text": "Words this session", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §3 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-3-1", "kind": "table", "h": "0c74751b0c", "text": "Word Role good morning reproduce teacher reproduce hello reinforce please recognize thank you recognize", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §4 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-4-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "dd17342cb4", "text": "Grammar", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §4 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-4-1", "kind": "list", "h": "774d1356fe", "text": "Primary: I am / you are with a new person Reinforce: good morning + name Reach-ahead: she is — one heard line if it appears. Do not teach. S005 owns it. Please / thank you — S006.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §5 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-5-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "f7c6b8a70c", "text": "Letters (MoEYS)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §5 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-5-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "30ef60aa44", "text": "Card: letter card D d", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §5 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-5-2", "kind": "table", "h": "e6d31f54ff", "text": "Letter D d Name D Sound /d/ as in good ( good morning ). Whole word Point to d at the end of good . Do not add dog . Write Air-write, then copy D d .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §6 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-6-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "da75f75ee9", "text": "By the end of this session you will be able to:", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §6 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-6-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §6 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-6-2", "kind": "list", "h": "eccda3e4b1", "text": "Say good morning, teacher and the word teacher . Point to D d .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §6 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-6-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §6 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.4-6-4", "kind": "list", "h": "9c07ce6522", "text": "Greet Kru Sopheak at the door and say I am [name] .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §6 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.4-6-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §6 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.4-6-6", "kind": "list", "h": "554a7f3b0c", "text": "Use the same good morning + name pattern you used with Yeay, now with the teacher.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §6 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.4-6-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §6 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.4-6-8", "kind": "list", "h": "c86bcfcae1", "text": "Teacher after good morning does the same job as Yeay at home. The English greeting does not change.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §7 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-7-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "52f7c040c5", "text": "Words with Khmer", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §7 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-7-1", "kind": "table", "h": "749a89ddbf", "text": "Word Khmer good morning អរុណសួស្តី teacher គ្រូ hello សួស្តី please សូម thank you អរគុណ", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §7 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-7-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d7b1117211", "text": "Learning goal: Today we greet the teacher at the classroom door.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §7 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-7-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "8c38bd8c83", "text": "In Khmer: ថ្ងៃនេះ យើងសួរសុខទុក្ខគ្រូនៅមាត់ទ្វារថ្នាក់។", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §7 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.4-7-4", "kind": "table", "h": "593949520b", "text": "# Success criterion (pupil words) RTTI Khmer (pupil words) Picture or gesture cue 1 I can say Good morning, teacher . Reproduction (R) ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ Good morning, teacher។ bow slightly, wave 2 I can greet the teacher at the door and say I am and my name. Training (T1) ខ្ញុំអាចសួរសុខទុក្ខគ្រូនៅមាត់ទ្វារ ហើយនិយាយ I am និងឈ្មោះខ្ញុំ។ door 3 I can use the same greeting at school that I use at home. Transfer (T2) ខ្ញុំអាចប្រើពាក្យសួរសុខទុក្ខដដែល នៅសាលា និងនៅផ្ទះ។ house, then school 4 I know teacher after good morning does the job of Yeay at home. Insight (I) ខ្ញុំដឹងថា teacher ក្រោយ good morning ដូច Yeay នៅផ្ទះ។ two pictures side by side 5 I can point to D d and copy it. Letter (R) ខ្ញុំអាចចង្អុល D d ហើយចម្លងវា។ air-write D", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §7 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.4-7-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "40bea74885", "text": "Criteria 1–4 are the four goals above in pupil words; criterion 5 is the letter. Draw the five cues on the board and point to them at the start and at the end.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §8 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-8-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "a343dabcab", "text": "RTTI rubric for the teacher", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §8 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-8-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "fa9039d2ed", "text": "RTTI categories: R Reproduction, T1 Training, T2 Transfer, I Insight. They are categories, not a ladder: a pupil can be strong in Transfer and weak in Reproduction. Pass rule (E7): at least 3 of the 4 Reproduction and Training checks, plus the letter. Transfer and Insight are watched; they do not block a pass.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §8 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-8-2", "kind": "table", "h": "bb9dc1be5e", "text": "Criterion R – Reproduction T1 – Training T2 – Transfer I – Insight 1. I can say Good morning, teacher . Look for: teacher is clear. If not yet: child greets but has no word for the role. Say: \"You said it clearly.\" Next (E9): Tomorrow say teacher when you see me at the door, then good morning, teacher . Look for D in good . Needed to pass. (rated green) — — — 2. I can greet the teacher at the door and say I am and my name. — Look for: door exchange is complete. If not yet: child waits for a chorus. Say: \"You answered by yourself.\" Next (E9): You can say good morning, teacher . Next time add I am and your name. Needed to pass. (rated green) — — 3. I can use the same greeting at school that I use at home. — — Look for: child greets at the real door or greets another adult. If not yet: only works when you are acting Kru Sopheak at the desks. Say: \"You did it with someone new.\" Next (E9): You greeted me at school. It is the same good morning you used with Yeay. Watched, with help. (rated yellow) — 4. I know teacher after good morning does the job of Yeay at home. — — — Look for: child can match Yeay card to teacher card as \"name we add.\". If not yet: child thinks teacher is a greeting. It is the name-role, not the hello. Say: \"You showed me why.\" Next (E9): Yeay and teacher are different people. The greeting words stay. The name we add changes. Watched, stretch goal. (rated red) 5. I can point to D d and copy it. (letter) Look for: Points to D d and copies it (air-write counts). If not yet: Points to the wrong card: say the name and sound again, air-write together. Say: \"You found D.\" Next (E9): \"Look for d in your name or on the board.\" Needed to pass. (rated green) — — —", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §9 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-9-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "ba0b563256", "text": "E2: Entry readiness", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §9 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-9-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b5e76965b5", "text": "Speaking, pointing, tracing.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §9 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-9-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §9 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-9-3", "kind": "list", "h": "e41aaaa2cc", "text": "Say good morning . Say I am [name] . Point to D d (letter card D d). Say D or /d/.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §9 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.4-9-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §9 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.4-9-5", "kind": "list", "h": "aa5e8f471e", "text": "Greet one classmate with good morning or hello plus a name.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §9 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.4-9-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "48003a437b", "text": "Routing: 0 wrong = light E3. 1–2 wrong = full path. 3 wrong = S001 door practice first.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b2a0279bfc", "text": "E3: Core teaching conversation", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f6f88494a5", "text": "Classroom door. Default learner role: Bora or Sreyneang.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e678c5fb45", "text": "Audio: recording good morning, teacher (to be recorded)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f5937b6f2b", "text": "Kru Sopheak: Good morning, Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e76c5c69c4", "text": "Bora: Good morning, teacher.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d5809861ef", "text": "Kru Sopheak: Good morning, Sreyneang.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d919e6694d", "text": "Sreyneang: Good morning, teacher.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7734b798e1", "text": "Kru Sopheak: I am Kru Sopheak. You are Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c17a5ea186", "text": "Bora: I am Bora. You are Kru Sopheak.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶11", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-11", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "523d57e406", "text": "Sreyneang: I am Sreyneang.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶12", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-12", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e468a73913", "text": "One child may take Kru Sopheak's lines for one classmate. Same practised door.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶13", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-13", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶14", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-14", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a6567dec3e", "text": "Same words at the real classroom door at the start of the day — or to another adult in the school, not only the English teacher in role.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶15", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-15", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §10 ¶16", "anchor": "p-S.4-10-16", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "16dcd440a5", "text": "We say teacher after good morning , the way we said Yeay at home. The first words stay good morning .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §11 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-11-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "d10e9904fa", "text": "E4: Going further", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §11 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-11-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §11 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-11-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e249b65a2b", "text": "Why this works Kru Sopheak greets each child by name. The children give teacher back. Nobody is anonymous at the door.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §11 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-11-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §11 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.4-11-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c935c520ee", "text": "Watch out for", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §11 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.4-11-5", "kind": "list", "h": "299f304352", "text": "Good morning teacher good morning as a chant with no name of the child. Hear each child. Hello Yeay said to the teacher by habit. Smile, model teacher . English Miss / Sir imported from a video. Teacher is enough in this course.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §11 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.4-11-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §11 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.4-11-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "dc453a91c3", "text": "Cultural context Khmer kru is a title of respect. English teacher here is that title, not a cold job label. We do not train children to use a first name only with Kru Sopheak.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §11 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.4-11-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "48136dddf5", "text": "Going further", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §11 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.4-11-9", "kind": "list", "h": "983e7ed4e6", "text": "Who is Yeay at home? Who is teacher at school? Do the first two English words change?", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §12 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-12-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "f7c6b8a70c", "text": "Letters (MoEYS)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §12 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-12-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "30ef60aa44", "text": "Card: letter card D d", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §12 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-12-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a1af3ca082", "text": "Show D d . Name D , sound /d/. Point to d in good . Air-write, then copy D d .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §13 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-13-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "e2f0c8f8c9", "text": "E5: Teacher notes", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §13 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-13-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "69e059f56a", "text": "For the teacher.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §13 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-13-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a64d216c7d", "text": "Lesson intent Prove that week 1 English travels. The new word is teacher . She is may be heard; do not teach it.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §13 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-13-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b230d097fd", "text": "RTTI guidance", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §13 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.4-13-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "202ec38261", "text": "Reproduction (R) — Strong: teacher is clear. Weak: child greets but has no word for the role.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §13 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.4-13-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "1e0ffe04ff", "text": "Training (T1) — Strong: door exchange is complete. Weak: child waits for a chorus.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §13 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.4-13-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e8b8766028", "text": "Transfer (T2) — Strong: child greets at the real door or greets another adult. Weak: only works when you are acting Kru Sopheak at the desks.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §13 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.4-13-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c9b902d0c8", "text": "Insight (I) — Strong: child can match Yeay card to teacher card as \"name we add.\" Weak: child thinks teacher is a greeting. It is the name-role, not the hello.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §13 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.4-13-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2161bc2a7a", "text": "Common errors", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §13 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.4-13-9", "kind": "list", "h": "e23c6b3522", "text": "Kru only, no English. Accept Kru , then add teacher as the English we practise. She is used for a boy. Do not scold. S005 will slow this down.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §13 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.4-13-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d3b990875a", "text": "Reach-ahead Please / thank you — S006. He is — S005.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §13 ¶11", "anchor": "p-S.4-13-11", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "36e00fd80b", "text": "Cultural notes Children may bow or sampeah while they say good morning . Keep that. English does not replace the gesture.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §13 ¶12", "anchor": "p-S.4-13-12", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f9e638a079", "text": "Letters Today D d . Name, /d/, copy. Point to d in good .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §14 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-14-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "49bdda0e0e", "text": "E6: Practice", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §14 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-14-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §14 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-14-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "0c71493c38", "text": "Line in the classroom. You are Kru Sopheak. Each child: Good morning, teacher. You: Good morning, [name]. I am Kru Sopheak. Child: I am [name]. Then one child takes your lines for two classmates.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §14 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-14-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §14 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.4-14-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "1e9a6c74c6", "text": "Use the real classroom door at the start of the day, or greet another adult in the school with Good morning, teacher (or that adult's name). Same words, not a role-play.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §14 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.4-14-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §14 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.4-14-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e0d0cd3b7d", "text": "Letters Air-write D d , then copy. Point to d in good on a word card if you have one.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §15 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-15-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "9e9a020100", "text": "E7: Exit check", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §15 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-15-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "0baff986e0", "text": "Eight spoken checks, two per category, plus one letter check. Pass on Reproduction and Training (at least 3 of those 4) and the letter check. Transfer and Insight are watched — they do not block a pass.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §15 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-15-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §15 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-15-3", "kind": "list", "h": "71a18184e7", "text": "Says teacher . Says Good morning, teacher .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §15 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.4-15-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §15 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.4-15-5", "kind": "list", "h": "1b7c328396", "text": "Completes the door exchange with you. Says I am [name] to the teacher, not only to a friend.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §15 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.4-15-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §15 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.4-15-7", "kind": "list", "h": "efd2ceb18f", "text": "Greets you as teacher without the home picture. Can greet a classmate-as-teacher with the same pattern.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §15 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.4-15-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §15 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.4-15-9", "kind": "list", "h": "0255a6cfa8", "text": "Matches Yeay (home) and teacher (school) as the name we add. Shows that good morning itself did not change.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §15 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.4-15-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efe2ab6b7d", "text": "Letters 9. Points to D d (letter card D d) and copies it (air-write counts).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §16 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-16-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "66ba33e460", "text": "E8: Formative evaluation and reformat", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §16 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-16-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ef60293a44", "text": "[Name], good morning worked at school. The new word is teacher . Next we name he and she in the class.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §16 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-16-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2eccf29380", "text": "Reformat triggers — E3 only. Max two.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §16 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-16-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §16 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.4-16-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "8b638611b4", "text": "Reproduction weak: Only good morning, teacher in a two-person loop.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §16 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.4-16-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §16 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.4-16-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "cde685c0c4", "text": "Training weak: You stay as Kru Sopheak. No child-as-teacher yet.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §16 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.4-16-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §16 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.4-16-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "be49f6ed1b", "text": "Transfer weak: Stay at the desks with the school picture. Door later.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §16 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.4-16-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §16 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.4-16-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ce4a8550cf", "text": "Insight weak: Hold the Yeay picture next to you. Child points. No spoken rule.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §17 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-17-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b170a2e736", "text": "E9: Feed forward", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §17 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-17-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §17 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-17-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "54499b7bf2", "text": "Tomorrow say teacher when you see me at the door, then good morning, teacher . Look for D in good .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §17 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-17-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §17 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.4-17-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5112e026ce", "text": "You can say good morning, teacher . Next time add I am and your name.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §17 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.4-17-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §17 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.4-17-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "cfa374b56d", "text": "You greeted me at school. It is the same good morning you used with Yeay.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §17 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.4-17-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §17 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.4-17-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "33701c385c", "text": "Yeay and teacher are different people. The greeting words stay. The name we add changes.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §18 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-18-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "81640ecdaf", "text": "Teacher-led session (one study hour, 40 min)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §18 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-18-1", "kind": "table", "h": "27356fb17e", "text": "Step Minutes What happens E1 Theme and feed up 5 Show the picture, say the learning goal, point to the five cues. E2 Entry readiness 4 Quick check; route pupils as in E2. E3 Core conversation 10 Teacher in role; the class answers, then small groups. E4 Going further 4 Watch-out points and the cultural note. E6 Practice and letter 8 Role-play in pairs; air-write and copy the letter. E7 Exit check 6 Spoken checks with a sample of pupils; note the RTTI categories. E8–E9 Reformat and feed forward 3 Back to the five cues; one feed-forward message per pupil or group.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §18 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-18-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "30e5cd2054", "text": "E5 is for the teacher before the session.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §19 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-19-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "86b4ba2ff9", "text": "Story", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §19 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-19-1", "kind": "scene", "h": "da39a3ee5e", "text": "", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §20 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-20-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "e9029a8cd7", "text": "Self-paced app session", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §20 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-20-1", "kind": "list", "h": "91af128049", "text": "Listen: the classroom-door picture with the dialogue (Kru Sopheak, Bora, Sreyneang). Say it: record Good morning, teacher. after the teacher's line. Home or school: a picture of Yeay or Kru Sopheak appears; the pupil records Good morning, Yeay or Good morning, teacher . Letter card: tap D d (name and sound /d/); find d at the end of good ; trace D d. Quiz: five questions.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §20 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-20-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "3ab40ef011", "text": "The learner story above is the JSON scene player ( scenes/s004.json ); edit that file to change lines or timing without rebuilding Markdown.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §20 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-20-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6df6c9f3e3", "text": "The app shows the five cues at the start and the feed-forward message from E9 at the end.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §21 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-21-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "25c86f6a92", "text": "Quiz", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §21 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-21-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f331673cc7", "text": "Each question checks one success criterion in one RTTI category. After Check , the quiz shows the result per criterion and what to try next.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §21 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-21-2", "kind": "table", "h": "a293817b9e", "text": "Success criterion RTTI Question 1 Reproduction R 1 2 Training T1 2 3 Transfer T2 3 4 Insight I 4 5 Letter D d R 5", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §21 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.4-21-3", "kind": "quiz", "h": "44dcdd2903", "text": "1. 🚪 Kru Sopheak says \"Good morning, Bora.\" What does Bora say? Criterion 1 · RTTI level R Good morning, Yeay. Yeay is at home. At school say: Good morning, teacher. Good morning, teacher. Yes! Good morning and the name we use for her. Good night, teacher. It is the start of the day. Say: Good morning, teacher. 2. Kru Sopheak says \"I am Kru Sopheak. You are …?\" Criterion 2 · RTTI level T1 I am Sreyneang. Yes! You said I am and your name. You are Sreyneang. Talk about yourself: I am Sreyneang. Good morning, Yeay. Answer the teacher: I am Sreyneang. 3. 🏫 You meet another teacher in the school yard in the morning. What do you say? Criterion 3 · RTTI level T2 Hello, Yeay! Yeay is your grandmother. Greet the teacher: Good morning, teacher! Good morning, teacher! Yes! Same words, new teacher. Thank you, teacher! Nothing was given yet. Greet: Good morning, teacher! 4. At home we say \"Good morning, Yeay\". At school we say \"Good morning, teacher\". What changed? Criterion 4 · RTTI level I the words good morning Good morning stays the same. Only the name changes. nothing changed at all Look again: the name after good morning changed. only the name after it Yes! Teacher does the job Yeay does at home. 5. 🔤 Which card is the letter D d? Criterion 5 · RTTI level R D d Yes! D d, as at the end of good. B b That is B b. Find D d. F f That is F f. Find D d. Check Try again", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §22 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.4-22-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b8efd777f4", "text": "CEFR cross-reference", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §22 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.4-22-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "9ace50ee5c", "text": "Secondary reference only. Pre-A1 can-do statements adapted from the CEFR Companion Volume (2020); not an official CEFR test.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.4 §22 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.4-22-2", "kind": "list", "h": "516749b972", "text": "I can greet my teacher with good morning and say my name. I can recognise the letter D d.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}], "html": "<div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2cfd9b575a\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §0 ¶0\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.4-0-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §0 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §0 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶0</button><h1 data-body=\"1\">Session S004: Good morning, teacher</h1></div><div class=\"blk blk-figure fl-full\" data-h=\"da39a3ee5e\" data-kind=\"figure\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §0 ¶1\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.4-0-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §0 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §0 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶1</button><figure class=\"fig fig-full\" data-body=\"1\" data-marker=\"full\"><button aria-label=\"Enlarge image: Letter card D d\" class=\"img-zoom\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Letter card D d\" data-src=\"images/letter-d.svg\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"assets/images/images/letter-d.svg\"/></button></figure></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b2a3631405\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §0 ¶2\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.4-0-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §0 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §0 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Week 2 · School, start of the day · Bora, Sreyneang, Kru Sopheak.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5baa8875eb\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §0 ¶3\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.4-0-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §0 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §0 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">The same <em>good morning</em> now moves to Kru Sopheak at the classroom door. New letter: <strong>D d</strong>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"025eec04ab\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §1 ¶0\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.4-1-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §1 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §1 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">MoEYS frame</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ac36d97d4a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §1 ¶1\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.4-1-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §1 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §1 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">This session serves the MoEYS frame in <a data-href=\"#p-L.0-1-2\" href=\"#p-L.0-1-2\">L.0 §1 ¶2</a>: core competency 4.2, the Listening and Speaking components plus one letter, and one 40-minute study hour.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2baba6e82b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §1 ¶2\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.4-1-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §1 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §1 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Session syllabus:</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"87af115406\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §1 ¶3\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.4-1-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §1 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §1 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶3</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Function</th>\n<th>Form</th>\n<th>Vocabulary</th>\n<th>Grammar</th>\n<th>Letter</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Greeting the teacher at school</td>\n<td>Good morning, teacher. – I am Kru Sopheak. You are Bora.</td>\n<td>good morning, teacher (hello: reinforce; please, thank you: recognize)</td>\n<td>to be: I am / you are with a new person</td>\n<td>D d</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5a49743b7a\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §2 ¶0\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.4-2-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §2 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §2 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Feed up (E1: theme introduction)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8089a8ed6c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §2 ¶1\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.4-2-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §2 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §2 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Bora and Sreyneang reach the classroom. Kru Sopheak is at the door. They greet her the way they greeted Yeay — <em>good morning</em> plus the name they use for her: <em>teacher</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"fccc623dad\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §2 ¶2\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.4-2-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §2 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §2 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Situational:</strong> greeting the teacher at the classroom door.\n<strong>Broad:</strong> the same greeting with a school person.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4a622d85bb\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §2 ¶3\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.4-2-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §2 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §2 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">Scene: picture <em>school door</em> (to be drawn)</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7660a32c11\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §3 ¶0\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.4-3-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §3 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §3 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Words this session</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0c74751b0c\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §3 ¶1\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.4-3-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §3 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §3 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Word</th>\n<th>Role</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>good morning</td>\n<td>reproduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>teacher</td>\n<td>reproduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hello</td>\n<td>reinforce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>please</td>\n<td>recognize</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>thank you</td>\n<td>recognize</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"dd17342cb4\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §4 ¶0\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-S.4-4-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §4 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §4 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Grammar</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"774d1356fe\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §4 ¶1\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-S.4-4-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §4 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §4 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶1</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Primary:</strong> <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em> with a new person</li>\n<li><strong>Reinforce:</strong> <em>good morning</em> + name</li>\n<li><strong>Reach-ahead:</strong> <em>she is</em> — one heard line if it appears. Do not teach. S005 owns it. <em>Please</em> / <em>thank you</em> — S006.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f7c6b8a70c\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §5 ¶0\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.4-5-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §5 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §5 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Letters (MoEYS)</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"30ef60aa44\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §5 ¶1\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.4-5-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §5 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §5 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Card: letter card D d</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e6d31f54ff\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §5 ¶2\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.4-5-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §5 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §5 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Letter</td>\n<td><strong>D d</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Name</td>\n<td><em>D</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sound</td>\n<td>/d/ as in <em>good</em> (<em>good morning</em>).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Whole word</td>\n<td>Point to <em>d</em> at the end of <em>good</em>. Do not add <em>dog</em>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write</td>\n<td>Air-write, then copy <em>D d</em>.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"da75f75ee9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §6 ¶0\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.4-6-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §6 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §6 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">By the end of this session you will be able to:</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §6 ¶1\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.4-6-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §6 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §6 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"eccda3e4b1\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §6 ¶2\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.4-6-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §6 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §6 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶2</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Say <em>good morning, teacher</em> and the word <em>teacher</em>. Point to <strong>D d</strong>.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §6 ¶3\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.4-6-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §6 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §6 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9c07ce6522\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.4 §6 ¶4\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.4-6-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §6 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §6 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶4</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"2\">\n<li>Greet Kru Sopheak at the door and say <em>I am [name]</em>.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.4 §6 ¶5\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.4-6-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §6 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §6 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"554a7f3b0c\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.4 §6 ¶6\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.4-6-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §6 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §6 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶6</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"3\">\n<li>Use the same <em>good morning</em> + name pattern you used with Yeay, now with the teacher.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.4 §6 ¶7\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.4-6-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §6 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §6 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c86bcfcae1\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.4 §6 ¶8\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.4-6-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §6 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §6 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶8</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"4\">\n<li><em>Teacher</em> after <em>good morning</em> does the same job as <em>Yeay</em> at home. The English greeting does not change.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"52f7c040c5\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §7 ¶0\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.4-7-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §7 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §7 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Words with Khmer</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"749a89ddbf\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §7 ¶1\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.4-7-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §7 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §7 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Word</th>\n<th>Khmer</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>good morning</td>\n<td>អរុណសួស្តី</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>teacher</td>\n<td>គ្រូ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hello</td>\n<td>សួស្តី</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>please</td>\n<td>សូម</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>thank you</td>\n<td>អរគុណ</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d7b1117211\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §7 ¶2\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.4-7-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §7 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §7 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Learning goal:</strong> Today we greet the teacher at the classroom door.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8c38bd8c83\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §7 ¶3\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.4-7-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §7 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §7 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>In Khmer:</strong> ថ្ងៃនេះ យើងសួរសុខទុក្ខគ្រូនៅមាត់ទ្វារថ្នាក់។</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"593949520b\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.4 §7 ¶4\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.4-7-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §7 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §7 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶4</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>Success criterion (pupil words)</th>\n<th>RTTI</th>\n<th>Khmer (pupil words)</th>\n<th>Picture or gesture cue</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>I can say <em>Good morning, teacher</em>.</td>\n<td>Reproduction (R)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ Good morning, teacher។</td>\n<td>bow slightly, wave</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>I can greet the teacher at the door and say <em>I am</em> and my name.</td>\n<td>Training (T1)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចសួរសុខទុក្ខគ្រូនៅមាត់ទ្វារ ហើយនិយាយ I am និងឈ្មោះខ្ញុំ។</td>\n<td>door</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>I can use the same greeting at school that I use at home.</td>\n<td>Transfer (T2)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចប្រើពាក្យសួរសុខទុក្ខដដែល នៅសាលា និងនៅផ្ទះ។</td>\n<td>house, then school</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>I know <em>teacher</em> after <em>good morning</em> does the job of <em>Yeay</em> at home.</td>\n<td>Insight (I)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំដឹងថា teacher ក្រោយ good morning ដូច Yeay នៅផ្ទះ។</td>\n<td>two pictures side by side</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>I can point to <strong>D d</strong> and copy it.</td>\n<td>Letter (R)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចចង្អុល D d ហើយចម្លងវា។</td>\n<td>air-write D</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"40bea74885\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.4 §7 ¶5\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.4-7-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §7 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §7 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\">Criteria 1–4 are the four goals above in pupil words; criterion 5 is the letter. Draw the five cues on the board and point to them at the start and at the end.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a343dabcab\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §8 ¶0\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.4-8-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §8 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §8 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">RTTI rubric for the teacher</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"fa9039d2ed\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §8 ¶1\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.4-8-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §8 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §8 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">RTTI categories: <strong>R</strong> Reproduction, <strong>T1</strong> Training, <strong>T2</strong> Transfer, <strong>I</strong> Insight. They are categories, not a ladder: a pupil can be strong in Transfer and weak in Reproduction. Pass rule (E7): at least 3 of the 4 Reproduction and Training checks, plus the letter. Transfer and Insight are watched; they do not block a pass.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"bb9dc1be5e\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §8 ¶2\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.4-8-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §8 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §8 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Criterion</th>\n<th>R – Reproduction</th>\n<th>T1 – Training</th>\n<th>T2 – Transfer</th>\n<th>I – Insight</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1. I can say <em>Good morning, teacher</em>.</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> <em>teacher</em> is clear. <strong>If not yet:</strong> child greets but has no word for the role. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You said it clearly.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> Tomorrow say <em>teacher</em> when you see me at the door, then <em>good morning, teacher</em>. Look for <em>D</em> in <em>good</em>. <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. I can greet the teacher at the door and say <em>I am</em> and my name.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> door exchange is complete. <strong>If not yet:</strong> child waits for a chorus. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You answered by yourself.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> You can say <em>good morning, teacher</em>. Next time add <em>I am</em> and your name. <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. I can use the same greeting at school that I use at home.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-yellow\"><strong>Look for:</strong> child greets at the real door or greets another adult. <strong>If not yet:</strong> only works when you are acting Kru Sopheak at the desks. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You did it with someone new.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> You greeted me at school. It is the same <em>good morning</em> you used with Yeay. <em>Watched, with help.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"yellow\" title=\"Rated yellow\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated yellow)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. I know <em>teacher</em> after <em>good morning</em> does the job of <em>Yeay</em> at home.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-red\"><strong>Look for:</strong> child can match <em>Yeay</em> card to <em>teacher</em> card as \"name we add.\". <strong>If not yet:</strong> child thinks <em>teacher</em> is a greeting. It is the name-role, not the hello. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You showed me why.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> <em>Yeay</em> and <em>teacher</em> are different people. The greeting words stay. The name we add changes. <em>Watched, stretch goal.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"red\" title=\"Rated red\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-xmark\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated red)</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. I can point to <strong>D d</strong> and copy it. (letter)</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> Points to <strong>D d</strong> and copies it (air-write counts). <strong>If not yet:</strong> Points to the wrong card: say the name and sound again, air-write together. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You found D.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> \"Look for d in your name or on the board.\" <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ba0b563256\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §9 ¶0\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.4-9-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §9 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §9 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E2: Entry readiness</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b5e76965b5\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §9 ¶1\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.4-9-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §9 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §9 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Speaking, pointing, tracing.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §9 ¶2\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.4-9-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §9 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §9 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e41aaaa2cc\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §9 ¶3\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.4-9-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §9 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §9 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶3</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Say <em>good morning</em>.</li>\n<li>Say <em>I am [name]</em>.</li>\n<li>Point to <strong>D d</strong> (letter card D d). Say <em>D</em> or /d/.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.4 §9 ¶4\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.4-9-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §9 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §9 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"aa5e8f471e\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.4 §9 ¶5\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.4-9-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §9 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §9 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶5</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"4\">\n<li>Greet one classmate with <em>good morning</em> or <em>hello</em> plus a name.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"48003a437b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.4 §9 ¶6\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.4-9-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §9 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §9 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Routing:</strong> 0 wrong = light E3. 1–2 wrong = full path. 3 wrong = S001 door practice first.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b2a0279bfc\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶0\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E3: Core teaching conversation</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f6f88494a5\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶1\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Classroom door. Default learner role: Bora or Sreyneang.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e678c5fb45\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶2\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Audio: recording <em>good morning, teacher</em> (to be recorded)</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶3\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f5937b6f2b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶4\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Kru Sopheak:</strong> Good morning, Bora.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e76c5c69c4\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶5\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> Good morning, teacher.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d5809861ef\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶6\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Kru Sopheak:</strong> Good morning, Sreyneang.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d919e6694d\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶7\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Sreyneang:</strong> Good morning, teacher.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶8\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7734b798e1\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶9\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Kru Sopheak:</strong> I am Kru Sopheak. You are Bora.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c17a5ea186\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶10\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> I am Bora. You are Kru Sopheak.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"523d57e406\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"11\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶11\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-11\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶11\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶11 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶11</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Sreyneang:</strong> I am Sreyneang.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e468a73913\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"12\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶12\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-12\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶12\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶12 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶12</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>One child may take Kru Sopheak's lines for one classmate. Same practised door.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"13\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶13\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-13\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶13\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶13 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶13</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a6567dec3e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"14\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶14\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-14\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶14\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶14 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶14</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Same words at the real classroom door at the start of the day — or to another adult in the school, not only the English teacher in role.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"15\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶15\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-15\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶15\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶15 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶15</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"16dcd440a5\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"16\" data-ref=\"S.4 §10 ¶16\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.4-10-16\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §10 ¶16\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §10 ¶16 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶16</button><p data-body=\"1\">We say <em>teacher</em> after <em>good morning</em>, the way we said <em>Yeay</em> at home. The first words stay <em>good morning</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d10e9904fa\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §11 ¶0\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.4-11-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §11 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §11 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E4: Going further</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §11 ¶1\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.4-11-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §11 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §11 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e249b65a2b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §11 ¶2\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.4-11-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §11 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §11 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Why this works</strong>\nKru Sopheak greets each child by name. The children give <em>teacher</em> back. Nobody is anonymous at the door.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §11 ¶3\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.4-11-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §11 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §11 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c935c520ee\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.4 §11 ¶4\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.4-11-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §11 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §11 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Watch out for</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"299f304352\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.4 §11 ¶5\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.4-11-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §11 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §11 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶5</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><em>Good morning teacher good morning</em> as a chant with no name of the child. Hear each child.</li>\n<li><em>Hello Yeay</em> said to the teacher by habit. Smile, model <em>teacher</em>.</li>\n<li>English <em>Miss</em> / <em>Sir</em> imported from a video. <em>Teacher</em> is enough in this course.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.4 §11 ¶6\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.4-11-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §11 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §11 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"dc453a91c3\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.4 §11 ¶7\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.4-11-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §11 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §11 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Cultural context</strong>\nKhmer <em>kru</em> is a title of respect. English <em>teacher</em> here is that title, not a cold job label. We do not train children to use a first name only with Kru Sopheak.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"48136dddf5\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.4 §11 ¶8\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.4-11-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §11 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §11 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Going further</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"983e7ed4e6\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.4 §11 ¶9\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.4-11-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §11 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §11 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶9</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Who is <em>Yeay</em> at home? Who is <em>teacher</em> at school?</li>\n<li>Do the first two English words change?</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f7c6b8a70c\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §12 ¶0\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.4-12-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §12 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §12 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Letters (MoEYS)</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"30ef60aa44\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §12 ¶1\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.4-12-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §12 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §12 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Card: letter card D d</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a1af3ca082\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §12 ¶2\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.4-12-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §12 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §12 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Show <em>D d</em>. Name <em>D</em>, sound /d/. Point to <em>d</em> in <em>good</em>. Air-write, then copy <em>D d</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e2f0c8f8c9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §13 ¶0\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.4-13-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §13 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §13 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E5: Teacher notes</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"69e059f56a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §13 ¶1\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.4-13-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §13 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §13 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>For the teacher.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a64d216c7d\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §13 ¶2\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.4-13-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §13 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §13 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Lesson intent</strong>\nProve that week 1 English travels. The new word is <em>teacher</em>. <em>She is</em> may be heard; do not teach it.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b230d097fd\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §13 ¶3\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.4-13-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §13 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §13 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>RTTI guidance</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"202ec38261\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.4 §13 ¶4\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.4-13-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §13 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §13 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong> — Strong: <em>teacher</em> is clear. Weak: child greets but has no word for the role.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"1e0ffe04ff\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.4 §13 ¶5\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.4-13-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §13 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §13 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong> — Strong: door exchange is complete. Weak: child waits for a chorus.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e8b8766028\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.4 §13 ¶6\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.4-13-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §13 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §13 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong> — Strong: child greets at the real door or greets another adult. Weak: only works when you are acting Kru Sopheak at the desks.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c9b902d0c8\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.4 §13 ¶7\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.4-13-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §13 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §13 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong> — Strong: child can match <em>Yeay</em> card to <em>teacher</em> card as \"name we add.\" Weak: child thinks <em>teacher</em> is a greeting. It is the name-role, not the hello.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2161bc2a7a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.4 §13 ¶8\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.4-13-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §13 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §13 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Common errors</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e23c6b3522\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.4 §13 ¶9\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.4-13-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §13 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §13 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶9</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><em>Kru</em> only, no English. Accept <em>Kru</em>, then add <em>teacher</em> as the English we practise.</li>\n<li><em>She is</em> used for a boy. Do not scold. S005 will slow this down.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d3b990875a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.4 §13 ¶10\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.4-13-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §13 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §13 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reach-ahead</strong>\n<em>Please</em> / <em>thank you</em> — S006. <em>He is</em> — S005.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"36e00fd80b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"11\" data-ref=\"S.4 §13 ¶11\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.4-13-11\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §13 ¶11\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §13 ¶11 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶11</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Cultural notes</strong>\nChildren may bow or <em>sampeah</em> while they say <em>good morning</em>. Keep that. English does not replace the gesture.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f9e638a079\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"12\" data-ref=\"S.4 §13 ¶12\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.4-13-12\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §13 ¶12\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §13 ¶12 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶12</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\nToday <strong>D d</strong>. Name, /d/, copy. Point to <em>d</em> in <em>good</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"49bdda0e0e\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §14 ¶0\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.4-14-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §14 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §14 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E6: Practice</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §14 ¶1\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.4-14-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §14 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §14 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0c71493c38\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §14 ¶2\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.4-14-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §14 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §14 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Line in the classroom. You are Kru Sopheak. Each child: <em>Good morning, teacher.</em> You: <em>Good morning, [name]. I am Kru Sopheak.</em> Child: <em>I am [name].</em> Then one child takes your lines for two classmates.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §14 ¶3\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.4-14-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §14 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §14 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"1e9a6c74c6\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.4 §14 ¶4\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.4-14-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §14 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §14 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\">Use the real classroom door at the start of the day, or greet another adult in the school with <em>Good morning, teacher</em> (or that adult's name). Same words, not a role-play.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.4 §14 ¶5\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.4-14-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §14 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §14 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e0d0cd3b7d\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.4 §14 ¶6\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.4-14-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §14 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §14 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\nAir-write <strong>D d</strong>, then copy. Point to <em>d</em> in <em>good</em> on a word card if you have one.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9e9a020100\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §15 ¶0\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.4-15-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §15 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §15 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E7: Exit check</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0baff986e0\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §15 ¶1\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.4-15-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §15 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §15 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Eight spoken checks, two per category, plus one letter check. Pass on Reproduction and Training (at least 3 of those 4) and the letter check. Transfer and Insight are watched — they do not block a pass.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §15 ¶2\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.4-15-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §15 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §15 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"71a18184e7\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §15 ¶3\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.4-15-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §15 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §15 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶3</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Says <em>teacher</em>.</li>\n<li>Says <em>Good morning, teacher</em>.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.4 §15 ¶4\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.4-15-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §15 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §15 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"1b7c328396\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.4 §15 ¶5\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.4-15-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §15 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §15 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶5</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"3\">\n<li>Completes the door exchange with you.</li>\n<li>Says <em>I am [name]</em> to the teacher, not only to a friend.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.4 §15 ¶6\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.4-15-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §15 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §15 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd2ceb18f\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.4 §15 ¶7\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.4-15-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §15 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §15 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶7</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"5\">\n<li>Greets you as teacher without the home picture.</li>\n<li>Can greet a classmate-as-teacher with the same pattern.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.4 §15 ¶8\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.4-15-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §15 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §15 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0255a6cfa8\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.4 §15 ¶9\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.4-15-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §15 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §15 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶9</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"7\">\n<li>Matches <em>Yeay</em> (home) and <em>teacher</em> (school) as the name we add.</li>\n<li>Shows that <em>good morning</em> itself did not change.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efe2ab6b7d\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.4 §15 ¶10\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.4-15-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §15 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §15 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\n9. Points to <strong>D d</strong> (letter card D d) and copies it (air-write counts).</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"66ba33e460\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §16 ¶0\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.4-16-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §16 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §16 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E8: Formative evaluation and reformat</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ef60293a44\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §16 ¶1\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.4-16-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §16 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §16 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">[Name], <em>good morning</em> worked at school. The new word is <em>teacher</em>. Next we name <em>he</em> and <em>she</em> in the class.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2eccf29380\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §16 ¶2\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.4-16-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §16 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §16 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reformat triggers</strong> — E3 only. Max two.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §16 ¶3\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.4-16-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §16 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §16 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8b638611b4\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.4 §16 ¶4\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.4-16-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §16 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §16 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction weak:</strong> Only <em>good morning, teacher</em> in a two-person loop.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.4 §16 ¶5\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.4-16-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §16 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §16 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"cde685c0c4\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.4 §16 ¶6\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.4-16-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §16 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §16 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training weak:</strong> You stay as Kru Sopheak. No child-as-teacher yet.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.4 §16 ¶7\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.4-16-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §16 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §16 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"be49f6ed1b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.4 §16 ¶8\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.4-16-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §16 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §16 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer weak:</strong> Stay at the desks with the school picture. Door later.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.4 §16 ¶9\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.4-16-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §16 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §16 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ce4a8550cf\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.4 §16 ¶10\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.4-16-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §16 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §16 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight weak:</strong> Hold the Yeay picture next to you. Child points. No spoken rule.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b170a2e736\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §17 ¶0\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.4-17-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §17 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §17 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E9: Feed forward</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §17 ¶1\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.4-17-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §17 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §17 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"54499b7bf2\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §17 ¶2\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.4-17-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §17 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §17 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Tomorrow say <em>teacher</em> when you see me at the door, then <em>good morning, teacher</em>. Look for <em>D</em> in <em>good</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §17 ¶3\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.4-17-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §17 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §17 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5112e026ce\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.4 §17 ¶4\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.4-17-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §17 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §17 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\">You can say <em>good morning, teacher</em>. Next time add <em>I am</em> and your name.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.4 §17 ¶5\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.4-17-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §17 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §17 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"cfa374b56d\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.4 §17 ¶6\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.4-17-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §17 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §17 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\">You greeted me at school. It is the same <em>good morning</em> you used with Yeay.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.4 §17 ¶7\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.4-17-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §17 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §17 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"33701c385c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.4 §17 ¶8\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.4-17-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §17 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §17 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Yeay</em> and <em>teacher</em> are different people. The greeting words stay. The name we add changes.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"81640ecdaf\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §18 ¶0\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.4-18-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §18 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §18 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Teacher-led session (one study hour, 40 min)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"27356fb17e\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §18 ¶1\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.4-18-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §18 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §18 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Step</th>\n<th>Minutes</th>\n<th>What happens</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>E1 Theme and feed up</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Show the picture, say the learning goal, point to the five cues.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2 Entry readiness</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Quick check; route pupils as in E2.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E3 Core conversation</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>Teacher in role; the class answers, then small groups.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E4 Going further</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Watch-out points and the cultural note.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E6 Practice and letter</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Role-play in pairs; air-write and copy the letter.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E7 Exit check</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Spoken checks with a sample of pupils; note the RTTI categories.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E8–E9 Reformat and feed forward</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Back to the five cues; one feed-forward message per pupil or group.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"30e5cd2054\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §18 ¶2\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.4-18-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §18 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §18 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">E5 is for the teacher before the session.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"86b4ba2ff9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §19 ¶0\" data-sec=\"19\" id=\"p-S.4-19-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §19 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §19 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§19 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Story</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-scene\" data-h=\"da39a3ee5e\" data-kind=\"scene\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §19 ¶1\" data-sec=\"19\" id=\"p-S.4-19-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §19 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §19 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§19 ¶1</button><div class=\"tli-scene-player\" data-body=\"1\" data-scene=\"scenes/s004.json\"></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e9029a8cd7\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §20 ¶0\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.4-20-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §20 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §20 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Self-paced app session</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"91af128049\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §20 ¶1\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.4-20-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §20 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §20 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶1</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Listen:</strong> the classroom-door picture with the dialogue (Kru Sopheak, Bora, Sreyneang).</li>\n<li><strong>Say it:</strong> record <em>Good morning, teacher.</em> after the teacher's line.</li>\n<li><strong>Home or school:</strong> a picture of Yeay or Kru Sopheak appears; the pupil records <em>Good morning, Yeay</em> or <em>Good morning, teacher</em>.</li>\n<li><strong>Letter card:</strong> tap <strong>D d</strong> (name and sound /d/); find d at the end of <em>good</em>; trace D d.</li>\n<li><strong>Quiz:</strong> five questions.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3ab40ef011\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §20 ¶2\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.4-20-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §20 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §20 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">The learner story above is the JSON scene player (<code>scenes/s004.json</code>); edit that file to change lines or timing without rebuilding Markdown.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6df6c9f3e3\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §20 ¶3\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.4-20-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §20 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §20 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">The app shows the five cues at the start and the feed-forward message from E9 at the end.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"25c86f6a92\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §21 ¶0\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.4-21-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §21 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §21 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Quiz</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f331673cc7\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §21 ¶1\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.4-21-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §21 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §21 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Each question checks one success criterion in one RTTI category. After <strong>Check</strong>, the quiz shows the result per criterion and what to try next.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a293817b9e\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §21 ¶2\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.4-21-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §21 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §21 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Success criterion</th>\n<th>RTTI</th>\n<th>Question</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1 Reproduction</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 Training</td>\n<td>T1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 Transfer</td>\n<td>T2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 Insight</td>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 Letter D d</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-quiz\" data-h=\"44dcdd2903\" data-kind=\"quiz\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.4 §21 ¶3\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.4-21-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §21 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §21 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶3</button><div aria-label=\"Quiz\" class=\"quiz\" data-body=\"1\" role=\"group\"><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"R\" data-q=\"1\" data-sc=\"SC1\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">1.</span> 🚪 Kru Sopheak says \"Good morning, Bora.\" What does Bora say?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 1 · RTTI level R</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Good morning, Yeay.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yeay is at home. At school say: Good morning, teacher.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Good morning, teacher.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Good morning and the name we use for her.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Good night, teacher.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">It is the start of the day. Say: Good morning, teacher.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"T1\" data-q=\"2\" data-sc=\"SC2\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">2.</span> Kru Sopheak says \"I am Kru Sopheak. You are …?\"</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 2 · RTTI level T1</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">I am Sreyneang.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! You said I am and your name.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">You are Sreyneang.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Talk about yourself: I am Sreyneang.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Good morning, Yeay.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Answer the teacher: I am Sreyneang.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"T2\" data-q=\"3\" data-sc=\"SC3\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">3.</span> 🏫 You meet another teacher in the school yard in the morning. What do you say?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 3 · RTTI level T2</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Hello, Yeay!</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yeay is your grandmother. Greet the teacher: Good morning, teacher!</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Good morning, teacher!</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Same words, new teacher.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Thank you, teacher!</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Nothing was given yet. Greet: Good morning, teacher!</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"I\" data-q=\"4\" data-sc=\"SC4\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">4.</span> At home we say \"Good morning, Yeay\". At school we say \"Good morning, teacher\". What changed?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 4 · RTTI level I</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">the words good morning</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Good morning stays the same. Only the name changes.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">nothing changed at all</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Look again: the name after good morning changed.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">only the name after it</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Teacher does the job Yeay does at home.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"R\" data-q=\"5\" data-sc=\"SC5\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">5.</span> 🔤 Which card is the letter D d?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 5 · RTTI level R</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">D d</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! D d, as at the end of good.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">B b</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is B b. Find D d.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">F f</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is F f. Find D d.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><div class=\"quiz-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary quiz-check\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-check-double\"></i> Check</button><button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary quiz-retry\" hidden=\"\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate-left\"></i> Try again</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-score\" role=\"status\"></span></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-rtti\" hidden=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b8efd777f4\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.4 §22 ¶0\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.4-22-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §22 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §22 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">CEFR cross-reference</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9ace50ee5c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.4 §22 ¶1\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.4-22-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §22 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §22 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Secondary reference only. Pre-A1 can-do statements adapted from the CEFR Companion Volume (2020); not an official CEFR test.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"516749b972\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.4 §22 ¶2\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.4-22-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.4 §22 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.4 §22 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶2</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>I can greet my teacher with <em>good morning</em> and say my name.</li>\n<li>I can recognise the letter D d.</li>\n</ul></div>"}, {"id": "S.5", "title": "Session S005: He is, she is", "order": 5, "goals": ["Course plan outcome: Pupils say who a classmate is with he is / she is (Listening and Speaking), and recognise and copy the letter E e.", "Success criterion 1: I can point and say he is … for a boy and she is … for a girl.", "Success criterion 2: I can say I am, you are and then he is or she is.", "Success criterion 3: I can use he is / she is about a real classmate.", "Success criterion 4: I know you is the person I talk to; he / she is the person I talk about.", "Success criterion 5: I can point to E e and copy it."], "metadata": {"status": "draft", "grade": "1", "week": "2", "session": "S005", "setting": "Classroom", "characters": "Bora, Sreyneang, Kru Sopheak", "subject": "Foreign Languages (English)", "moeys_reference": "see L.0 §1 (Curriculum Framework 2016)", "cefr_cross_reference": "Pre-A1 (adapted, CEFR Companion Volume)", "duration": "one study hour (40 min)", "updated": "2026-11-06 (v1.6.0)"}, "file": "s005-he-is-she-is.md", "notes": ["<p>Khmer words and pupil sentences to be verified by a native speaker (Grade 1 level). Khmer spelling of the character names (Yeay យាយ, Kru គ្រូ, Bora បូរ៉ា, Sreyneang ស្រីណាង, Sopheak សុភ័ក្ត្រ, Chan ចាន់) also to be verified.</p>\n", "<p>The minute split is ours; the course plan gives the E1–E9 steps but no timings. With 30–50 pupils, E7 is done with a sample of pupils each session, so every pupil is checked across the week.</p>\n", "<p>CEFR Pre-A1 describes recognising letters but prescribes no order for the alphabet. The order (one letter per session, A a to F f in weeks 1–2) comes from the course plan.</p>\n"], "blocks": [{"ref": "S.5 §0 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-0-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "5a63cec63f", "text": "Session S005: He is, she is", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §0 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-0-1", "kind": "figure", "h": "da39a3ee5e", "text": "", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §0 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-0-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7f4635171d", "text": "Week 2 · Classroom · Bora, Sreyneang, Kru Sopheak.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §0 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-0-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "16241f8797", "text": "Point to a classmate: He is Bora. She is Sreyneang. She is Kru Sopheak. New letter: E e .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §1 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-1-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "025eec04ab", "text": "MoEYS frame", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §1 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-1-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ac36d97d4a", "text": "This session serves the MoEYS frame in L.0 §1 ¶2 : core competency 4.2, the Listening and Speaking components plus one letter, and one 40-minute study hour.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §1 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-1-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2baba6e82b", "text": "Session syllabus:", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §1 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-1-3", "kind": "table", "h": "ff19022b4a", "text": "Function Form Vocabulary Grammar Letter Naming a classmate you talk about He is Bora. – She is Sreyneang. no new words (teacher, hello, good morning, I, you: reinforce) to be: he is / she is (subject pronouns) E e", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §2 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-2-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "5a49743b7a", "text": "Feed up (E1: theme introduction)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §2 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-2-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "0c16a250b6", "text": "Kru Sopheak asks the class to look at a friend, not at themselves. I and you stay. He and she are for the person we talk about .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §2 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-2-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "70c663ba0f", "text": "Situational: naming a classmate who is not the speaker. Broad: subject pronouns with to be .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §2 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-2-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "73beee730a", "text": "Scene: picture three people in class (to be drawn)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §3 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-3-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "7660a32c11", "text": "Words this session", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §3 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-3-1", "kind": "table", "h": "3a76ceb863", "text": "Word Role teacher reinforce hello reinforce good morning reinforce I reinforce you reinforce", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §3 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-3-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a5f87036a0", "text": "No new word list. The new work is he is / she is .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §4 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-4-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "dd17342cb4", "text": "Grammar", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §4 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-4-1", "kind": "list", "h": "434a738735", "text": "Primary: he is / she is Reinforce: I am / you are Reach-ahead: they are . Do not teach.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §5 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-5-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "f7c6b8a70c", "text": "Letters (MoEYS)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §5 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-5-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "4da8ec0c4e", "text": "Card: letter card E e", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §5 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-5-2", "kind": "table", "h": "18c6a5113d", "text": "Letter E e Name E (the name sounds like the vowel in he / she ) Sound Short /e/ (letter sound). Do not pretend she is pronounced with short /e/. Whole word Point to e in he / she / teacher (letters you can see). Write Air-write, then copy E e .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §6 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-6-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "da75f75ee9", "text": "By the end of this session you will be able to:", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §6 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-6-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §6 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-6-2", "kind": "list", "h": "77f976dc57", "text": "Point to a boy and say he is [name] . Point to a girl and say she is [name] . Point to E e .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §6 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-6-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §6 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.5-6-4", "kind": "list", "h": "205bb33f3e", "text": "After I am / you are , add one he is or she is about a third person.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §6 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.5-6-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §6 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.5-6-6", "kind": "list", "h": "350ecf72de", "text": "Use he is / she is about a child who was not in the dialogue (a real classmate).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §6 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.5-6-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §6 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.5-6-8", "kind": "list", "h": "53793b3676", "text": "He / she is the person we talk about. You is the person we talk to. They are not the same.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §7 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-7-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "52f7c040c5", "text": "Words with Khmer", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §7 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-7-1", "kind": "table", "h": "458cb7ace3", "text": "Word Khmer teacher គ្រូ hello សួស្តី good morning អរុណសួស្តី I ខ្ញុំ you អ្នក", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §7 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-7-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "d2f1f42938", "text": "Learning goal: Today we say he is and she is about a classmate.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §7 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-7-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "99059ba8c6", "text": "In Khmer: ថ្ងៃនេះ យើងនិយាយ he is និង she is អំពីមិត្តរួមថ្នាក់។", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §7 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.5-7-4", "kind": "table", "h": "a72f01e61f", "text": "# Success criterion (pupil words) RTTI Khmer (pupil words) Picture or gesture cue 1 I can point and say he is … for a boy and she is … for a girl. Reproduction (R) ខ្ញុំអាចចង្អុល ហើយនិយាយ he is … សម្រាប់ក្មេងប្រុស និង she is … សម្រាប់ក្មេងស្រី។ point 2 I can say I am , you are and then he is or she is . Training (T1) ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ I am, you are ហើយបន្ទាប់មក he is ឬ she is។ three fingers 3 I can use he is / she is about a real classmate. Transfer (T2) ខ្ញុំអាចប្រើ he is / she is អំពីមិត្តរួមថ្នាក់ពិត។ point to a classmate 4 I know you is the person I talk to; he / she is the person I talk about. Insight (I) ខ្ញុំដឹងថា you គឺអ្នកដែលខ្ញុំនិយាយជាមួយ ហើយ he / she គឺអ្នកដែលខ្ញុំនិយាយអំពី។ face a friend, then point aside 5 I can point to E e and copy it. Letter (R) ខ្ញុំអាចចង្អុល E e ហើយចម្លងវា។ air-write E", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §7 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.5-7-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "40bea74885", "text": "Criteria 1–4 are the four goals above in pupil words; criterion 5 is the letter. Draw the five cues on the board and point to them at the start and at the end.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §8 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-8-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "a343dabcab", "text": "RTTI rubric for the teacher", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §8 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-8-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "fa9039d2ed", "text": "RTTI categories: R Reproduction, T1 Training, T2 Transfer, I Insight. They are categories, not a ladder: a pupil can be strong in Transfer and weak in Reproduction. Pass rule (E7): at least 3 of the 4 Reproduction and Training checks, plus the letter. Transfer and Insight are watched; they do not block a pass.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §8 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-8-2", "kind": "table", "h": "135417481a", "text": "Criterion R – Reproduction T1 – Training T2 – Transfer I – Insight 1. I can point and say he is … for a boy and she is … for a girl. Look for: he is / she is + a real name. If not yet: he / she said with no name and no point. Say: \"You said it clearly.\" Next (E9): Tonight point to someone at home and say he is or she is and their name, once. Copy E e once if you have a slate. Needed to pass. (rated green) — — — 2. I can say I am , you are and then he is or she is . — Look for: three-person chain ( I , you , he/she ). If not yet: only choral he is Bora . Say: \"You answered by yourself.\" Next (E9): You can say he is / she is . Next time put it after I am and you are in one little group. Needed to pass. (rated green) — — 3. I can use he is / she is about a real classmate. — — Look for: works on a classmate outside the cast. If not yet: only the two twins. Say: \"You did it with someone new.\" Next (E9): Try the sentence about a friend who was not in the story. Watched, with help. (rated yellow) — 4. I know you is the person I talk to; he / she is the person I talk about. — — — Look for: child can show talk to vs talk about . If not yet: child thinks he is Bora's English name. Use two gestures: open hand to the listener ( you ), open hand toward a third child ( he / she ). Say: \"You showed me why.\" Next (E9): You is the person you look at and talk to. He and she are for the person you talk about. We will use that when we say please to someone. Watched, stretch goal. (rated red) 5. I can point to E e and copy it. (letter) Look for: Points to E e and copies it (air-write counts). If not yet: Points to the wrong card: say the name and sound again, air-write together. Say: \"You found E.\" Next (E9): \"Look for e in your name or on the board.\" Needed to pass. (rated green) — — —", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §9 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-9-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "ba0b563256", "text": "E2: Entry readiness", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §9 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-9-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b5e76965b5", "text": "Speaking, pointing, tracing.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §9 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-9-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §9 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-9-3", "kind": "list", "h": "099197c2b0", "text": "I am [name]. Good morning, teacher. Point to E e (letter card E e). Say E or short /e/.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §9 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.5-9-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §9 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.5-9-5", "kind": "list", "h": "112982ea08", "text": "You are [teacher or classmate name].", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §9 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.5-9-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "3a463ef261", "text": "Routing: 0 wrong = light E3. 1–2 wrong = full path. 3 wrong = S002 replay.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b2a0279bfc", "text": "E3: Core teaching conversation", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "62d0456903", "text": "On the mat. Kru Sopheak points. Default learner role: Sreyneang, then Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "630a431f86", "text": "Audio: recording he is / she is (to be recorded)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e1e3955b6", "text": "Kru Sopheak: I am Kru Sopheak.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "8b2c895baa", "text": "Bora: I am Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "523d57e406", "text": "Sreyneang: I am Sreyneang.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "0561687e60", "text": "Kru Sopheak: You are Bora. You are Sreyneang.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "288ecb5a71", "text": "Kru Sopheak: He is Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e450143f56", "text": "Sreyneang: He is Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶11", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-11", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "885f44db5e", "text": "Kru Sopheak: She is Sreyneang.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶12", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-12", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f11a8a468e", "text": "Bora: She is Sreyneang.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶13", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-13", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f1f5c16e58", "text": "Bora: She is Kru Sopheak.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶14", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-14", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶15", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-15", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efc287798e", "text": "Point to a real classmate who is not acting Bora or Sreyneang. Child: He is [name]. / She is [name].", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶16", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-16", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §10 ¶17", "anchor": "p-S.5-10-17", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "aed21b8ee9", "text": "When I talk to Bora, I say you . When I talk about Bora, I say he is Bora . Same person, different word, because the job of the word changed.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §11 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-11-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "d10e9904fa", "text": "E4: Going further", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §11 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-11-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §11 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-11-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "9ce5611b6b", "text": "Why this works Kru Sopheak says you are while looking at the child. She says he is / she is while the class looks at someone else. The eyes teach the pronoun.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §11 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-11-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §11 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.5-11-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c935c520ee", "text": "Watch out for", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §11 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.5-11-5", "kind": "list", "h": "b77c09f638", "text": "He is for every child because it came first in the chant. Slow down. Point. Shaming a child who uses the other form. Model the line again. This is Pre-A1, not a gender lesson. He is you mixed together. Separate to and about .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §11 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.5-11-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §11 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.5-11-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5f0b304c3d", "text": "Cultural context Khmer often uses the name or a kinship word instead of he / she . English asks for the pronoun. Keep the name in the sentence ( He is Bora ) so it still feels like talking about a person, not a grammar token.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §11 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.5-11-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "48136dddf5", "text": "Going further", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §11 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.5-11-9", "kind": "list", "h": "a375e03d7b", "text": "Can I say you about someone who is not here? Who is she if I turn and talk to Sreyneang?", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §12 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-12-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "f7c6b8a70c", "text": "Letters (MoEYS)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §12 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-12-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "4da8ec0c4e", "text": "Card: letter card E e", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §12 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-12-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "bc7de73a4d", "text": "Show E e . Name E . Short sound /e/. Point to the letter e in he / she / teacher (whole-word look). Do not force she to be pronounced with short /e/. Air-write, then copy E e .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §13 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-13-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "e2f0c8f8c9", "text": "E5: Teacher notes", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §13 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-13-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "69e059f56a", "text": "For the teacher.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §13 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-13-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "cf9c9d8fbd", "text": "Lesson intent Add third-person to be without dropping I / you . One new contrast is enough.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §13 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-13-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b230d097fd", "text": "RTTI guidance", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §13 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.5-13-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e61bf64c5f", "text": "Reproduction (R) — Strong: he is / she is + a real name. Weak: he / she said with no name and no point.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §13 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.5-13-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2b97744f69", "text": "Training (T1) — Strong: three-person chain ( I , you , he/she ). Weak: only choral he is Bora .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §13 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.5-13-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ac4d6ba937", "text": "Transfer (T2) — Strong: works on a classmate outside the cast. Weak: only the two twins.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §13 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.5-13-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a97fa3b8b9", "text": "Insight (I) — Strong: child can show talk to vs talk about . Weak: child thinks he is Bora's English name. Use two gestures: open hand to the listener ( you ), open hand toward a third child ( he / she ).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §13 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.5-13-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2161bc2a7a", "text": "Common errors", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §13 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.5-13-9", "kind": "list", "h": "3c48d4ab66", "text": "Khmer name-only answers. Add he is / she is in front, gently. She is teacher without Kru Sopheak — acceptable. Prefer She is Kru Sopheak once as a model.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §13 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.5-13-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "3d9614300b", "text": "Reach-ahead They are , it is — later. Plurals — week 10.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §13 ¶11", "anchor": "p-S.5-13-11", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "81623e8f27", "text": "Cultural notes If a child rejects he / she for themselves, use their name ( This is [name] ) and do not force a public correction. The class target remains the standard Starters forms.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §13 ¶12", "anchor": "p-S.5-13-12", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "1e01851c1c", "text": "Letters Today E e . Letter name E matches the vowel children hear in he / she . Short sound /e/ is the basic English literacy letter-sound. Show e in those words; do not respell she .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §14 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-14-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "49bdda0e0e", "text": "E6: Practice", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §14 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-14-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §14 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-14-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "08fc77997d", "text": "Groups of three. Child A to B: You are [B]. I am [A]. Both about C: He is [C] or She is [C]. Rotate.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §14 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-14-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §14 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.5-14-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ec9504b43b", "text": "You point to someone across the room. One child, sitting with you, says He is … / She is … about that person. New distance, same sentence.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §14 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.5-14-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §14 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.5-14-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "be033790da", "text": "Letters Air-write E e , then copy. Point to e in he / she / teacher .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §15 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-15-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "9e9a020100", "text": "E7: Exit check", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §15 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-15-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "0baff986e0", "text": "Eight spoken checks, two per category, plus one letter check. Pass on Reproduction and Training (at least 3 of those 4) and the letter check. Transfer and Insight are watched — they do not block a pass.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §15 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-15-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §15 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-15-3", "kind": "list", "h": "3152f29243", "text": "He is [boy's name] with a point. She is [girl's name] with a point.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §15 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.5-15-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §15 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.5-15-5", "kind": "list", "h": "66390a1a00", "text": "Uses I am and you are in the same trio. Adds he is or she is about the third child.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §15 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.5-15-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §15 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.5-15-7", "kind": "list", "h": "c89c6d40e8", "text": "Names a classmate who is not Bora or Sreyneang. Names you: She is / He is + teacher or your name.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §15 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.5-15-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §15 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.5-15-9", "kind": "list", "h": "a3524d441a", "text": "When talking to a child, chooses you , not he / she . Can show (gesture or Khmer) talk-to vs talk-about.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §15 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.5-15-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "8932e8c85a", "text": "Letters 9. Points to E e (letter card E e) and copies it (air-write counts).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §16 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-16-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "66ba33e460", "text": "E8: Formative evaluation and reformat", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §16 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-16-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c64f7ea515", "text": "[Name], you can talk about a friend, not only to a friend. Next we ask and thank.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §16 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-16-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2eccf29380", "text": "Reformat triggers — E3 only. Max two.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §16 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-16-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §16 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.5-16-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "726761f0ea", "text": "Reproduction weak: Only He is Bora and She is Sreyneang , pictures in hand.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §16 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.5-16-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §16 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.5-16-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "52808ff273", "text": "Training weak: You speak Kru Sopheak's lines. One child repeats the he is / she is lines only.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §16 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.5-16-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §16 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.5-16-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "3ee4c7d446", "text": "Transfer weak: Stay with the twins. No across-the-room point.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §16 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.5-16-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §16 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.5-16-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "4182b6cbc1", "text": "Insight weak: Two gestures only. No spoken contrast.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §17 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-17-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b170a2e736", "text": "E9: Feed forward", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §17 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-17-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §17 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-17-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6786ccccb9", "text": "Tonight point to someone at home and say he is or she is and their name, once. Copy E e once if you have a slate.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §17 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-17-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §17 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.5-17-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "24d7f98e5d", "text": "You can say he is / she is . Next time put it after I am and you are in one little group.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §17 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.5-17-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §17 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.5-17-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a71a1bead0", "text": "Try the sentence about a friend who was not in the story.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §17 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.5-17-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §17 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.5-17-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "47a2522d77", "text": "You is the person you look at and talk to. He and she are for the person you talk about. We will use that when we say please to someone.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §18 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-18-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "81640ecdaf", "text": "Teacher-led session (one study hour, 40 min)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §18 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-18-1", "kind": "table", "h": "27356fb17e", "text": "Step Minutes What happens E1 Theme and feed up 5 Show the picture, say the learning goal, point to the five cues. E2 Entry readiness 4 Quick check; route pupils as in E2. E3 Core conversation 10 Teacher in role; the class answers, then small groups. E4 Going further 4 Watch-out points and the cultural note. E6 Practice and letter 8 Role-play in pairs; air-write and copy the letter. E7 Exit check 6 Spoken checks with a sample of pupils; note the RTTI categories. E8–E9 Reformat and feed forward 3 Back to the five cues; one feed-forward message per pupil or group.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §18 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-18-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "30e5cd2054", "text": "E5 is for the teacher before the session.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §19 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-19-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "86b4ba2ff9", "text": "Story", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §19 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-19-1", "kind": "scene", "h": "da39a3ee5e", "text": "", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §20 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-20-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "e9029a8cd7", "text": "Self-paced app session", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §20 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-20-1", "kind": "list", "h": "988826365e", "text": "Listen: the classroom picture with the dialogue. Who is it?: a child in the picture lights up; the pupil records He is … or She is … . To or about: the app shows a child facing the pupil (say you are ) or a child further away (say he is / she is ). Letter card: tap E e (name and short /e/ sound); find e in he , she , teacher ; trace E e. Quiz: five questions.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §20 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-20-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "414f1f441f", "text": "The learner story above is the JSON scene player ( scenes/s005.json ); edit that file to change lines or timing without rebuilding Markdown.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §20 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-20-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6df6c9f3e3", "text": "The app shows the five cues at the start and the feed-forward message from E9 at the end.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §21 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-21-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "25c86f6a92", "text": "Quiz", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §21 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-21-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f331673cc7", "text": "Each question checks one success criterion in one RTTI category. After Check , the quiz shows the result per criterion and what to try next.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §21 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-21-2", "kind": "table", "h": "ff3916b9c3", "text": "Success criterion RTTI Question 1 Reproduction R 1 2 Training T1 2 3 Transfer T2 3 4 Insight I 4 5 Letter E e R 5", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §21 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.5-21-3", "kind": "quiz", "h": "a894efaca8", "text": "1. 👦 The teacher points to Bora. What do you say? Criterion 1 · RTTI level R He is Bora. Yes! Bora is a boy: he is. She is Bora. She is for a girl. Bora is a boy: He is Bora. I am Bora. You are not Bora. Talk about him: He is Bora. 2. Bora says \"I am Bora.\" Kru Sopheak says \"You are Bora.\" Now point to Sreyneang. Criterion 2 · RTTI level T1 He is Sreyneang. Sreyneang is a girl. Say: She is Sreyneang. You are Sreyneang. We talk about her, not to her: She is Sreyneang. She is Sreyneang. Yes! She is for the girl we talk about. 3. 👧 A new girl joins the class. Her name is Mealea. You tell the teacher. Criterion 3 · RTTI level T2 She is Mealea. Yes! You used she is about a new classmate. He is Mealea. Mealea is a girl. Say: She is Mealea. I am Mealea. You are not Mealea. Say: She is Mealea. 4. You talk TO Bora. Which word do you use for him? Criterion 4 · RTTI level I you Yes! When you talk to someone, say you. he He is for talking about Bora, not to him. she She is for a girl you talk about. Talk to Bora: you. 5. 🔤 Which card is the letter E e? Criterion 5 · RTTI level R F f That is F f. Find E e. E e Yes! E e, as in he and she. C c That is C c. Find E e. Check Try again", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §22 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.5-22-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b8efd777f4", "text": "CEFR cross-reference", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §22 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.5-22-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "9ace50ee5c", "text": "Secondary reference only. Pre-A1 can-do statements adapted from the CEFR Companion Volume (2020); not an official CEFR test.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.5 §22 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.5-22-2", "kind": "list", "h": "f2ceebc26d", "text": "I can say who a classmate is with he is / she is . I can recognise the letter E e.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}], "html": "<div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5a63cec63f\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §0 ¶0\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.5-0-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §0 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §0 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶0</button><h1 data-body=\"1\">Session S005: He is, she is</h1></div><div class=\"blk blk-figure fl-full\" data-h=\"da39a3ee5e\" data-kind=\"figure\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §0 ¶1\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.5-0-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §0 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §0 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶1</button><figure class=\"fig fig-full\" data-body=\"1\" data-marker=\"full\"><button aria-label=\"Enlarge image: Letter card E e\" class=\"img-zoom\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Letter card E e\" data-src=\"images/letter-e.svg\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"assets/images/images/letter-e.svg\"/></button></figure></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7f4635171d\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §0 ¶2\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.5-0-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §0 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §0 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Week 2 · Classroom · Bora, Sreyneang, Kru Sopheak.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"16241f8797\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §0 ¶3\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.5-0-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §0 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §0 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">Point to a classmate: <em>He is Bora.</em> <em>She is Sreyneang.</em> <em>She is Kru Sopheak.</em> New letter: <strong>E e</strong>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"025eec04ab\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §1 ¶0\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.5-1-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §1 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §1 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">MoEYS frame</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ac36d97d4a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §1 ¶1\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.5-1-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §1 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §1 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">This session serves the MoEYS frame in <a data-href=\"#p-L.0-1-2\" href=\"#p-L.0-1-2\">L.0 §1 ¶2</a>: core competency 4.2, the Listening and Speaking components plus one letter, and one 40-minute study hour.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2baba6e82b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §1 ¶2\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.5-1-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §1 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §1 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Session syllabus:</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ff19022b4a\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §1 ¶3\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.5-1-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §1 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §1 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶3</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Function</th>\n<th>Form</th>\n<th>Vocabulary</th>\n<th>Grammar</th>\n<th>Letter</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Naming a classmate you talk about</td>\n<td>He is Bora. – She is Sreyneang.</td>\n<td>no new words (teacher, hello, good morning, I, you: reinforce)</td>\n<td>to be: he is / she is (subject pronouns)</td>\n<td>E e</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5a49743b7a\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §2 ¶0\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.5-2-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §2 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §2 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Feed up (E1: theme introduction)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0c16a250b6\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §2 ¶1\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.5-2-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §2 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §2 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Kru Sopheak asks the class to look at a friend, not at themselves. <em>I</em> and <em>you</em> stay. <em>He</em> and <em>she</em> are for the person we talk <em>about</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"70c663ba0f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §2 ¶2\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.5-2-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §2 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §2 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Situational:</strong> naming a classmate who is not the speaker.\n<strong>Broad:</strong> subject pronouns with <em>to be</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"73beee730a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §2 ¶3\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.5-2-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §2 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §2 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">Scene: picture <em>three people in class</em> (to be drawn)</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7660a32c11\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §3 ¶0\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.5-3-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §3 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §3 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Words this session</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3a76ceb863\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §3 ¶1\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.5-3-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §3 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §3 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Word</th>\n<th>Role</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>teacher</td>\n<td>reinforce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hello</td>\n<td>reinforce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>good morning</td>\n<td>reinforce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>reinforce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>you</td>\n<td>reinforce</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a5f87036a0\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §3 ¶2\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.5-3-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §3 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §3 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">No new word list. The new work is <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"dd17342cb4\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §4 ¶0\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-S.5-4-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §4 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §4 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Grammar</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"434a738735\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §4 ¶1\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-S.5-4-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §4 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §4 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶1</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Primary:</strong> <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em></li>\n<li><strong>Reinforce:</strong> <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em></li>\n<li><strong>Reach-ahead:</strong> <em>they are</em>. Do not teach.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f7c6b8a70c\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §5 ¶0\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.5-5-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §5 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §5 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Letters (MoEYS)</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4da8ec0c4e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §5 ¶1\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.5-5-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §5 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §5 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Card: letter card E e</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"18c6a5113d\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §5 ¶2\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.5-5-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §5 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §5 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Letter</td>\n<td><strong>E e</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Name</td>\n<td><em>E</em> (the name sounds like the vowel in <em>he</em> / <em>she</em>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sound</td>\n<td>Short /e/ (letter sound). Do not pretend <em>she</em> is pronounced with short /e/.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Whole word</td>\n<td>Point to <em>e</em> in <em>he</em> / <em>she</em> / <em>teacher</em> (letters you can see).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write</td>\n<td>Air-write, then copy <em>E e</em>.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"da75f75ee9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §6 ¶0\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.5-6-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §6 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §6 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">By the end of this session you will be able to:</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §6 ¶1\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.5-6-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §6 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §6 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"77f976dc57\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §6 ¶2\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.5-6-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §6 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §6 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶2</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Point to a boy and say <em>he is [name]</em>. Point to a girl and say <em>she is [name]</em>. Point to <strong>E e</strong>.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §6 ¶3\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.5-6-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §6 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §6 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"205bb33f3e\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.5 §6 ¶4\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.5-6-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §6 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §6 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶4</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"2\">\n<li>After <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em>, add one <em>he is</em> or <em>she is</em> about a third person.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.5 §6 ¶5\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.5-6-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §6 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §6 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"350ecf72de\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.5 §6 ¶6\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.5-6-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §6 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §6 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶6</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"3\">\n<li>Use <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em> about a child who was not in the dialogue (a real classmate).</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.5 §6 ¶7\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.5-6-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §6 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §6 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"53793b3676\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.5 §6 ¶8\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.5-6-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §6 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §6 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶8</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"4\">\n<li><em>He</em> / <em>she</em> is the person we talk about. <em>You</em> is the person we talk to. They are not the same.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"52f7c040c5\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §7 ¶0\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.5-7-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §7 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §7 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Words with Khmer</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"458cb7ace3\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §7 ¶1\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.5-7-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §7 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §7 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Word</th>\n<th>Khmer</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>teacher</td>\n<td>គ្រូ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hello</td>\n<td>សួស្តី</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>good morning</td>\n<td>អរុណសួស្តី</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>you</td>\n<td>អ្នក</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d2f1f42938\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §7 ¶2\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.5-7-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §7 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §7 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Learning goal:</strong> Today we say he is and she is about a classmate.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"99059ba8c6\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §7 ¶3\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.5-7-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §7 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §7 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>In Khmer:</strong> ថ្ងៃនេះ យើងនិយាយ he is និង she is អំពីមិត្តរួមថ្នាក់។</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a72f01e61f\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.5 §7 ¶4\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.5-7-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §7 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §7 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶4</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>Success criterion (pupil words)</th>\n<th>RTTI</th>\n<th>Khmer (pupil words)</th>\n<th>Picture or gesture cue</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>I can point and say <em>he is …</em> for a boy and <em>she is …</em> for a girl.</td>\n<td>Reproduction (R)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចចង្អុល ហើយនិយាយ he is … សម្រាប់ក្មេងប្រុស និង she is … សម្រាប់ក្មេងស្រី។</td>\n<td>point</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>I can say <em>I am</em>, <em>you are</em> and then <em>he is</em> or <em>she is</em>.</td>\n<td>Training (T1)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ I am, you are ហើយបន្ទាប់មក he is ឬ she is។</td>\n<td>three fingers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>I can use <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em> about a real classmate.</td>\n<td>Transfer (T2)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចប្រើ he is / she is អំពីមិត្តរួមថ្នាក់ពិត។</td>\n<td>point to a classmate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>I know <em>you</em> is the person I talk to; <em>he</em> / <em>she</em> is the person I talk about.</td>\n<td>Insight (I)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំដឹងថា you គឺអ្នកដែលខ្ញុំនិយាយជាមួយ ហើយ he / she គឺអ្នកដែលខ្ញុំនិយាយអំពី។</td>\n<td>face a friend, then point aside</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>I can point to <strong>E e</strong> and copy it.</td>\n<td>Letter (R)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចចង្អុល E e ហើយចម្លងវា។</td>\n<td>air-write E</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"40bea74885\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.5 §7 ¶5\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.5-7-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §7 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §7 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\">Criteria 1–4 are the four goals above in pupil words; criterion 5 is the letter. Draw the five cues on the board and point to them at the start and at the end.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a343dabcab\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §8 ¶0\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.5-8-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §8 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §8 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">RTTI rubric for the teacher</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"fa9039d2ed\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §8 ¶1\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.5-8-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §8 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §8 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">RTTI categories: <strong>R</strong> Reproduction, <strong>T1</strong> Training, <strong>T2</strong> Transfer, <strong>I</strong> Insight. They are categories, not a ladder: a pupil can be strong in Transfer and weak in Reproduction. Pass rule (E7): at least 3 of the 4 Reproduction and Training checks, plus the letter. Transfer and Insight are watched; they do not block a pass.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"135417481a\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §8 ¶2\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.5-8-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §8 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §8 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Criterion</th>\n<th>R – Reproduction</th>\n<th>T1 – Training</th>\n<th>T2 – Transfer</th>\n<th>I – Insight</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1. I can point and say <em>he is …</em> for a boy and <em>she is …</em> for a girl.</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em> + a real name. <strong>If not yet:</strong> <em>he</em> / <em>she</em> said with no name and no point. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You said it clearly.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> Tonight point to someone at home and say <em>he is</em> or <em>she is</em> and their name, once. Copy <em>E e</em> once if you have a slate. <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. I can say <em>I am</em>, <em>you are</em> and then <em>he is</em> or <em>she is</em>.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> three-person chain (<em>I</em>, <em>you</em>, <em>he/she</em>). <strong>If not yet:</strong> only choral <em>he is Bora</em>. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You answered by yourself.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> You can say <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em>. Next time put it after <em>I am</em> and <em>you are</em> in one little group. <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. I can use <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em> about a real classmate.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-yellow\"><strong>Look for:</strong> works on a classmate outside the cast. <strong>If not yet:</strong> only the two twins. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You did it with someone new.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> Try the sentence about a friend who was not in the story. <em>Watched, with help.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"yellow\" title=\"Rated yellow\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated yellow)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. I know <em>you</em> is the person I talk to; <em>he</em> / <em>she</em> is the person I talk about.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-red\"><strong>Look for:</strong> child can show <em>talk to</em> vs <em>talk about</em>. <strong>If not yet:</strong> child thinks <em>he</em> is Bora's English name. Use two gestures: open hand to the listener (<em>you</em>), open hand toward a third child (<em>he</em> / <em>she</em>). <strong>Say:</strong> \"You showed me why.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> <em>You</em> is the person you look at and talk to. <em>He</em> and <em>she</em> are for the person you talk about. We will use that when we say <em>please</em> to someone. <em>Watched, stretch goal.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"red\" title=\"Rated red\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-xmark\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated red)</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. I can point to <strong>E e</strong> and copy it. (letter)</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> Points to <strong>E e</strong> and copies it (air-write counts). <strong>If not yet:</strong> Points to the wrong card: say the name and sound again, air-write together. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You found E.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> \"Look for e in your name or on the board.\" <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ba0b563256\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §9 ¶0\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.5-9-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §9 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §9 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E2: Entry readiness</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b5e76965b5\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §9 ¶1\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.5-9-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §9 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §9 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Speaking, pointing, tracing.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §9 ¶2\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.5-9-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §9 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §9 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"099197c2b0\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §9 ¶3\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.5-9-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §9 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §9 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶3</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li><em>I am [name].</em></li>\n<li><em>Good morning, teacher.</em></li>\n<li>Point to <strong>E e</strong> (letter card E e). Say <em>E</em> or short /e/.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.5 §9 ¶4\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.5-9-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §9 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §9 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"112982ea08\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.5 §9 ¶5\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.5-9-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §9 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §9 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶5</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"4\">\n<li><em>You are [teacher or classmate name].</em></li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3a463ef261\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.5 §9 ¶6\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.5-9-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §9 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §9 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Routing:</strong> 0 wrong = light E3. 1–2 wrong = full path. 3 wrong = S002 replay.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b2a0279bfc\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶0\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E3: Core teaching conversation</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"62d0456903\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶1\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>On the mat. Kru Sopheak points. Default learner role: Sreyneang, then Bora.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"630a431f86\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶2\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Audio: recording <em>he is / she is</em> (to be recorded)</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶3\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e1e3955b6\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶4\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Kru Sopheak:</strong> I am Kru Sopheak.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8b2c895baa\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶5\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> I am Bora.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"523d57e406\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶6\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Sreyneang:</strong> I am Sreyneang.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0561687e60\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶7\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Kru Sopheak:</strong> You are Bora. You are Sreyneang.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶8\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"288ecb5a71\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶9\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Kru Sopheak:</strong> He is Bora.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e450143f56\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶10\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Sreyneang:</strong> He is Bora.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"885f44db5e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"11\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶11\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-11\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶11\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶11 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶11</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Kru Sopheak:</strong> She is Sreyneang.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f11a8a468e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"12\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶12\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-12\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶12\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶12 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶12</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> She is Sreyneang.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f1f5c16e58\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"13\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶13\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-13\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶13\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶13 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶13</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> She is Kru Sopheak.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"14\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶14\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-14\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶14\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶14 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶14</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efc287798e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"15\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶15\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-15\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶15\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶15 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶15</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Point to a real classmate who is not acting Bora or Sreyneang.</em>\n<strong>Child:</strong> He is [name]. / She is [name].</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"16\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶16\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-16\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶16\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶16 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶16</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"aed21b8ee9\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"17\" data-ref=\"S.5 §10 ¶17\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.5-10-17\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §10 ¶17\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §10 ¶17 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶17</button><p data-body=\"1\">When I talk <em>to</em> Bora, I say <em>you</em>. When I talk <em>about</em> Bora, I say <em>he is Bora</em>. Same person, different word, because the job of the word changed.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d10e9904fa\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §11 ¶0\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.5-11-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §11 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §11 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E4: Going further</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §11 ¶1\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.5-11-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §11 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §11 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9ce5611b6b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §11 ¶2\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.5-11-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §11 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §11 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Why this works</strong>\nKru Sopheak says <em>you are</em> while looking at the child. She says <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em> while the class looks at someone else. The eyes teach the pronoun.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §11 ¶3\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.5-11-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §11 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §11 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c935c520ee\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.5 §11 ¶4\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.5-11-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §11 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §11 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Watch out for</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b77c09f638\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.5 §11 ¶5\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.5-11-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §11 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §11 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶5</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><em>He is</em> for every child because it came first in the chant. Slow down. Point.</li>\n<li>Shaming a child who uses the other form. Model the line again. This is Pre-A1, not a gender lesson.</li>\n<li><em>He is you</em> mixed together. Separate <em>to</em> and <em>about</em>.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.5 §11 ¶6\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.5-11-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §11 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §11 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5f0b304c3d\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.5 §11 ¶7\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.5-11-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §11 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §11 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Cultural context</strong>\nKhmer often uses the name or a kinship word instead of <em>he</em> / <em>she</em>. English asks for the pronoun. Keep the name in the sentence (<em>He is Bora</em>) so it still feels like talking about a person, not a grammar token.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"48136dddf5\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.5 §11 ¶8\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.5-11-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §11 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §11 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Going further</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a375e03d7b\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.5 §11 ¶9\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.5-11-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §11 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §11 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶9</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Can I say <em>you</em> about someone who is not here?</li>\n<li>Who is <em>she</em> if I turn and talk to Sreyneang?</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f7c6b8a70c\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §12 ¶0\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.5-12-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §12 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §12 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Letters (MoEYS)</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4da8ec0c4e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §12 ¶1\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.5-12-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §12 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §12 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Card: letter card E e</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"bc7de73a4d\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §12 ¶2\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.5-12-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §12 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §12 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Show <em>E e</em>. Name <em>E</em>. Short sound /e/. Point to the letter <em>e</em> in <em>he</em> / <em>she</em> / <em>teacher</em> (whole-word look). Do not force <em>she</em> to be pronounced with short /e/. Air-write, then copy <em>E e</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e2f0c8f8c9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §13 ¶0\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.5-13-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §13 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §13 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E5: Teacher notes</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"69e059f56a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §13 ¶1\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.5-13-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §13 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §13 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>For the teacher.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"cf9c9d8fbd\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §13 ¶2\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.5-13-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §13 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §13 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Lesson intent</strong>\nAdd third-person <em>to be</em> without dropping <em>I</em> / <em>you</em>. One new contrast is enough.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b230d097fd\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §13 ¶3\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.5-13-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §13 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §13 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>RTTI guidance</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e61bf64c5f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.5 §13 ¶4\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.5-13-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §13 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §13 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong> — Strong: <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em> + a real name. Weak: <em>he</em> / <em>she</em> said with no name and no point.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2b97744f69\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.5 §13 ¶5\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.5-13-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §13 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §13 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong> — Strong: three-person chain (<em>I</em>, <em>you</em>, <em>he/she</em>). Weak: only choral <em>he is Bora</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ac4d6ba937\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.5 §13 ¶6\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.5-13-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §13 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §13 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong> — Strong: works on a classmate outside the cast. Weak: only the two twins.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a97fa3b8b9\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.5 §13 ¶7\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.5-13-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §13 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §13 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong> — Strong: child can show <em>talk to</em> vs <em>talk about</em>. Weak: child thinks <em>he</em> is Bora's English name. Use two gestures: open hand to the listener (<em>you</em>), open hand toward a third child (<em>he</em> / <em>she</em>).</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2161bc2a7a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.5 §13 ¶8\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.5-13-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §13 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §13 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Common errors</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3c48d4ab66\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.5 §13 ¶9\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.5-13-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §13 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §13 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶9</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Khmer name-only answers. Add <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em> in front, gently.</li>\n<li><em>She is teacher</em> without <em>Kru Sopheak</em> — acceptable. Prefer <em>She is Kru Sopheak</em> once as a model.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3d9614300b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.5 §13 ¶10\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.5-13-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §13 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §13 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reach-ahead</strong>\n<em>They are</em>, <em>it is</em> — later. Plurals — week 10.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"81623e8f27\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"11\" data-ref=\"S.5 §13 ¶11\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.5-13-11\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §13 ¶11\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §13 ¶11 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶11</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Cultural notes</strong>\nIf a child rejects <em>he</em> / <em>she</em> for themselves, use their name (<em>This is [name]</em>) and do not force a public correction. The class target remains the standard Starters forms.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"1e01851c1c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"12\" data-ref=\"S.5 §13 ¶12\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.5-13-12\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §13 ¶12\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §13 ¶12 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶12</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\nToday <strong>E e</strong>. Letter name <em>E</em> matches the vowel children hear in <em>he</em> / <em>she</em>. Short sound /e/ is the basic English literacy letter-sound. Show <em>e</em> in those words; do not respell <em>she</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"49bdda0e0e\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §14 ¶0\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.5-14-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §14 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §14 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E6: Practice</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §14 ¶1\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.5-14-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §14 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §14 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"08fc77997d\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §14 ¶2\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.5-14-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §14 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §14 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Groups of three. Child A to B: <em>You are [B]. I am [A].</em> Both about C: <em>He is [C]</em> or <em>She is [C].</em> Rotate.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §14 ¶3\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.5-14-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §14 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §14 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ec9504b43b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.5 §14 ¶4\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.5-14-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §14 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §14 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\">You point to someone across the room. One child, sitting with you, says <em>He is …</em> / <em>She is …</em> about that person. New distance, same sentence.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.5 §14 ¶5\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.5-14-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §14 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §14 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"be033790da\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.5 §14 ¶6\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.5-14-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §14 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §14 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\nAir-write <strong>E e</strong>, then copy. Point to <em>e</em> in <em>he</em> / <em>she</em> / <em>teacher</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9e9a020100\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §15 ¶0\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.5-15-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §15 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §15 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E7: Exit check</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0baff986e0\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §15 ¶1\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.5-15-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §15 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §15 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Eight spoken checks, two per category, plus one letter check. Pass on Reproduction and Training (at least 3 of those 4) and the letter check. Transfer and Insight are watched — they do not block a pass.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §15 ¶2\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.5-15-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §15 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §15 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3152f29243\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §15 ¶3\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.5-15-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §15 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §15 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶3</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li><em>He is [boy's name]</em> with a point.</li>\n<li><em>She is [girl's name]</em> with a point.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.5 §15 ¶4\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.5-15-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §15 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §15 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"66390a1a00\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.5 §15 ¶5\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.5-15-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §15 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §15 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶5</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"3\">\n<li>Uses <em>I am</em> and <em>you are</em> in the same trio.</li>\n<li>Adds <em>he is</em> or <em>she is</em> about the third child.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.5 §15 ¶6\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.5-15-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §15 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §15 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c89c6d40e8\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.5 §15 ¶7\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.5-15-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §15 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §15 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶7</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"5\">\n<li>Names a classmate who is not Bora or Sreyneang.</li>\n<li>Names you: <em>She is</em> / <em>He is</em> + <em>teacher</em> or your name.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.5 §15 ¶8\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.5-15-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §15 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §15 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a3524d441a\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.5 §15 ¶9\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.5-15-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §15 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §15 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶9</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"7\">\n<li>When talking <em>to</em> a child, chooses <em>you</em>, not <em>he</em> / <em>she</em>.</li>\n<li>Can show (gesture or Khmer) talk-to vs talk-about.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8932e8c85a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.5 §15 ¶10\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.5-15-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §15 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §15 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\n9. Points to <strong>E e</strong> (letter card E e) and copies it (air-write counts).</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"66ba33e460\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §16 ¶0\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.5-16-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §16 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §16 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E8: Formative evaluation and reformat</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c64f7ea515\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §16 ¶1\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.5-16-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §16 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §16 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">[Name], you can talk about a friend, not only to a friend. Next we ask and thank.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2eccf29380\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §16 ¶2\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.5-16-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §16 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §16 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reformat triggers</strong> — E3 only. Max two.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §16 ¶3\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.5-16-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §16 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §16 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"726761f0ea\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.5 §16 ¶4\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.5-16-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §16 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §16 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction weak:</strong> Only <em>He is Bora</em> and <em>She is Sreyneang</em>, pictures in hand.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.5 §16 ¶5\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.5-16-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §16 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §16 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"52808ff273\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.5 §16 ¶6\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.5-16-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §16 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §16 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training weak:</strong> You speak Kru Sopheak's lines. One child repeats the <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em> lines only.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.5 §16 ¶7\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.5-16-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §16 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §16 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"3ee4c7d446\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.5 §16 ¶8\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.5-16-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §16 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §16 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer weak:</strong> Stay with the twins. No across-the-room point.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.5 §16 ¶9\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.5-16-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §16 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §16 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4182b6cbc1\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.5 §16 ¶10\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.5-16-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §16 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §16 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight weak:</strong> Two gestures only. No spoken contrast.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b170a2e736\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §17 ¶0\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.5-17-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §17 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §17 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E9: Feed forward</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §17 ¶1\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.5-17-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §17 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §17 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6786ccccb9\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §17 ¶2\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.5-17-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §17 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §17 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Tonight point to someone at home and say <em>he is</em> or <em>she is</em> and their name, once. Copy <em>E e</em> once if you have a slate.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §17 ¶3\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.5-17-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §17 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §17 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"24d7f98e5d\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.5 §17 ¶4\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.5-17-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §17 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §17 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\">You can say <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em>. Next time put it after <em>I am</em> and <em>you are</em> in one little group.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.5 §17 ¶5\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.5-17-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §17 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §17 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a71a1bead0\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.5 §17 ¶6\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.5-17-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §17 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §17 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\">Try the sentence about a friend who was not in the story.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.5 §17 ¶7\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.5-17-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §17 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §17 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"47a2522d77\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.5 §17 ¶8\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.5-17-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §17 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §17 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>You</em> is the person you look at and talk to. <em>He</em> and <em>she</em> are for the person you talk about. We will use that when we say <em>please</em> to someone.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"81640ecdaf\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §18 ¶0\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.5-18-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §18 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §18 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Teacher-led session (one study hour, 40 min)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"27356fb17e\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §18 ¶1\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.5-18-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §18 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §18 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Step</th>\n<th>Minutes</th>\n<th>What happens</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>E1 Theme and feed up</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Show the picture, say the learning goal, point to the five cues.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2 Entry readiness</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Quick check; route pupils as in E2.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E3 Core conversation</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>Teacher in role; the class answers, then small groups.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E4 Going further</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Watch-out points and the cultural note.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E6 Practice and letter</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Role-play in pairs; air-write and copy the letter.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E7 Exit check</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Spoken checks with a sample of pupils; note the RTTI categories.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E8–E9 Reformat and feed forward</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Back to the five cues; one feed-forward message per pupil or group.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"30e5cd2054\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §18 ¶2\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.5-18-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §18 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §18 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">E5 is for the teacher before the session.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"86b4ba2ff9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §19 ¶0\" data-sec=\"19\" id=\"p-S.5-19-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §19 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §19 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§19 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Story</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-scene\" data-h=\"da39a3ee5e\" data-kind=\"scene\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §19 ¶1\" data-sec=\"19\" id=\"p-S.5-19-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §19 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §19 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§19 ¶1</button><div class=\"tli-scene-player\" data-body=\"1\" data-scene=\"scenes/s005.json\"></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e9029a8cd7\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §20 ¶0\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.5-20-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §20 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §20 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Self-paced app session</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"988826365e\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §20 ¶1\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.5-20-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §20 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §20 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶1</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Listen:</strong> the classroom picture with the dialogue.</li>\n<li><strong>Who is it?:</strong> a child in the picture lights up; the pupil records <em>He is …</em> or <em>She is …</em>.</li>\n<li><strong>To or about:</strong> the app shows a child facing the pupil (say <em>you are</em>) or a child further away (say <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em>).</li>\n<li><strong>Letter card:</strong> tap <strong>E e</strong> (name and short /e/ sound); find e in <em>he</em>, <em>she</em>, <em>teacher</em>; trace E e.</li>\n<li><strong>Quiz:</strong> five questions.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"414f1f441f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §20 ¶2\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.5-20-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §20 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §20 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">The learner story above is the JSON scene player (<code>scenes/s005.json</code>); edit that file to change lines or timing without rebuilding Markdown.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6df6c9f3e3\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §20 ¶3\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.5-20-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §20 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §20 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">The app shows the five cues at the start and the feed-forward message from E9 at the end.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"25c86f6a92\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §21 ¶0\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.5-21-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §21 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §21 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Quiz</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f331673cc7\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §21 ¶1\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.5-21-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §21 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §21 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Each question checks one success criterion in one RTTI category. After <strong>Check</strong>, the quiz shows the result per criterion and what to try next.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ff3916b9c3\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §21 ¶2\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.5-21-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §21 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §21 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Success criterion</th>\n<th>RTTI</th>\n<th>Question</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1 Reproduction</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 Training</td>\n<td>T1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 Transfer</td>\n<td>T2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 Insight</td>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 Letter E e</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-quiz\" data-h=\"a894efaca8\" data-kind=\"quiz\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.5 §21 ¶3\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.5-21-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §21 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §21 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶3</button><div aria-label=\"Quiz\" class=\"quiz\" data-body=\"1\" role=\"group\"><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"R\" data-q=\"1\" data-sc=\"SC1\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">1.</span> 👦 The teacher points to Bora. What do you say?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 1 · RTTI level R</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">He is Bora.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Bora is a boy: he is.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">She is Bora.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">She is for a girl. Bora is a boy: He is Bora.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">I am Bora.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">You are not Bora. Talk about him: He is Bora.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"T1\" data-q=\"2\" data-sc=\"SC2\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">2.</span> Bora says \"I am Bora.\" Kru Sopheak says \"You are Bora.\" Now point to Sreyneang.</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 2 · RTTI level T1</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">He is Sreyneang.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Sreyneang is a girl. Say: She is Sreyneang.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">You are Sreyneang.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">We talk about her, not to her: She is Sreyneang.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">She is Sreyneang.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! She is for the girl we talk about.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"T2\" data-q=\"3\" data-sc=\"SC3\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">3.</span> 👧 A new girl joins the class. Her name is Mealea. You tell the teacher.</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 3 · RTTI level T2</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">She is Mealea.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! You used she is about a new classmate.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">He is Mealea.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Mealea is a girl. Say: She is Mealea.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">I am Mealea.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">You are not Mealea. Say: She is Mealea.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"I\" data-q=\"4\" data-sc=\"SC4\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">4.</span> You talk TO Bora. Which word do you use for him?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 4 · RTTI level I</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">you</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! When you talk to someone, say you.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">he</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">He is for talking about Bora, not to him.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">she</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">She is for a girl you talk about. Talk to Bora: you.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"R\" data-q=\"5\" data-sc=\"SC5\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">5.</span> 🔤 Which card is the letter E e?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 5 · RTTI level R</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">F f</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is F f. Find E e.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">E e</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! E e, as in he and she.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">C c</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is C c. Find E e.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><div class=\"quiz-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary quiz-check\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-check-double\"></i> Check</button><button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary quiz-retry\" hidden=\"\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate-left\"></i> Try again</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-score\" role=\"status\"></span></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-rtti\" hidden=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b8efd777f4\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.5 §22 ¶0\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.5-22-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §22 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §22 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">CEFR cross-reference</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9ace50ee5c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.5 §22 ¶1\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.5-22-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §22 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §22 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Secondary reference only. Pre-A1 can-do statements adapted from the CEFR Companion Volume (2020); not an official CEFR test.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f2ceebc26d\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.5 §22 ¶2\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.5-22-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.5 §22 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.5 §22 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶2</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>I can say who a classmate is with <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em>.</li>\n<li>I can recognise the letter E e.</li>\n</ul></div>"}, {"id": "S.6", "title": "Session S006: Please and thank you", "order": 6, "goals": ["Course plan outcome: Pupils ask with please and thank with thank you (Listening and Speaking), and recognise and copy the letter F f.", "Success criterion 1: I can say please and thank you.", "Success criterion 2: I can ask for the book with please and say thank you when I get it.", "Success criterion 3: I can use please and thank you with a classmate.", "Success criterion 4: I know please goes with asking and thank you goes with receiving.", "Success criterion 5: I can point to F f and copy it."], "metadata": {"status": "draft", "grade": "1", "week": "2", "session": "S006", "setting": "Classroom, sharing a book", "characters": "Bora, Sreyneang, Kru Sopheak", "subject": "Foreign Languages (English)", "moeys_reference": "see L.0 §1 (Curriculum Framework 2016)", "cefr_cross_reference": "Pre-A1 (adapted, CEFR Companion Volume)", "duration": "one study hour (40 min)", "updated": "2026-11-06 (v1.6.0)"}, "file": "s006-please-thank-you.md", "notes": ["<p>Khmer words and pupil sentences to be verified by a native speaker (Grade 1 level). Khmer spelling of the character names (Yeay យាយ, Kru គ្រូ, Bora បូរ៉ា, Sreyneang ស្រីណាង, Sopheak សុភ័ក្ត្រ, Chan ចាន់) also to be verified.</p>\n", "<p>The minute split is ours; the course plan gives the E1–E9 steps but no timings. With 30–50 pupils, E7 is done with a sample of pupils each session, so every pupil is checked across the week.</p>\n", "<p>CEFR Pre-A1 describes recognising letters but prescribes no order for the alphabet. The order (one letter per session, A a to F f in weeks 1–2) comes from the course plan.</p>\n"], "blocks": [{"ref": "S.6 §0 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-0-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "7e7b6ecb42", "text": "Session S006: Please and thank you", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §0 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-0-1", "kind": "figure", "h": "da39a3ee5e", "text": "", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §0 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-0-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a43f214ebb", "text": "Week 2 · Classroom, sharing a book · Bora, Sreyneang, Kru Sopheak.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §0 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-0-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "8fa1ed41e0", "text": "Bora asks for a book. Please when you ask. Thank you when you receive. New letter: F f .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §1 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-1-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "025eec04ab", "text": "MoEYS frame", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §1 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-1-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ac36d97d4a", "text": "This session serves the MoEYS frame in L.0 §1 ¶2 : core competency 4.2, the Listening and Speaking components plus one letter, and one 40-minute study hour.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §1 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-1-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2baba6e82b", "text": "Session syllabus:", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §1 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-1-3", "kind": "table", "h": "50984a76f1", "text": "Function Form Vocabulary Grammar Letter Asking politely and thanking A book, please. – Yes. – Thank you. please, thank you (teacher, hello, good morning: reinforce; book: recognize) none new; please / thank you are fixed phrases F f", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §2 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-2-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "5a49743b7a", "text": "Feed up (E1: theme introduction)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §2 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-2-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "209b87f48a", "text": "Kru Sopheak has a picture book. Bora wants it. He does not grab. He says please . When she gives it, he says thank you .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §2 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-2-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "508dd99174", "text": "Situational: asking for a classroom object. Broad: polite request and thanks.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §2 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-2-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "99518f9030", "text": "Scene: picture asking for a book (to be drawn)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §3 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-3-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "7660a32c11", "text": "Words this session", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §3 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-3-1", "kind": "table", "h": "ae2f2c1ece", "text": "Word Role please reproduce thank you reproduce teacher reinforce hello reinforce good morning reinforce", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §3 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-3-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "50214b27c3", "text": "Book is in the scene so the hand has a job. It is recognize only (classroom domain is week 20). Children may echo book . Do not test it.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §4 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-4-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "dd17342cb4", "text": "Grammar", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §4 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-4-1", "kind": "list", "h": "c2b7c6ff2d", "text": "Primary: none new. Please / thank you are formulaic. Reinforce: I am / you are / he is / she is in passing Reach-ahead: Can I have …? — week 22, recognize only even then. Use A book, please.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §5 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-5-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "f7c6b8a70c", "text": "Letters (MoEYS)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §5 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-5-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7077a01180", "text": "Card: letter card F f", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §5 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-5-2", "kind": "table", "h": "36a47eaa18", "text": "Letter F f Name F Sound /f/. No session word uses f — name, sound, and copy only. Do not add fish . Write Air-write, then copy F f .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §6 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-6-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "da75f75ee9", "text": "By the end of this session you will be able to:", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §6 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-6-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §6 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-6-2", "kind": "list", "h": "8e7acce762", "text": "Say please and thank you . Point to F f .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §6 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-6-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §6 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.6-6-4", "kind": "list", "h": "98b3ff5399", "text": "Ask for the book with please , take it, say thank you .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §6 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.6-6-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §6 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.6-6-6", "kind": "list", "h": "6d7016d053", "text": "Use please / thank you with a classmate, and (if you have time) about a cup or pencil at home with Yeay.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §6 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.6-6-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §6 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.6-6-8", "kind": "list", "h": "4c099a4316", "text": "Please goes with the ask. Thank you goes with the receive. They are a pair, like Khmer som and or kun .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §7 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-7-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "52f7c040c5", "text": "Words with Khmer", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §7 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-7-1", "kind": "table", "h": "8f2f074404", "text": "Word Khmer please សូម thank you អរគុណ teacher គ្រូ hello សួស្តី good morning អរុណសួស្តី", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §7 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-7-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "fd03c47779", "text": "Learning goal: Today we say please and thank you.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §7 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-7-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "0ad93d66e5", "text": "In Khmer: ថ្ងៃនេះ យើងនិយាយ please និង thank you។", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §7 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.6-7-4", "kind": "table", "h": "28887e6076", "text": "# Success criterion (pupil words) RTTI Khmer (pupil words) Picture or gesture cue 1 I can say please and thank you . Reproduction (R) ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ please និង thank you។ open hand, then hands together 2 I can ask for the book with please and say thank you when I get it. Training (T1) ខ្ញុំអាចសុំសៀវភៅដោយនិយាយ please ហើយនិយាយ thank you ពេលទទួលបាន។ book 3 I can use please and thank you with a classmate. Transfer (T2) ខ្ញុំអាចប្រើ please និង thank you ជាមួយមិត្តរួមថ្នាក់។ point to a classmate 4 I know please goes with asking and thank you goes with receiving. Insight (I) ខ្ញុំដឹងថា please សម្រាប់សុំ ហើយ thank you សម្រាប់ពេលទទួល។ open hand, closed hand 5 I can point to F f and copy it. Letter (R) ខ្ញុំអាចចង្អុល F f ហើយចម្លងវា។ air-write F", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §7 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.6-7-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "40bea74885", "text": "Criteria 1–4 are the four goals above in pupil words; criterion 5 is the letter. Draw the five cues on the board and point to them at the start and at the end.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §8 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-8-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "a343dabcab", "text": "RTTI rubric for the teacher", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §8 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-8-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "fa9039d2ed", "text": "RTTI categories: R Reproduction, T1 Training, T2 Transfer, I Insight. They are categories, not a ladder: a pupil can be strong in Transfer and weak in Reproduction. Pass rule (E7): at least 3 of the 4 Reproduction and Training checks, plus the letter. Transfer and Insight are watched; they do not block a pass.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §8 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-8-2", "kind": "table", "h": "38991b640d", "text": "Criterion R – Reproduction T1 – Training T2 – Transfer I – Insight 1. I can say please and thank you . Look for: both words, on request, not mixed. If not yet: only thank you (more common from home English videos). Say: \"You said it clearly.\" Next (E9): Say please once and thank you once today — at snack or at the door. Air-write F once. Needed to pass. (rated green) — — — 2. I can ask for the book with please and say thank you when I get it. — Look for: ask → wait → receive → thank. If not yet: words without the wait. Say: \"You answered by yourself.\" Next (E9): You know the two words. Next time wait for Yes , then thank you . Needed to pass. (rated green) — — 3. I can use please and thank you with a classmate. — — Look for: classmate, or a home object named in Khmer. If not yet: only works with you and the story book. Say: \"You did it with someone new.\" Next (E9): Try please with a friend, or thank you with Yeay at home. Watched, with help. (rated yellow) — 4. I know please goes with asking and thank you goes with receiving. — — — Look for: child can point to the ask moment vs the receive moment. If not yet: child thinks both words mean \"be good.\" Keep the two times separate. Say: \"You showed me why.\" Next (E9): Please is the ask. Thank you is after you receive. The two times are different. Watched, stretch goal. (rated red) 5. I can point to F f and copy it. (letter) Look for: Points to F f and copies it (air-write counts). If not yet: Points to the wrong card: say the name and sound again, air-write together. Say: \"You found F.\" Next (E9): \"Look for f in your name or on the board.\" Needed to pass. (rated green) — — —", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §9 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-9-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "ba0b563256", "text": "E2: Entry readiness", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §9 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-9-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b5e76965b5", "text": "Speaking, pointing, tracing.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §9 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-9-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §9 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-9-3", "kind": "list", "h": "f74e717a91", "text": "Say good morning, teacher . Point to a classmate and say he is [name] or she is [name] . Point to F f (letter card F f). Say F or /f/.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §9 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.6-9-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §9 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.6-9-5", "kind": "list", "h": "2669d21f09", "text": "Greet that classmate with hello or good morning plus their name.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §9 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.6-9-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "587e990655", "text": "Routing: 0 wrong = light E3. 1–2 wrong = full path. 3 wrong = S004 door practice, then return.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b2a0279bfc", "text": "E3: Core teaching conversation", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2fdb2dd7ea", "text": "Kru Sopheak holds a picture book. Default learner role: Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "4e16f1e21e", "text": "Audio: recording please and thank you (to be recorded)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "bc484c8eab", "text": "Listen first. Echo the two new words when you replay.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "ba33876e69", "text": "Bora: Hello, teacher.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b92bfbc3ec", "text": "Kru Sopheak: Hello, Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "dbc4e7f942", "text": "Bora: A book, please.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "cbd9e2c598", "text": "Kru Sopheak: Yes.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "79be06a1f9", "text": "Bora: Thank you.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶11", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-11", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a90ad05243", "text": "Sreyneang: A book, please.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶12", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-12", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b58bb07e2c", "text": "Bora: Yes.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶13", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-13", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "edd6cc1595", "text": "Sreyneang: Thank you.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶14", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-14", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a783038e38", "text": "Kru Sopheak: She is Sreyneang. He is Bora.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶15", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-15", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶16", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-16", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "a570d9a36f", "text": "Give a real book or pencil to a classmate, not to you.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶17", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-17", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b4cd6177be", "text": "Child A: A book, please.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶18", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-18", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "94a73d542b", "text": "Child B: Yes.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶19", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-19", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c6f1bd0019", "text": "Child A: Thank you.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶20", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-20", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §10 ¶21", "anchor": "p-S.6-10-21", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "4b2d8c8fa3", "text": "Please is for the ask. Thank you is for the receive. If you only say one, the pair is not finished.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §11 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-11-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "d10e9904fa", "text": "E4: Going further", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §11 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-11-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §11 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-11-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7b64841cad", "text": "Why this works Bora does not take the book. He asks. Kru Sopheak answers Yes and gives it. Thank you closes the exchange. Sreyneang then asks Bora — the same pair works child to child.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §11 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-11-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §11 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.6-11-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c935c520ee", "text": "Watch out for", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §11 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.6-11-5", "kind": "list", "h": "5693a0a67a", "text": "Please thank you as one shout. Split: ask first, thank after the object moves. Grabbing while saying please . The word is not a magic pass. Wait for Yes . Can I have copied from a parent. Smile. Stay on A book, please.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §11 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.6-11-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §11 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.6-11-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "83fe7b77ee", "text": "Cultural context Khmer som and or kun already teach this pair. English is mapping onto a habit many children have at home. Two hands when giving and receiving still belong here.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §11 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.6-11-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "48136dddf5", "text": "Going further", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §11 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.6-11-9", "kind": "list", "h": "900c798139", "text": "When do you say please at home? What do you say after Yeay gives you water?", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §12 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-12-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "f7c6b8a70c", "text": "Letters (MoEYS)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §12 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-12-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7077a01180", "text": "Card: letter card F f", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §12 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-12-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b9550c49b0", "text": "Show F f . Name F , sound /f/. No session word — skip the hunt. Air-write, then copy F f . Do not add fish .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §13 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-13-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "e2f0c8f8c9", "text": "E5: Teacher notes", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §13 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-13-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "69e059f56a", "text": "For the teacher.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §13 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-13-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c4fd7234c4", "text": "Lesson intent Close weeks 1–2 with a useful pair that will return in the classroom block. Greetings stay warm; please / thank you add care when something changes hands.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §13 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-13-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "b230d097fd", "text": "RTTI guidance", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §13 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.6-13-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "26eaaf8f4e", "text": "Reproduction (R) — Strong: both words, on request, not mixed. Weak: only thank you (more common from home English videos).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §13 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.6-13-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6dce6ccd2d", "text": "Training (T1) — Strong: ask → wait → receive → thank. Weak: words without the wait.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §13 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.6-13-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7d47dd423c", "text": "Transfer (T2) — Strong: classmate, or a home object named in Khmer. Weak: only works with you and the story book.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §13 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.6-13-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "10fbd1e5a3", "text": "Insight (I) — Strong: child can point to the ask moment vs the receive moment. Weak: child thinks both words mean \"be good.\" Keep the two times separate.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §13 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.6-13-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2161bc2a7a", "text": "Common errors", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §13 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.6-13-9", "kind": "list", "h": "c218202299", "text": "Thank you please after grabbing. Reset the object. Ask again. Very quiet please that the classmate cannot hear. Ask for one clearer try, not a louder performance. Using he is / she is as a greeting. Those stay for naming, not for asking.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §13 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.6-13-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "1e3e42e9f4", "text": "Reach-ahead Can I have …? — week 22. Classroom object names as reproduce — week 20.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §13 ¶11", "anchor": "p-S.6-13-11", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "c6d1c4454c", "text": "Cultural notes A child who sampeahs instead of saying thank you has the value. Add the English word beside the gesture. Do not replace the gesture.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §13 ¶12", "anchor": "p-S.6-13-12", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7365e62f3b", "text": "Letters Today F f . Name, /f/, copy. No session word. Do not add fish .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §14 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-14-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "49bdda0e0e", "text": "E6: Practice", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §14 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-14-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §14 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-14-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "e99706e0a6", "text": "You hold one book. Each child: A book, please. You: Yes. Child: Thank you. Child holds it for a breath, then gives it back when you say please .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §14 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-14-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §14 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.6-14-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "aa938b7233", "text": "Pairs with a pencil or leaf. Same three lines. Then, if you want a home bridge: Water, please to you as Yeay.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §14 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.6-14-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §14 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.6-14-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "140b965ca3", "text": "Letters Air-write F f , then copy. No extra word.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §15 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-15-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "9e9a020100", "text": "E7: Exit check", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §15 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-15-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "0baff986e0", "text": "Eight spoken checks, two per category, plus one letter check. Pass on Reproduction and Training (at least 3 of those 4) and the letter check. Transfer and Insight are watched — they do not block a pass.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §15 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-15-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §15 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-15-3", "kind": "list", "h": "e9c63a6d50", "text": "Says please . Says thank you .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §15 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.6-15-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §15 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.6-15-5", "kind": "list", "h": "f29927c461", "text": "Asks with please before the object moves. Says thank you after receiving, not before.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §15 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.6-15-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §15 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.6-15-7", "kind": "list", "h": "7f9e2bbfeb", "text": "Uses the pair with a classmate. Uses please or thank you in a new micro-scene (pencil, water, or door).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §15 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.6-15-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §15 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.6-15-9", "kind": "list", "h": "8895b41a48", "text": "Points to the ask when you say please . Points to the receive when you say thank you — or says in Khmer that one is for asking and one is for after.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §15 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.6-15-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "63ac59ba4f", "text": "Letters 9. Points to F f (letter card F f) and copies it (air-write counts).", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §16 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-16-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "66ba33e460", "text": "E8: Formative evaluation and reformat", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §16 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-16-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "82a85f5845", "text": "[Name], you can ask and you can thank. That pair will come back when we name classroom things.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §16 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-16-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "2eccf29380", "text": "Reformat triggers — E3 only. Max two.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §16 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-16-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §16 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.6-16-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6b898156a4", "text": "Reproduction weak: Only please and thank you with you, no book name.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §16 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.6-16-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §16 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.6-16-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "078160a14e", "text": "Training weak: You keep the book. One child, three lines, twice.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §16 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.6-16-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §16 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.6-16-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "717406642e", "text": "Transfer weak: Stay with you. Skip the classmate pass.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §16 ¶9", "anchor": "p-S.6-16-9", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §16 ¶10", "anchor": "p-S.6-16-10", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "9e2db53e0c", "text": "Insight weak: Two pictures or two hands: ask / receive. No spoken rule.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §17 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-17-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b170a2e736", "text": "E9: Feed forward", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §17 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-17-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6761c7d122", "text": "Reproduction (R)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §17 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-17-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "8aa8c54e39", "text": "Say please once and thank you once today — at snack or at the door. Air-write F once.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §17 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-17-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "5e305d463f", "text": "Training (T1)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §17 ¶4", "anchor": "p-S.6-17-4", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "be9a215448", "text": "You know the two words. Next time wait for Yes , then thank you .", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §17 ¶5", "anchor": "p-S.6-17-5", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "7222f0d48e", "text": "Transfer (T2)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §17 ¶6", "anchor": "p-S.6-17-6", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "9bb07d28e1", "text": "Try please with a friend, or thank you with Yeay at home.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §17 ¶7", "anchor": "p-S.6-17-7", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "efd1b9353c", "text": "Insight (I)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §17 ¶8", "anchor": "p-S.6-17-8", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "46269b224e", "text": "Please is the ask. Thank you is after you receive. The two times are different.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §18 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-18-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "81640ecdaf", "text": "Teacher-led session (one study hour, 40 min)", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §18 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-18-1", "kind": "table", "h": "27356fb17e", "text": "Step Minutes What happens E1 Theme and feed up 5 Show the picture, say the learning goal, point to the five cues. E2 Entry readiness 4 Quick check; route pupils as in E2. E3 Core conversation 10 Teacher in role; the class answers, then small groups. E4 Going further 4 Watch-out points and the cultural note. E6 Practice and letter 8 Role-play in pairs; air-write and copy the letter. E7 Exit check 6 Spoken checks with a sample of pupils; note the RTTI categories. E8–E9 Reformat and feed forward 3 Back to the five cues; one feed-forward message per pupil or group.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §18 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-18-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "30e5cd2054", "text": "E5 is for the teacher before the session.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §19 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-19-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "86b4ba2ff9", "text": "Story", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §19 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-19-1", "kind": "scene", "h": "da39a3ee5e", "text": "", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §20 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-20-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "e9029a8cd7", "text": "Self-paced app session", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §20 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-20-1", "kind": "list", "h": "bfd1b262df", "text": "Listen: the classroom picture with the dialogue; tap a person to hear the line again. Ask and thank: the app holds out a book or a pencil; the pupil records A book, please. and then Thank you. when it is given. Right order: drag please to the asking picture and thank you to the receiving picture. Letter card: tap F f (name and sound /f/); trace F f. No extra word. Quiz: five questions.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §20 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-20-2", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f3d39f2141", "text": "The learner story above is the JSON scene player ( scenes/s006.json ); edit that file to change lines or timing without rebuilding Markdown.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §20 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-20-3", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "6df6c9f3e3", "text": "The app shows the five cues at the start and the feed-forward message from E9 at the end.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §21 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-21-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "25c86f6a92", "text": "Quiz", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §21 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-21-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "f331673cc7", "text": "Each question checks one success criterion in one RTTI category. After Check , the quiz shows the result per criterion and what to try next.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §21 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-21-2", "kind": "table", "h": "411bcf40d8", "text": "Success criterion RTTI Question 1 Reproduction R 1 2 Training T1 2 3 Transfer T2 3 4 Insight I 4 5 Letter F f R 5", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §21 ¶3", "anchor": "p-S.6-21-3", "kind": "quiz", "h": "9d2e9e2928", "text": "1. 📖 Bora wants the book. What does he say? Criterion 1 · RTTI level R A book, thank you. Thank you comes after you get it. To ask, say: A book, please. A book, please. Yes! Please goes with the ask. Good morning, book. We greet people, not books. Say: A book, please. 2. Kru Sopheak gives Bora the book. What does Bora say now? Criterion 2 · RTTI level T1 Thank you, teacher. Yes! Thank you when you receive. Please, teacher. Please was for asking. Now say: Thank you. Hello, teacher. You are already talking. Now say: Thank you. 3. ✏️ Your classmate has a pencil. You need it. What do you say? Criterion 3 · RTTI level T2 Pencil! That is a grab with words. Add please: A pencil, please. A pencil, please. Yes! Same pair, new thing. Thank you, pencil. Ask first: A pencil, please. Thank you comes after. 4. Sreyneang says \"A book, please.\" She gets the book. What is missing? Criterion 4 · RTTI level I nothing at all The pair is not finished. She still needs thank you. hello and goodbye They are already talking. The missing word is thank you. the words thank you Yes! Please and thank you are a pair. 5. 🔤 Which card is the letter F f? Criterion 5 · RTTI level R E e That is E e. Find F f. D d That is D d. Find F f. F f Yes! F f. The sound is /f/. Check Try again", "modes": ["designer", "teacher", "student"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §22 ¶0", "anchor": "p-S.6-22-0", "kind": "heading", "h": "b8efd777f4", "text": "CEFR cross-reference", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §22 ¶1", "anchor": "p-S.6-22-1", "kind": "paragraph", "h": "9ace50ee5c", "text": "Secondary reference only. Pre-A1 can-do statements adapted from the CEFR Companion Volume (2020); not an official CEFR test.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}, {"ref": "S.6 §22 ¶2", "anchor": "p-S.6-22-2", "kind": "list", "h": "ae9172b938", "text": "I can ask for something with please and say thank you . I can recognise the letter F f.", "modes": ["designer", "teacher"]}], "html": "<div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7e7b6ecb42\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §0 ¶0\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.6-0-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §0 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §0 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶0</button><h1 data-body=\"1\">Session S006: Please and thank you</h1></div><div class=\"blk blk-figure fl-full\" data-h=\"da39a3ee5e\" data-kind=\"figure\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §0 ¶1\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.6-0-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §0 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §0 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶1</button><figure class=\"fig fig-full\" data-body=\"1\" data-marker=\"full\"><button aria-label=\"Enlarge image: Letter card F f\" class=\"img-zoom\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Letter card F f\" data-src=\"images/letter-f.svg\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"assets/images/images/letter-f.svg\"/></button></figure></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a43f214ebb\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §0 ¶2\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.6-0-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §0 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §0 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Week 2 · Classroom, sharing a book · Bora, Sreyneang, Kru Sopheak.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8fa1ed41e0\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §0 ¶3\" data-sec=\"0\" id=\"p-S.6-0-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §0 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §0 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§0 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">Bora asks for a book. <em>Please</em> when you ask. <em>Thank you</em> when you receive. New letter: <strong>F f</strong>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"025eec04ab\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §1 ¶0\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.6-1-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §1 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §1 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">MoEYS frame</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ac36d97d4a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §1 ¶1\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.6-1-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §1 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §1 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">This session serves the MoEYS frame in <a data-href=\"#p-L.0-1-2\" href=\"#p-L.0-1-2\">L.0 §1 ¶2</a>: core competency 4.2, the Listening and Speaking components plus one letter, and one 40-minute study hour.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2baba6e82b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §1 ¶2\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.6-1-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §1 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §1 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Session syllabus:</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"50984a76f1\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §1 ¶3\" data-sec=\"1\" id=\"p-S.6-1-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §1 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §1 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§1 ¶3</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Function</th>\n<th>Form</th>\n<th>Vocabulary</th>\n<th>Grammar</th>\n<th>Letter</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Asking politely and thanking</td>\n<td>A book, please. – Yes. – Thank you.</td>\n<td>please, thank you (teacher, hello, good morning: reinforce; book: recognize)</td>\n<td>none new; please / thank you are fixed phrases</td>\n<td>F f</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5a49743b7a\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §2 ¶0\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.6-2-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §2 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §2 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Feed up (E1: theme introduction)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"209b87f48a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §2 ¶1\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.6-2-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §2 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §2 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Kru Sopheak has a picture book. Bora wants it. He does not grab. He says <em>please</em>. When she gives it, he says <em>thank you</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"508dd99174\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §2 ¶2\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.6-2-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §2 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §2 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Situational:</strong> asking for a classroom object.\n<strong>Broad:</strong> polite request and thanks.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"99518f9030\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §2 ¶3\" data-sec=\"2\" id=\"p-S.6-2-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §2 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §2 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§2 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">Scene: picture <em>asking for a book</em> (to be drawn)</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7660a32c11\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §3 ¶0\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.6-3-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §3 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §3 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Words this session</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ae2f2c1ece\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §3 ¶1\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.6-3-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §3 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §3 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Word</th>\n<th>Role</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>please</td>\n<td>reproduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>thank you</td>\n<td>reproduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>teacher</td>\n<td>reinforce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hello</td>\n<td>reinforce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>good morning</td>\n<td>reinforce</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"50214b27c3\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §3 ¶2\" data-sec=\"3\" id=\"p-S.6-3-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §3 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §3 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§3 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Book</em> is in the scene so the hand has a job. It is <strong>recognize</strong> only (classroom domain is week 20). Children may echo <em>book</em>. Do not test it.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"dd17342cb4\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §4 ¶0\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-S.6-4-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §4 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §4 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Grammar</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c2b7c6ff2d\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §4 ¶1\" data-sec=\"4\" id=\"p-S.6-4-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §4 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §4 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§4 ¶1</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Primary:</strong> none new. <em>Please</em> / <em>thank you</em> are formulaic.</li>\n<li><strong>Reinforce:</strong> <em>I am</em> / <em>you are</em> / <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em> in passing</li>\n<li><strong>Reach-ahead:</strong> <em>Can I have …?</em> — week 22, recognize only even then. Use <em>A book, please.</em></li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f7c6b8a70c\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §5 ¶0\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.6-5-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §5 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §5 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Letters (MoEYS)</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7077a01180\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §5 ¶1\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.6-5-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §5 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §5 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Card: letter card F f</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"36a47eaa18\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §5 ¶2\" data-sec=\"5\" id=\"p-S.6-5-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §5 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §5 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§5 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Letter</td>\n<td><strong>F f</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Name</td>\n<td><em>F</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sound</td>\n<td>/f/. No session word uses <em>f</em> — name, sound, and copy only. Do not add <em>fish</em>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write</td>\n<td>Air-write, then copy <em>F f</em>.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"da75f75ee9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §6 ¶0\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.6-6-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §6 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §6 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">By the end of this session you will be able to:</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §6 ¶1\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.6-6-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §6 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §6 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8e7acce762\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §6 ¶2\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.6-6-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §6 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §6 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶2</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Say <em>please</em> and <em>thank you</em>. Point to <strong>F f</strong>.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §6 ¶3\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.6-6-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §6 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §6 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"98b3ff5399\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.6 §6 ¶4\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.6-6-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §6 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §6 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶4</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"2\">\n<li>Ask for the book with <em>please</em>, take it, say <em>thank you</em>.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.6 §6 ¶5\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.6-6-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §6 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §6 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6d7016d053\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.6 §6 ¶6\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.6-6-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §6 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §6 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶6</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"3\">\n<li>Use <em>please</em> / <em>thank you</em> with a classmate, and (if you have time) about a cup or pencil at home with Yeay.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.6 §6 ¶7\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.6-6-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §6 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §6 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4c099a4316\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.6 §6 ¶8\" data-sec=\"6\" id=\"p-S.6-6-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §6 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §6 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§6 ¶8</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"4\">\n<li><em>Please</em> goes with the ask. <em>Thank you</em> goes with the receive. They are a pair, like Khmer <em>som</em> and <em>or kun</em>.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"52f7c040c5\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §7 ¶0\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.6-7-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §7 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §7 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Words with Khmer</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8f2f074404\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §7 ¶1\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.6-7-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §7 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §7 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Word</th>\n<th>Khmer</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>please</td>\n<td>សូម</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>thank you</td>\n<td>អរគុណ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>teacher</td>\n<td>គ្រូ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hello</td>\n<td>សួស្តី</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>good morning</td>\n<td>អរុណសួស្តី</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"fd03c47779\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §7 ¶2\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.6-7-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §7 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §7 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Learning goal:</strong> Today we say please and thank you.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0ad93d66e5\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §7 ¶3\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.6-7-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §7 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §7 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>In Khmer:</strong> ថ្ងៃនេះ យើងនិយាយ please និង thank you។</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"28887e6076\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.6 §7 ¶4\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.6-7-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §7 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §7 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶4</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>Success criterion (pupil words)</th>\n<th>RTTI</th>\n<th>Khmer (pupil words)</th>\n<th>Picture or gesture cue</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>I can say <em>please</em> and <em>thank you</em>.</td>\n<td>Reproduction (R)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចនិយាយ please និង thank you។</td>\n<td>open hand, then hands together</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>I can ask for the book with <em>please</em> and say <em>thank you</em> when I get it.</td>\n<td>Training (T1)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចសុំសៀវភៅដោយនិយាយ please ហើយនិយាយ thank you ពេលទទួលបាន។</td>\n<td>book</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>I can use <em>please</em> and <em>thank you</em> with a classmate.</td>\n<td>Transfer (T2)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចប្រើ please និង thank you ជាមួយមិត្តរួមថ្នាក់។</td>\n<td>point to a classmate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>I know <em>please</em> goes with asking and <em>thank you</em> goes with receiving.</td>\n<td>Insight (I)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំដឹងថា please សម្រាប់សុំ ហើយ thank you សម្រាប់ពេលទទួល។</td>\n<td>open hand, closed hand</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>I can point to <strong>F f</strong> and copy it.</td>\n<td>Letter (R)</td>\n<td>ខ្ញុំអាចចង្អុល F f ហើយចម្លងវា។</td>\n<td>air-write F</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"40bea74885\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.6 §7 ¶5\" data-sec=\"7\" id=\"p-S.6-7-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §7 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §7 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§7 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\">Criteria 1–4 are the four goals above in pupil words; criterion 5 is the letter. Draw the five cues on the board and point to them at the start and at the end.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a343dabcab\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §8 ¶0\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.6-8-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §8 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §8 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">RTTI rubric for the teacher</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"fa9039d2ed\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §8 ¶1\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.6-8-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §8 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §8 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">RTTI categories: <strong>R</strong> Reproduction, <strong>T1</strong> Training, <strong>T2</strong> Transfer, <strong>I</strong> Insight. They are categories, not a ladder: a pupil can be strong in Transfer and weak in Reproduction. Pass rule (E7): at least 3 of the 4 Reproduction and Training checks, plus the letter. Transfer and Insight are watched; they do not block a pass.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"38991b640d\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §8 ¶2\" data-sec=\"8\" id=\"p-S.6-8-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §8 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §8 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§8 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Criterion</th>\n<th>R – Reproduction</th>\n<th>T1 – Training</th>\n<th>T2 – Transfer</th>\n<th>I – Insight</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1. I can say <em>please</em> and <em>thank you</em>.</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> both words, on request, not mixed. <strong>If not yet:</strong> only <em>thank you</em> (more common from home English videos). <strong>Say:</strong> \"You said it clearly.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> Say <em>please</em> once and <em>thank you</em> once today — at snack or at the door. Air-write <em>F</em> once. <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. I can ask for the book with <em>please</em> and say <em>thank you</em> when I get it.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> ask → wait → receive → thank. <strong>If not yet:</strong> words without the wait. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You answered by yourself.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> You know the two words. Next time wait for <em>Yes</em>, then <em>thank you</em>. <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. I can use <em>please</em> and <em>thank you</em> with a classmate.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-yellow\"><strong>Look for:</strong> classmate, or a home object named in Khmer. <strong>If not yet:</strong> only works with you and the story book. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You did it with someone new.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> Try <em>please</em> with a friend, or <em>thank you</em> with Yeay at home. <em>Watched, with help.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"yellow\" title=\"Rated yellow\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated yellow)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. I know <em>please</em> goes with asking and <em>thank you</em> goes with receiving.</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td class=\"cell-red\"><strong>Look for:</strong> child can point to the ask moment vs the receive moment. <strong>If not yet:</strong> child thinks both words mean \"be good.\" Keep the two times separate. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You showed me why.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> <em>Please</em> is the ask. <em>Thank you</em> is after you receive. The two times are different. <em>Watched, stretch goal.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"red\" title=\"Rated red\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-xmark\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated red)</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. I can point to <strong>F f</strong> and copy it. (letter)</td>\n<td class=\"cell-green\"><strong>Look for:</strong> Points to <strong>F f</strong> and copies it (air-write counts). <strong>If not yet:</strong> Points to the wrong card: say the name and sound again, air-write together. <strong>Say:</strong> \"You found F.\" <strong>Next (E9):</strong> \"Look for f in your name or on the board.\" <em>Needed to pass.</em><span class=\"cell-tag\" data-tag=\"green\" title=\"Rated green\"> <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i><span class=\"visually-hidden\"> (rated green)</span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ba0b563256\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §9 ¶0\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.6-9-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §9 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §9 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E2: Entry readiness</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b5e76965b5\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §9 ¶1\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.6-9-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §9 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §9 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Speaking, pointing, tracing.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §9 ¶2\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.6-9-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §9 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §9 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f74e717a91\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §9 ¶3\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.6-9-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §9 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §9 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶3</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Say <em>good morning, teacher</em>.</li>\n<li>Point to a classmate and say <em>he is [name]</em> or <em>she is [name]</em>.</li>\n<li>Point to <strong>F f</strong> (letter card F f). Say <em>F</em> or /f/.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.6 §9 ¶4\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.6-9-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §9 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §9 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2669d21f09\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.6 §9 ¶5\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.6-9-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §9 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §9 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶5</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"4\">\n<li>Greet that classmate with <em>hello</em> or <em>good morning</em> plus their name.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"587e990655\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.6 §9 ¶6\" data-sec=\"9\" id=\"p-S.6-9-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §9 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §9 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§9 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Routing:</strong> 0 wrong = light E3. 1–2 wrong = full path. 3 wrong = S004 door practice, then return.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b2a0279bfc\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶0\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E3: Core teaching conversation</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2fdb2dd7ea\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶1\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Kru Sopheak holds a picture book. Default learner role: Bora.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4e16f1e21e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶2\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Audio: recording <em>please and thank you</em> (to be recorded)</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶3\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"bc484c8eab\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶4\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Listen first. Echo the two new words when you replay.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ba33876e69\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶5\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> Hello, teacher.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b92bfbc3ec\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶6\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Kru Sopheak:</strong> Hello, Bora.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"dbc4e7f942\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶7\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> A book, please.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"cbd9e2c598\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶8\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Kru Sopheak:</strong> Yes.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"79be06a1f9\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶9\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> Thank you.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶10\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a90ad05243\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"11\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶11\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-11\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶11\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶11 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶11</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Sreyneang:</strong> A book, please.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b58bb07e2c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"12\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶12\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-12\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶12\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶12 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶12</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Bora:</strong> Yes.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"edd6cc1595\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"13\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶13\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-13\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶13\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶13 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶13</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Sreyneang:</strong> Thank you.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a783038e38\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"14\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶14\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-14\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶14\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶14 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶14</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Kru Sopheak:</strong> She is Sreyneang. He is Bora.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"15\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶15\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-15\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶15\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶15 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶15</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"a570d9a36f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"16\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶16\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-16\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶16\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶16 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶16</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Give a real book or pencil to a classmate, not to you.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b4cd6177be\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"17\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶17\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-17\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶17\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶17 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶17</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Child A:</strong> A book, please.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"94a73d542b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"18\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶18\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-18\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶18\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶18 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶18</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Child B:</strong> Yes.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c6f1bd0019\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"19\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶19\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-19\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶19\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶19 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶19</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Child A:</strong> Thank you.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"20\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶20\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-20\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶20\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶20 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶20</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"4b2d8c8fa3\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"21\" data-ref=\"S.6 §10 ¶21\" data-sec=\"10\" id=\"p-S.6-10-21\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §10 ¶21\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §10 ¶21 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§10 ¶21</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Please</em> is for the ask. <em>Thank you</em> is for the receive. If you only say one, the pair is not finished.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"d10e9904fa\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §11 ¶0\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.6-11-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §11 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §11 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E4: Going further</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §11 ¶1\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.6-11-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §11 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §11 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7b64841cad\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §11 ¶2\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.6-11-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §11 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §11 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Why this works</strong>\nBora does not take the book. He asks. Kru Sopheak answers <em>Yes</em> and gives it. <em>Thank you</em> closes the exchange. Sreyneang then asks Bora — the same pair works child to child.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §11 ¶3\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.6-11-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §11 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §11 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c935c520ee\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.6 §11 ¶4\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.6-11-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §11 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §11 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Watch out for</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5693a0a67a\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.6 §11 ¶5\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.6-11-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §11 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §11 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶5</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><em>Please thank you</em> as one shout. Split: ask first, thank after the object moves.</li>\n<li>Grabbing while saying <em>please</em>. The word is not a magic pass. Wait for <em>Yes</em>.</li>\n<li><em>Can I have</em> copied from a parent. Smile. Stay on <em>A book, please.</em></li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.6 §11 ¶6\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.6-11-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §11 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §11 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"83fe7b77ee\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.6 §11 ¶7\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.6-11-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §11 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §11 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Cultural context</strong>\nKhmer <em>som</em> and <em>or kun</em> already teach this pair. English is mapping onto a habit many children have at home. Two hands when giving and receiving still belong here.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"48136dddf5\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.6 §11 ¶8\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.6-11-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §11 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §11 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Going further</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"900c798139\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.6 §11 ¶9\" data-sec=\"11\" id=\"p-S.6-11-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §11 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §11 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§11 ¶9</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>When do you say <em>please</em> at home?</li>\n<li>What do you say after Yeay gives you water?</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f7c6b8a70c\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §12 ¶0\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.6-12-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §12 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §12 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶0</button><h3 data-body=\"1\">Letters (MoEYS)</h3></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7077a01180\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §12 ¶1\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.6-12-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §12 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §12 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Card: letter card F f</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b9550c49b0\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §12 ¶2\" data-sec=\"12\" id=\"p-S.6-12-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §12 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §12 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§12 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Show <em>F f</em>. Name <em>F</em>, sound /f/. No session word — skip the hunt. Air-write, then copy <em>F f</em>. Do not add <em>fish</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e2f0c8f8c9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §13 ¶0\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.6-13-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §13 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §13 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E5: Teacher notes</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"69e059f56a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §13 ¶1\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.6-13-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §13 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §13 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>For the teacher.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c4fd7234c4\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §13 ¶2\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.6-13-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §13 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §13 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Lesson intent</strong>\nClose weeks 1–2 with a useful pair that will return in the classroom block. Greetings stay warm; <em>please</em> / <em>thank you</em> add care when something changes hands.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b230d097fd\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §13 ¶3\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.6-13-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §13 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §13 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>RTTI guidance</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"26eaaf8f4e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.6 §13 ¶4\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.6-13-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §13 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §13 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong> — Strong: both words, on request, not mixed. Weak: only <em>thank you</em> (more common from home English videos).</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6dce6ccd2d\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.6 §13 ¶5\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.6-13-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §13 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §13 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong> — Strong: ask → wait → receive → thank. Weak: words without the wait.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7d47dd423c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.6 §13 ¶6\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.6-13-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §13 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §13 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong> — Strong: classmate, or a home object named in Khmer. Weak: only works with you and the story book.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"10fbd1e5a3\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.6 §13 ¶7\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.6-13-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §13 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §13 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong> — Strong: child can point to the ask moment vs the receive moment. Weak: child thinks both words mean \"be good.\" Keep the two times separate.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2161bc2a7a\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.6 §13 ¶8\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.6-13-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §13 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §13 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Common errors</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c218202299\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.6 §13 ¶9\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.6-13-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §13 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §13 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶9</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li><em>Thank you please</em> after grabbing. Reset the object. Ask again.</li>\n<li>Very quiet <em>please</em> that the classmate cannot hear. Ask for one clearer try, not a louder performance.</li>\n<li>Using <em>he is</em> / <em>she is</em> as a greeting. Those stay for naming, not for asking.</li>\n</ul></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"1e3e42e9f4\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.6 §13 ¶10\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.6-13-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §13 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §13 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reach-ahead</strong>\n<em>Can I have …?</em> — week 22. Classroom object names as reproduce — week 20.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"c6d1c4454c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"11\" data-ref=\"S.6 §13 ¶11\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.6-13-11\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §13 ¶11\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §13 ¶11 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶11</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Cultural notes</strong>\nA child who <em>sampeahs</em> instead of saying <em>thank you</em> has the value. Add the English word beside the gesture. Do not replace the gesture.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7365e62f3b\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"12\" data-ref=\"S.6 §13 ¶12\" data-sec=\"13\" id=\"p-S.6-13-12\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §13 ¶12\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §13 ¶12 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§13 ¶12</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\nToday <strong>F f</strong>. Name, /f/, copy. No session word. Do not add <em>fish</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"49bdda0e0e\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §14 ¶0\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.6-14-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §14 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §14 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E6: Practice</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §14 ¶1\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.6-14-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §14 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §14 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e99706e0a6\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §14 ¶2\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.6-14-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §14 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §14 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">You hold one book. Each child: <em>A book, please.</em> You: <em>Yes.</em> Child: <em>Thank you.</em> Child holds it for a breath, then gives it back when you say <em>please</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §14 ¶3\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.6-14-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §14 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §14 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"aa938b7233\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.6 §14 ¶4\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.6-14-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §14 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §14 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\">Pairs with a pencil or leaf. Same three lines. Then, if you want a home bridge: <em>Water, please</em> to you as Yeay.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.6 §14 ¶5\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.6-14-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §14 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §14 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"140b965ca3\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.6 §14 ¶6\" data-sec=\"14\" id=\"p-S.6-14-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §14 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §14 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§14 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\nAir-write <strong>F f</strong>, then copy. No extra word.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9e9a020100\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §15 ¶0\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.6-15-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §15 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §15 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E7: Exit check</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"0baff986e0\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §15 ¶1\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.6-15-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §15 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §15 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Eight spoken checks, two per category, plus one letter check. Pass on Reproduction and Training (at least 3 of those 4) and the letter check. Transfer and Insight are watched — they do not block a pass.</em></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §15 ¶2\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.6-15-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §15 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §15 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e9c63a6d50\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §15 ¶3\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.6-15-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §15 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §15 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶3</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li>Says <em>please</em>.</li>\n<li>Says <em>thank you</em>.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.6 §15 ¶4\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.6-15-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §15 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §15 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f29927c461\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.6 §15 ¶5\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.6-15-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §15 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §15 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶5</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"3\">\n<li>Asks with <em>please</em> before the object moves.</li>\n<li>Says <em>thank you</em> after receiving, not before.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.6 §15 ¶6\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.6-15-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §15 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §15 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7f9e2bbfeb\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.6 §15 ¶7\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.6-15-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §15 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §15 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶7</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"5\">\n<li>Uses the pair with a classmate.</li>\n<li>Uses <em>please</em> or <em>thank you</em> in a new micro-scene (pencil, water, or door).</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.6 §15 ¶8\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.6-15-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §15 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §15 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8895b41a48\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.6 §15 ¶9\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.6-15-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §15 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §15 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶9</button><ol data-body=\"1\" start=\"7\">\n<li>Points to the ask when you say <em>please</em>.</li>\n<li>Points to the receive when you say <em>thank you</em> — or says in Khmer that one is for asking and one is for after.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"63ac59ba4f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.6 §15 ¶10\" data-sec=\"15\" id=\"p-S.6-15-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §15 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §15 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§15 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Letters</strong>\n9. Points to <strong>F f</strong> (letter card F f) and copies it (air-write counts).</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"66ba33e460\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §16 ¶0\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.6-16-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §16 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §16 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E8: Formative evaluation and reformat</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"82a85f5845\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §16 ¶1\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.6-16-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §16 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §16 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">[Name], you can ask and you can thank. That pair will come back when we name classroom things.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"2eccf29380\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §16 ¶2\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.6-16-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §16 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §16 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reformat triggers</strong> — E3 only. Max two.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §16 ¶3\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.6-16-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §16 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §16 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6b898156a4\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.6 §16 ¶4\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.6-16-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §16 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §16 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction weak:</strong> Only <em>please</em> and <em>thank you</em> with you, no book name.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.6 §16 ¶5\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.6-16-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §16 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §16 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"078160a14e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.6 §16 ¶6\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.6-16-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §16 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §16 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training weak:</strong> You keep the book. One child, three lines, twice.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.6 §16 ¶7\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.6-16-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §16 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §16 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"717406642e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.6 §16 ¶8\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.6-16-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §16 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §16 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer weak:</strong> Stay with you. Skip the classmate pass.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"9\" data-ref=\"S.6 §16 ¶9\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.6-16-9\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §16 ¶9\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §16 ¶9 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶9</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9e2db53e0c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"10\" data-ref=\"S.6 §16 ¶10\" data-sec=\"16\" id=\"p-S.6-16-10\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §16 ¶10\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §16 ¶10 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§16 ¶10</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight weak:</strong> Two pictures or two hands: ask / receive. No spoken rule.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b170a2e736\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §17 ¶0\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.6-17-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §17 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §17 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">E9: Feed forward</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6761c7d122\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §17 ¶1\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.6-17-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §17 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §17 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Reproduction (R)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"8aa8c54e39\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §17 ¶2\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.6-17-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §17 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §17 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">Say <em>please</em> once and <em>thank you</em> once today — at snack or at the door. Air-write <em>F</em> once.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"5e305d463f\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §17 ¶3\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.6-17-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §17 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §17 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Training (T1)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"be9a215448\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"4\" data-ref=\"S.6 §17 ¶4\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.6-17-4\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §17 ¶4\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §17 ¶4 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶4</button><p data-body=\"1\">You know the two words. Next time wait for <em>Yes</em>, then <em>thank you</em>.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"7222f0d48e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"5\" data-ref=\"S.6 §17 ¶5\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.6-17-5\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §17 ¶5\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §17 ¶5 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶5</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Transfer (T2)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9bb07d28e1\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"6\" data-ref=\"S.6 §17 ¶6\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.6-17-6\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §17 ¶6\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §17 ¶6 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶6</button><p data-body=\"1\">Try <em>please</em> with a friend, or <em>thank you</em> with Yeay at home.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"efd1b9353c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"7\" data-ref=\"S.6 §17 ¶7\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.6-17-7\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §17 ¶7\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §17 ¶7 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶7</button><p data-body=\"1\"><strong>Insight (I)</strong></p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"46269b224e\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"8\" data-ref=\"S.6 §17 ¶8\" data-sec=\"17\" id=\"p-S.6-17-8\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §17 ¶8\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §17 ¶8 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§17 ¶8</button><p data-body=\"1\"><em>Please</em> is the ask. <em>Thank you</em> is after you receive. The two times are different.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"81640ecdaf\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §18 ¶0\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.6-18-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §18 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §18 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Teacher-led session (one study hour, 40 min)</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"27356fb17e\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §18 ¶1\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.6-18-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §18 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §18 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶1</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Step</th>\n<th>Minutes</th>\n<th>What happens</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>E1 Theme and feed up</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Show the picture, say the learning goal, point to the five cues.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2 Entry readiness</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Quick check; route pupils as in E2.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E3 Core conversation</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>Teacher in role; the class answers, then small groups.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E4 Going further</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Watch-out points and the cultural note.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E6 Practice and letter</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Role-play in pairs; air-write and copy the letter.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E7 Exit check</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Spoken checks with a sample of pupils; note the RTTI categories.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E8–E9 Reformat and feed forward</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Back to the five cues; one feed-forward message per pupil or group.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"30e5cd2054\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §18 ¶2\" data-sec=\"18\" id=\"p-S.6-18-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §18 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §18 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§18 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">E5 is for the teacher before the session.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"86b4ba2ff9\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §19 ¶0\" data-sec=\"19\" id=\"p-S.6-19-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §19 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §19 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§19 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Story</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-scene\" data-h=\"da39a3ee5e\" data-kind=\"scene\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §19 ¶1\" data-sec=\"19\" id=\"p-S.6-19-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §19 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §19 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§19 ¶1</button><div class=\"tli-scene-player\" data-body=\"1\" data-scene=\"scenes/s006.json\"></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"e9029a8cd7\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §20 ¶0\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.6-20-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §20 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §20 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Self-paced app session</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"bfd1b262df\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §20 ¶1\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.6-20-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §20 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §20 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶1</button><ol data-body=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Listen:</strong> the classroom picture with the dialogue; tap a person to hear the line again.</li>\n<li><strong>Ask and thank:</strong> the app holds out a book or a pencil; the pupil records <em>A book, please.</em> and then <em>Thank you.</em> when it is given.</li>\n<li><strong>Right order:</strong> drag <em>please</em> to the asking picture and <em>thank you</em> to the receiving picture.</li>\n<li><strong>Letter card:</strong> tap <strong>F f</strong> (name and sound /f/); trace F f. No extra word.</li>\n<li><strong>Quiz:</strong> five questions.</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f3d39f2141\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §20 ¶2\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.6-20-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §20 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §20 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶2</button><p data-body=\"1\">The learner story above is the JSON scene player (<code>scenes/s006.json</code>); edit that file to change lines or timing without rebuilding Markdown.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"6df6c9f3e3\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §20 ¶3\" data-sec=\"20\" id=\"p-S.6-20-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §20 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §20 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§20 ¶3</button><p data-body=\"1\">The app shows the five cues at the start and the feed-forward message from E9 at the end.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"25c86f6a92\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §21 ¶0\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.6-21-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §21 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §21 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">Quiz</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"f331673cc7\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §21 ¶1\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.6-21-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §21 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §21 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Each question checks one success criterion in one RTTI category. After <strong>Check</strong>, the quiz shows the result per criterion and what to try next.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-table\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"411bcf40d8\" data-kind=\"table\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §21 ¶2\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.6-21-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §21 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §21 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶2</button><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\" data-body=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Success criterion</th>\n<th>RTTI</th>\n<th>Question</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1 Reproduction</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 Training</td>\n<td>T1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 Transfer</td>\n<td>T2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 Insight</td>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 Letter F f</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-quiz\" data-h=\"9d2e9e2928\" data-kind=\"quiz\" data-modes=\"designer teacher student\" data-par=\"3\" data-ref=\"S.6 §21 ¶3\" data-sec=\"21\" id=\"p-S.6-21-3\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §21 ¶3\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §21 ¶3 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§21 ¶3</button><div aria-label=\"Quiz\" class=\"quiz\" data-body=\"1\" role=\"group\"><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"R\" data-q=\"1\" data-sc=\"SC1\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">1.</span> 📖 Bora wants the book. What does he say?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 1 · RTTI level R</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">A book, thank you.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Thank you comes after you get it. To ask, say: A book, please.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">A book, please.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Please goes with the ask.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Good morning, book.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">We greet people, not books. Say: A book, please.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"T1\" data-q=\"2\" data-sc=\"SC2\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">2.</span> Kru Sopheak gives Bora the book. What does Bora say now?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 2 · RTTI level T1</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Thank you, teacher.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Thank you when you receive.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Please, teacher.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Please was for asking. Now say: Thank you.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Hello, teacher.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">You are already talking. Now say: Thank you.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"T2\" data-q=\"3\" data-sc=\"SC3\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">3.</span> ✏️ Your classmate has a pencil. You need it. What do you say?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 3 · RTTI level T2</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Pencil!</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is a grab with words. Add please: A pencil, please.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">A pencil, please.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Same pair, new thing.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">Thank you, pencil.</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Ask first: A pencil, please. Thank you comes after.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"I\" data-q=\"4\" data-sc=\"SC4\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">4.</span> Sreyneang says \"A book, please.\" She gets the book. What is missing?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 4 · RTTI level I</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">nothing at all</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">The pair is not finished. She still needs thank you.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">hello and goodbye</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">They are already talking. The missing word is thank you.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">the words thank you</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! Please and thank you are a pair.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"quiz-q\" data-level=\"R\" data-q=\"5\" data-sc=\"SC5\"><legend class=\"quiz-stem\"><span class=\"quiz-qn\">5.</span> 🔤 Which card is the letter F f?</legend><div class=\"quiz-tag small text-body-secondary\">Criterion 5 · RTTI level R</div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">E e</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is E e. Find F f.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"0\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">D d</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">That is D d. Find F f.</div></div><div class=\"quiz-opt\" data-correct=\"1\"><label><input type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/> <span class=\"quiz-txt\">F f</span></label><span class=\"quiz-mark\"></span><div class=\"quiz-expl\" hidden=\"\">Yes! F f. The sound is /f/.</div></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-result\"></div></fieldset><div class=\"quiz-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary quiz-check\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-check-double\"></i> Check</button><button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary quiz-retry\" hidden=\"\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate-left\"></i> Try again</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-score\" role=\"status\"></span></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"quiz-rtti\" hidden=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"blk blk-heading\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"b8efd777f4\" data-kind=\"heading\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"0\" data-ref=\"S.6 §22 ¶0\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.6-22-0\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §22 ¶0\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §22 ¶0 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶0</button><h2 data-body=\"1\">CEFR cross-reference</h2></div><div class=\"blk blk-paragraph\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"9ace50ee5c\" data-kind=\"paragraph\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"1\" data-ref=\"S.6 §22 ¶1\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.6-22-1\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §22 ¶1\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §22 ¶1 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶1</button><p data-body=\"1\">Secondary reference only. Pre-A1 can-do statements adapted from the CEFR Companion Volume (2020); not an official CEFR test.</p></div><div class=\"blk blk-list\" data-editable=\"1\" data-h=\"ae9172b938\" data-kind=\"list\" data-modes=\"designer teacher\" data-par=\"2\" data-ref=\"S.6 §22 ¶2\" data-sec=\"22\" id=\"p-S.6-22-2\"><button aria-label=\"Reference S.6 §22 ¶2\" class=\"ref\" title=\"S.6 §22 ¶2 (click to copy the reference and show actions)\" type=\"button\">§22 ¶2</button><ul data-body=\"1\">\n<li>I can ask for something with <em>please</em> and say <em>thank you</em>.</li>\n<li>I can recognise the letter F f.</li>\n</ul></div>"}], "pages": {"help": "<h1>Help</h1>\n<p>This is a <strong>review reader</strong> for <em>tli.cloud: English in Cambodia</em>. You can read every part, propose changes, propose removals and leave comments. Everything you do is saved <strong>only in this browser on this device</strong> until you export it.</p>\n<h2>Modes: Designer, Teacher, Student</h2>\n<p>The <strong>Mode</strong> menu in the top bar switches the view. The choice is remembered in this browser. A link can open a mode: add <code>?mode=designer</code>, <code>?mode=teacher</code> or <code>?mode=student</code> to the address (for example <code>index.html?mode=student#d-S.1</code>), or end the hash with <code>&amp;mode=student</code> (<code>#d-S.1&amp;mode=student</code>). A mode in the link wins over the remembered one and is remembered from then on.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Designer</strong> – everything: editing, comments, proposed removals, My feedback and export, editor notes, the Plan tab, all tables, the RTTI rubric, the teacher and app plans, the quiz with tags, and the CEFR note.</li>\n<li><strong>Teacher</strong> – read-only. No editing, comment or export tools, no editor notes, no Plan or My feedback tab. Shows the course overview (L.0) and, per session, Feed up with goals and success criteria, the RTTI rubric, the teacher plan (E1–E9), the CEFR note and the quiz as an answer key: criterion and RTTI tags, the correct answer marked and the feedback for every answer.</li>\n<li><strong>Student</strong> – only what the learner sees: the letter card and story hook, the learning goal and success criteria in pupil words (English and Khmer, without the RTTI column), the words with Khmer, the <strong>story player</strong> (JSON scene player), and the quiz. Course-instruction headings such as “Feed up (E1…)” and “Self-paced app session” are hidden. In the quiz the learner taps an answer and sees the feedback at once; after the last question a short score appears, with Try again. No tags, rubric, teacher plan, editor notes, CEFR note or Plan tab. L.0 is not listed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A reference to a paragraph that the open mode does not show becomes plain text (dotted underline) instead of a broken link.</p>\n<p>The review copy on the web opens in <strong>Teacher</strong> mode; the course team's own build opens in <strong>Designer</strong> mode.</p>\n<h3>Marking content for a mode (for authors)</h3>\n<p>By default a block is shown in Designer and Teacher mode. Put a range of blocks between marker lines, each with a blank line before and after:</p>\n<pre><code>::: student\n\n## Story\n\n&lt;div class=\"tli-scene-player\" data-scene=\"scenes/s001.json\"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n:::\n</code></pre>\n<p><code>::: student</code> shows the range in all three modes, <code>::: teacher</code> in Designer and Teacher (the default), <code>::: designer</code> only in Designer. Ranges cannot be nested. Editor notes are always Designer only. <code>check_course.py</code> reports unknown, unclosed or unspaced markers.</p>\n<h2>Audio and subtitles</h2>\n<p>Top-bar settings (remembered in this browser):</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Audio</strong> – default <strong>off</strong> (bypass). When off, the story player never plays sound and never uses speech synthesis. When on, a scene line with an <code>audio</code> URL is played; if the file is missing, only the subtitle is shown. A link can set it: <code>?audio=on</code> or <code>?audio=off</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>English subtitles (EN)</strong> – default <strong>on</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Khmer subtitles (ខ្មែរ)</strong> – default <strong>on</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>EN and Khmer are independent: either, both, or neither. When both are off, the subtitle bar is hidden; click-to-repeat still re-triggers the line (and would play audio if Audio were on). The same controls also sit on the story player’s control bar.</p>\n<h2>Story player (JSON scenes)</h2>\n<p>Interactive conversations use a <strong>YouTube-like</strong> player: a 16:9 stage, captions overlaid at the bottom of the stage, and a control bar underneath (Play/Pause, Previous, Next, a progress bar through the whole conversation’s timing, scene counter, Audio, EN, Khmer).</p>\n<p>Scene data is plain JSON under <code>assets/scenes/</code> (for example <code>s001.json</code>). It is <strong>not</strong> compiled into <code>data.js</code>. Change a JSON file or swap a PNG under <code>assets/media/</code> and reload — no Markdown rebuild is needed for the story itself. Markdown only mounts the player:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;div class=\"tli-scene-player\" data-scene=\"scenes/s001.json\"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n</code></pre>\n<p>The component <code>fetch</code>es that file at runtime (paths are relative to <code>assets/</code>).</p>\n<h3>Timing</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>defaultDurationMs</code> – conversation default for how long a scene plays before auto-advance.</li>\n<li><code>durationMs</code> (per scene) – pacing for that line. Always honour these milliseconds while audio is bypassed; later, if audio is on and <code>durationMs</code> is omitted, the player may use the audio file’s length.</li>\n<li><code>delayMs</code> (optional, per scene) – pause before the line’s timer.</li>\n<li>Pause freezes the current scene timer; Play resumes it. The progress bar is elapsed time across the sum of each scene’s <code>delayMs + durationMs</code>. Scrubbing jumps to the scene at that time.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Actors and sprites</h3>\n<p>Actors (people or animals) list named sprites (<code>idle</code>, <code>speak</code>, …). Each scene placement sets <code>id</code>, <code>sprite</code>, <code>x</code>/<code>y</code> (percent of the stage; bottom-centre anchor), and optional <code>scale</code> / <code>facing</code>. Click the current speaker to repeat the line (subtitle languages that are on, plus audio if Audio is on). Full schema: <code>assets/scenes/README.md</code>. Khmer dialogue lines are draft Grade-1 wording pending native-speaker check.</p>\n<h2>Reading</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The <strong>Parts</strong> list on the left (the ☰ button on a phone) opens one part at a time.</li>\n<li>Every block has a reference in the margin, like <strong>§2 ¶3</strong>. Section 0 is the part title and the text before the first <code>##</code> heading. Each <code>##</code>/<code>###</code> heading starts a new section and is ¶0 of it. The full reference is <code>PART §section ¶paragraph</code>, for example <code>L.3 §2 ¶3</code>.</li>\n<li>Click a reference to copy it and to show the action buttons (useful on touch screens).</li>\n<li><strong>Editor notes</strong> for the open part are in the right-hand panel (below the text on small screens). They are never shown in the lesson text.</li>\n<li><strong>Search</strong> in the top bar searches all parts. Click a result to jump to the paragraph.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Editing a paragraph</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Click a paragraph, heading, list item or table cell (or use the ✎ button). It turns yellow.</li>\n<li>Type your change. <strong>Enter</strong> saves (in lists Enter starts a new item; use <strong>Ctrl+Enter</strong> to save). <strong>Shift+Enter</strong> makes a line break. <strong>Esc</strong> cancels.</li>\n<li><strong>Save</strong>, <strong>Cancel</strong> or <strong>Reset to source</strong>. An edited block is marked <em>Edited</em> with a brown bar; <em>Show original</em> lets you compare.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Only one block can be edited at a time. Use <strong>Editing on/off</strong> in the top bar to read without accidental edits. Links still work with a normal click.</p>\n<p>If the source text changes after you edited it (a new build), the block shows <strong>Source changed since…</strong> and your edit is not applied. You can <em>Edit again</em> or <em>Discard</em>. The item stays in your feedback until you remove it.</p>\n<h2>Removing and commenting</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>🗑 <strong>Propose removal</strong>: the block is struck through. Click <strong>Restore</strong> to undo. The original text is recorded for the export.</li>\n<li>💬 <strong>Comment</strong>: write a note; it appears under the block with a blue bar.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>My feedback and export</h2>\n<p>The <strong>My feedback</strong> tab lists all your changes, removals and comments, grouped by part, with counts and links back to the text. Each item has <strong>Undo</strong> / <strong>Delete</strong>. <strong>Clear all</strong> asks for confirmation first.</p>\n<p>Export with <strong>Copy to clipboard</strong>, <strong>Download .md</strong> or <strong>Download .json</strong> and send the file to the editor. The Markdown export looks like this:</p>\n<pre><code># Feedback on tli.cloud: English in Cambodia\nExported 2026-11-04 14:05 · reader built 2026-11-04 12:00 · reader v1.0\nContent: 1 changes, 1 removed, 1 comments\n## L.1 Lesson 1: Hello!\n### L.1 §1 ¶2 — CHANGED\nBefore: \"old text\"\nAfter: \"new text\"\n### L.1 §1 ¶3 — REMOVED\nBefore: \"text\"\n- L.1 §2 ¶1 — COMMENT: my comment\n  &gt; «start of the paragraph»\n</code></pre>\n<p>Table edits are exported as a whole Markdown table; list edits as the whole list.</p>\n<h2>Images and markers (for authors)</h2>\n<p>Put an image on its own line in the Markdown:</p>\n<table class=\"table table-sm table-bordered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Markdown</th>\n<th>Result</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>![Alt text](images/x.svg)</code></td>\n<td>floats right, at most 40% wide and about 18rem high</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>![Alt text](images/x.svg){right}</code></td>\n<td>same as the default</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>![Alt text](images/x.svg){left}</code></td>\n<td>floats left</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>![Alt text](images/x.svg){full}</code></td>\n<td>full width, no float</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Two images in a row are stacked, never side by side. Headings, tables, quizzes and code always start below a floating image. On phones (narrower than 576px) nothing floats. The alt text is required: it is the caption in the lightbox and is read by screen readers.</p>\n<h2>Lightbox</h2>\n<p>Click or tap an image to enlarge it on a dark background (up to 95% of the screen; small images are enlarged up to 2×). The caption is the alt text. Close with the <strong>✕</strong> button, <strong>Esc</strong>, or a click on the dark background. Pinch-zoom works on phones.</p>\n<h2>Colour tags in tables (for authors)</h2>\n<p>End a table cell with <code>{green}</code>, <code>{yellow}</code> or <code>{red}</code>. The cell gets a colour <strong>and</strong> an icon and a hidden text (\"rated green\") so the meaning does not depend on colour alone.</p>\n<h2>RTTI rubric layout</h2>\n<p>Each session's RTTI rubric has one row per success criterion. Column 1 is the criterion; columns 2–5 are the levels <strong>R – Reproduction</strong>, <strong>T1 – Training</strong>, <strong>T2 – Transfer</strong> and <strong>I – Insight</strong>. The criterion's level cell holds <em>Look for</em>, <em>If not yet</em>, <em>Say</em> (feed back) and <em>Next (E9)</em> (feed forward), ending with its colour; the other level cells show \"—\". Quiz tags such as <code>SC3 T2</code> match the row (criterion 3) and the column (T2). <code>check_course.py</code> checks this layout.</p>\n<h2>Quiz syntax (for authors)</h2>\n<pre><code>```quiz\nQ: What does CEFR describe?\n- [ ] A school timetable | No: CEFR does not set timetables.\n- [x] Levels of language ability from A1 to C2\n- [ ] A Cambodian exam | No: CEFR is European and used worldwide.\n```\n</code></pre>\n<ul>\n<li><code>Q:</code> starts a question. Each option is <code>- [ ] text | explanation</code>; mark exactly one correct option with <code>- [x]</code>.</li>\n<li>At least 3 options per question, and every wrong option needs an explanation after <code>|</code>.</li>\n<li>There is one <strong>Check</strong> button per quiz. After checking you see ✔ or ✘ per question, the explanation under a wrong answer, \"N of M correct\", \"Not answered\" for skipped questions, and <strong>Try again</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Editor notes (for authors)</h2>\n<p>Write notes for editors as an HTML comment <code>&lt;!-- … --&gt;</code> or a fenced block with the language <code>EDITOR-NOTE</code>. They are removed from the lesson text and shown in the Editor notes panel.</p>\n<h2>Privacy</h2>\n<p>Nothing is sent anywhere. Your feedback is stored in this browser's local storage; clearing browser data deletes it, so export first.</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>reader v1.6.0 · built 2026-11-06 09:02</p>\n<h2>Feed-up quizzes</h2>\n<p>A quiz question can carry a tag line right after <code>Q:</code>, for example <code>Tag: SC2 T1</code>: success criterion 2, RTTI level T1 (levels R, T1, T2, I). Tag all questions of a quiz or none. After <strong>Check</strong>, the quiz shows per criterion which levels were reached and what to try next.</p>\n", "changes": "<h2>Plan</h2><p>This is a review copy of the course. The change log and the list of open items are kept by the course team and are not part of this copy.</p>", "openItems": ""}, "stats": {"parts": 7, "blocks": 900, "images": 6, "quizzes": 6, "questions": 30, "notes": 23, "links_internal": 6, "links_external": 0, "cell_tags": 30}};
